Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.81,0:01:24.44,*ENG,2,0,0,0,,I should've known that you would be here
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.95,0:01:27.11,*ENG,3,0,0,0,,Professor McGonagall.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.09,0:01:40.08,*ENG,4,0,0,0,,Good evening, Professor Dumbledore.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.73,0:01:46.86,*ENG,5,0,0,0,,Are the rumors true, Albus?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.04,0:01:48.97,*ENG,6,0,0,0,,I'm afraid so, professor.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.50,0:01:52.20,*ENG,7,0,0,0,,The good and the bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.51,0:01:53.84,*ENG,8,0,0,0,,And the boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.01,0:01:55.53,*ENG,9,0,0,0,,Hagrid is bringing him.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.88,0:02:00.24,*ENG,10,0,0,0,,Is it wise to trust Hagrid with something so important?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.35,0:02:04.55,*ENG,11,0,0,0,,Professor, I would trust Hagrid with my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.21,0:02:26.83,*ENG,12,0,0,0,,Professor Dumbledore, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.01,0:02:28.14,*ENG,13,0,0,0,,Professor McGonagall.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.21,0:02:30.64,*ENG,14,0,0,0,,No problems, I trust, Hagrid?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.78,0:02:32.01,*ENG,15,0,0,0,,No, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.51,0:02:36.21,*ENG,16,0,0,0,,Little tyke fell asleep as we were flying over Bristol.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.82,0:02:39.31,*ENG,17,0,0,0,,Try not to wake him.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.06,0:02:42.35,*ENG,18,0,0,0,,There you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.23,0:02:53.26,*ENG,19,0,0,0,,Do you really think it's safe,leaving him with these people?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.30,0:02:54.83,*ENG,20,0,0,0,,I've watched them all day.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.94,0:02:58.43,*ENG,21,0,0,0,,They're the worst sort of Muggles.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.81,0:03:03.01,*ENG,22,0,0,0,,- They really are... - The only family he has.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.18,0:03:04.91,*ENG,23,0,0,0,,He'll be famous
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.01,0:03:08.21,*ENG,24,0,0,0,,Every child in our world will know his name
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.32,0:03:09.48,*ENG,25,0,0,0,,Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.12,0:03:13.61,*ENG,26,0,0,0,,He's far better off growing up away from all of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.86,0:03:19.16,*ENG,27,0,0,0,,Until he's ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.64,0:03:33.44,*ENG,28,0,0,0,,There, there, Hagrid.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.54,0:03:36.17,*ENG,29,0,0,0,,It's not really goodbye, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.15,0:03:48.62,*ENG,30,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.96,0:03:50.22,*ENG,31,0,0,0,,Good luck...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.99,0:03:53.48,*ENG,32,0,0,0,,...Harry Potter.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.37,0:04:04.70,*ENG,33,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.35,0:04:13.78,*ENG,34,0,0,0,,Up. Get up!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.92,0:04:17.91,*ENG,35,0,0,0,,Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.07,0:04:35.26,*ENG,36,0,0,0,,Wake up, cousin! We're going to the zoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.38,0:04:50.01,*ENG,37,0,0,0,,Here he comes, the birthday boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.12,0:04:52.08,*ENG,38,0,0,0,,Happy birthday, son.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.96,0:04:57.42,*ENG,39,0,0,0,,Cook breakfast.And try not to burn anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.63,0:04:58.49,*ENG,40,0,0,0,,Yes, Aunt Petunia.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.59,0:05:02.26,*ENG,41,0,0,0,,I want everything to be perfect...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.40,0:05:05.53,*ENG,42,0,0,0,,...for my Dudley's special day!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.63,0:05:06.57,*ENG,43,0,0,0,,Hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.00,0:05:08.26,*ENG,44,0,0,0,,Bring my coffee, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.37,0:05:09.36,*ENG,45,0,0,0,,Yes, Uncle Vernon.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.27,0:05:13.64,*ENG,46,0,0,0,,Aren't they wonderful, darling?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.91,0:05:18.21,*ENG,47,0,0,0,,How many are there?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.31,0:05:20.25,*ENG,48,0,0,0,,36. Counted them myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.35,0:05:24.22,*ENG,49,0,0,0,,36?! But last year I had 37!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.32,0:05:26.85,*ENG,50,0,0,0,,But some are bigger than last year's.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.95,0:05:28.18,*ENG,51,0,0,0,,I don't care!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.29,0:05:31.36,*ENG,52,0,0,0,,This is what we're going to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.46,0:05:34.95,*ENG,53,0,0,0,,We're going to buy you two new presents. How's that, pumpkin?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.67,0:05:39.69,*ENG,54,0,0,0,,It should be a lovely day at the zoo.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.80,0:05:42.19,*ENG,55,0,0,0,,I'm really looking forward to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.04,0:05:48.17,*ENG,56,0,0,0,,I'm warning you now, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.31,0:05:51.90,*ENG,57,0,0,0,,Any funny business, any at all...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.01,0:05:55.61,*ENG,58,0,0,0,,...and you won't have any meals for a week.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.72,0:05:56.68,*ENG,59,0,0,0,,Get in.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.02,0:06:00.95,*ENG,60,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.76,0:06:06.23,*ENG,61,0,0,0,,Make it move.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.70,0:06:10.82,*ENG,62,0,0,0,,Move!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.57,0:06:13.23,*ENG,63,0,0,0,,- Move! - He's asleep!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.30,0:06:15.83,*ENG,64,0,0,0,,He's boring.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.37,0:06:22.71,*ENG,65,0,0,0,,Sorry about him.He doesn't understand what it's like,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.81,0:06:25.14,*ENG,66,0,0,0,,lying there...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.28,0:06:28.51,*ENG,67,0,0,0,,...watching people press their ugly faces in on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.79,0:06:33.55,*ENG,68,0,0,0,,Can you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.99,0:06:38.39,*ENG,69,0,0,0,,It's just,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.49,0:06:40.93,*ENG,70,0,0,0,,I've never taliked to a snake before.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.46,0:06:43.02,*ENG,71,0,0,0,,Do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.13,0:06:46.46,*ENG,72,0,0,0,,Do you talk to people often?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.20,0:06:50.03,*ENG,73,0,0,0,,You're from Burma,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.34,0:06:53.50,*ENG,74,0,0,0,,aren't you? Was it nice there? Do you miss your family?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.81,0:06:56.57,*ENG,75,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.08,0:06:58.48,*ENG,76,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.61,0:07:02.07,*ENG,77,0,0,0,,That's me as well. I never knew my parents either.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.18,0:07:03.65,*ENG,78,0,0,0,,Mummy, Dad, you won't believe
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.75,0:07:06.08,*ENG,79,0,0,0,,what this snake is doing!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.01,0:07:31.44,*ENG,80,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.31,0:07:33.51,*ENG,81,0,0,0,,Anytime.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.19,0:07:38.71,*ENG,82,0,0,0,,Snake!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.60,0:07:59.04,*ENG,83,0,0,0,,Mum! Mummy! Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.14,0:08:01.73,*ENG,84,0,0,0,,My darling boy! How did you get in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.84,0:08:04.87,*ENG,85,0,0,0,,Who did this? How did you get in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.05,0:08:07.54,*ENG,86,0,0,0,,Is there a snake?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.72,0:08:13.28,*ENG,87,0,0,0,,It's all right, sweetheart.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.39,0:08:15.92,*ENG,88,0,0,0,,We'll get you out of these cold clothes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.49,0:08:19.82,*ENG,89,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.93,0:08:21.69,*ENG,90,0,0,0,,I swear, I don't know!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.83,0:08:24.26,*ENG,91,0,0,0,,The glass was there and then it was gone,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.36,0:08:25.35,*ENG,92,0,0,0,,like magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.04,0:08:32.97,*ENG,93,0,0,0,,There's no such thing as magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.97,0:08:53.13,*ENG,94,0,0,0,,Vernon, look at him! l can't believe it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.37,0:08:55.81,*ENG,95,0,0,0,,ln a week, he'll be off to Smeltings.！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.00,0:09:00.39,*ENG,96,0,0,0,,Caveat Smeltonia. Proudest moment of my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.41,0:09:02.51,*ENG,97,0,0,0,,Will l have to wear that too?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.97,0:09:07.61,*ENG,98,0,0,0,,What? Go to Smeltings?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.39,0:09:15.61,*ENG,99,0,0,0,,Don't be stupid! You're going to the state school.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.73,0:09:19.25,*ENG,100,0,0,0,,This is what you'll wear when l finish dyeing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.91,0:09:24.58,*ENG,101,0,0,0,,That's Dudley's old uniform. lt'll fit like old elephant skin.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.60,0:09:29.97,*ENG,102,0,0,0,,Fit you well enough.Go get the post. Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.93,0:09:46.99,*ENG,103,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.88,0:10:03.68,*ENG,104,0,0,0,,Marge is ill. Ate a funny whelk.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.78,0:10:05.48,*ENG,105,0,0,0,,Dad, look! Harry's got a letter!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.58,0:10:06.91,*ENG,106,0,0,0,,It's mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.02,0:10:10.18,*ENG,107,0,0,0,,Yours? Who'd be writing to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.75,0:10:45.64,*ENG,108,0,0,0,,No more mail through this letterbox.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.20,0:11:00.17,*ENG,109,0,0,0,,Have a lovely day at the office, dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.67,0:11:06.07,*ENG,110,0,0,0,,Shoo! Go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.83,0:12:05.96,*ENG,111,0,0,0,,Fine day, Sunday.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.24,0:12:09.64,*ENG,112,0,0,0,,In my opinion, best day of the week.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.74,0:12:11.21,*ENG,113,0,0,0,,Why is that, Dudley?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.34,0:12:14.00,*ENG,114,0,0,0,,Because there's no post on Sundays?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.11,0:12:15.44,*ENG,115,0,0,0,,Right you are, Harry!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.81,0:12:18.48,*ENG,116,0,0,0,,No post on Sunday.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.02,0:12:25.35,*ENG,117,0,0,0,,No blasted letters today! No, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.46,0:12:29.98,*ENG,118,0,0,0,,Not one single bloody letter. Not one!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.64,0:12:42.73,*ENG,119,0,0,0,,No, sir, not one blasted, miserable...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.02,0:12:56.82,*ENG,120,0,0,0,,Make it stop, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.39,0:13:04.52,*ENG,121,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.63,0:13:06.93,*ENG,122,0,0,0,,Mummy, what's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.87,0:13:12.20,*ENG,CHS,0,0,0,,Give me that!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.60,0:13:15.67,*ENG,124,0,0,0,,Give me that letter!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.74,0:13:19.11,*ENG,125,0,0,0,,Get off!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.21,0:13:26.65,*ENG,126,0,0,0,,They're my letters! Let go of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.12,0:13:31.08,*ENG,127,0,0,0,,That's it! We're going away!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.16,0:13:35.69,*ENG,128,0,0,0,,Far away, where they can't find us!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.79,0:13:37.95,*ENG,129,0,0,0,,Daddy's gone mad, hasn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.95,0:14:06.32,*ENG,130,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.76,0:14:15.39,*ENG,131,0,0,0,,Make a wish, Harry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.28,0:14:33.31,*ENG,132,0,0,0,,Who's there?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.36,0:14:48.29,*ENG,133,0,0,0,,Sorry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.81,0:14:57.87,*ENG,134,0,0,0,,I demand that you leave at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.98,0:14:59.64,*ENG,135,0,0,0,,You are breaking and entering.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.11,0:15:06.14,*ENG,136,0,0,0,,Dry up, Dursley, you great prune.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.36,0:15:13.12,*ENG,137,0,0,0,,I haven't seen you since you was a baby,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.22,0:15:14.48,*ENG,138,0,0,0,,Harry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.63,0:15:16.59,*ENG,139,0,0,0,,You're a bit more along than I expected.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.69,0:15:18.09,*ENG,140,0,0,0,,Particularly in the middle.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.86,0:15:21.70,*ENG,141,0,0,0,,I'm not Harry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.47,0:15:26.06,*ENG,142,0,0,0,,I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.67,0:15:28.70,*ENG,143,0,0,0,,Well, of course you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.14,0:15:30.57,*ENG,144,0,0,0,,Got something for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.67,0:15:33.27,*ENG,145,0,0,0,,Afraid I sat on it, but
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.38,0:15:35.78,*ENG,146,0,0,0,,I imagine it'll taste fine just the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.48,0:15:41.52,*ENG,147,0,0,0,,Baked it myself, words and all.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.69,0:15:46.92,*ENG,148,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.03,0:15:48.92,*ENG,149,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.03,0:15:52.72,*ENG,150,0,0,0,,It's not every day your young man turns 11, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.38,0:16:11.35,*ENG,151,0,0,0,,Excuse me,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.45,0:16:12.61,*ENG,152,0,0,0,,but who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.72,0:16:16.45,*ENG,153,0,0,0,,Rubeus Hagrid, Keeper of Keys
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.55,0:16:17.78,*ENG,154,0,0,0,,and Grounds at Hogwarts.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.89,0:16:20.15,*ENG,155,0,0,0,,Of course, you know about Hogwarts.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.32,0:16:22.09,*ENG,156,0,0,0,,Sorry, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.19,0:16:26.26,*ENG,157,0,0,0,,Didn't you ever wonder where your mum and dad learned it all?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.13,0:16:28.72,*ENG,158,0,0,0,,Learned what?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.90,0:16:30.66,*ENG,159,0,0,0,,You're a wizard, Harry.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.50,0:16:33.83,*ENG,160,0,0,0,,I'm a what?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.94,0:16:38.14,*ENG,161,0,0,0,,A wizard.A good one, I'd wager,once you're trained up.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.24,0:16:39.90,*ENG,162,0,0,0,,No
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.01,0:16:41.17,*ENG,163,0,0,0,,you've made a mistake. I mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.28,0:16:44.61,*ENG,164,0,0,0,,...I can't be a wizard.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.02,0:16:47.21,*ENG,165,0,0,0,,I mean, I'm just
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.32,0:16:50.05,*ENG,166,0,0,0,,Harry. Just Harry.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.59,0:16:53.08,*ENG,167,0,0,0,,Well, Just Harry,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.19,0:16:54.95,*ENG,168,0,0,0,,did you ever make anything happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.06,0:16:58.46,*ENG,169,0,0,0,,Anything you couldn't explain, when you were angry or scared?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.11,0:17:17.51,*ENG,170,0,0,0,,"Dear Mr. Potter,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.61,0:17:19.21,*ENG,171,0,0,0,,We are pleased to accept you...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.32,0:17:22.81,*ENG,172,0,0,0,,...at Hogwarts School of Witchcraft and Wizardry."
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.92,0:17:25.25,*ENG,173,0,0,0,,He will not be going!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.36,0:17:26.09,*ENG,174,0,0,0,,We swore
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.15,0:17:27.98,*ENG,175,0,0,0,,we'd put a stop to all this rubbish.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.09,0:17:29.58,*ENG,176,0,0,0,,You knew?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.99,0:17:32.39,*ENG,177,0,0,0,,You knew all along and you never told me?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.50,0:17:33.96,*ENG,178,0,0,0,,Of course we knew.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.06,0:17:35.90,*ENG,179,0,0,0,,How could you not be?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.00,0:17:39.66,*ENG,180,0,0,0,,My perfect sister being who she was.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.87,0:17:45.47,*ENG,181,0,0,0,,My mother and father were so proud the day she got her letter.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.94,0:17:49.78,*ENG,182,0,0,0,,"We have a witch in the family.Isn't it wonderful?"
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.25,0:17:53.51,*ENG,183,0,0,0,,I was the only one to see her for what she was.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.62,0:17:55.95,*ENG,184,0,0,0,,A freak!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.15,0:17:59.15,*ENG,185,0,0,0,,Then she met that Potter,and then she had you...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.19,0:18:01.42,*ENG,186,0,0,0,,...and I knew you would be the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.42,0:18:05.06,*ENG,187,0,0,0,,Just as strange, just as abnormal.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.23,0:18:08.36,*ENG,188,0,0,0,,And then she got herself blown up,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.47,0:18:10.19,*ENG,189,0,0,0,,and we got landed with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.30,0:18:14.53,*ENG,190,0,0,0,,Blown up? You told me my parents died in a car crash.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.64,0:18:16.33,*ENG,191,0,0,0,,A car crash?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.74,0:18:18.33,*ENG,192,0,0,0,,A car crash killed Lily and James Potter?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.44,0:18:20.21,*ENG,193,0,0,0,,We had to say something.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.31,0:18:23.34,*ENG,194,0,0,0,,It's an outrage! A scandal!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.45,0:18:24.97,*ENG,195,0,0,0,,He'll not be going.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.08,0:18:29.52,*ENG,196,0,0,0,,A great Muggle like you is going to stop him?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.65,0:18:30.75,*ENG,197,0,0,0,,Muggle?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.85,0:18:32.08,*ENG,198,0,0,0,,Non-magic folk.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.19,0:18:34.65,*ENG,199,0,0,0,,This boy's had his name down since he were born.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.86,0:18:38.26,*ENG,200,0,0,0,,He's going to the finest school of witchcraft and wizardry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.36,0:18:43.19,*ENG,201,0,0,0,,He'll be under the finest headmaster Hogwarts has seen,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.30,0:18:45.00,*ENG,202,0,0,0,,Albus Dumbledore.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.10,0:18:49.63,*ENG,203,0,0,0,,I will not pay to have a crackpot old fool teach him magic tricks.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.87,0:18:57.57,*ENG,204,0,0,0,,Never insult Albus Dumbledore...in front of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.03,0:19:15.02,*ENG,205,0,0,0,,What did they do to my baby?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.13,0:19:19.80,*ENG,206,0,0,0,,I'd appreciate it if you didn't tell anyone at Hogwarts about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.14,0:19:22.63,*ENG,207,0,0,0,,I'm not allowed to do magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.74,0:19:23.76,*ENG,208,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.04,0:19:28.71,*ENG,209,0,0,0,,We're a bit behind schedule. Best be off.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.15,0:19:37.75,*ENG,210,0,0,0,,Unless you'd rather stay, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.99,0:19:56.65,*ENG,211,0,0,0,,''First years will require three sets of work robes...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.85,0:19:57.65,*ENG,212,0,0,0,,...one wand.''
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.07,0:20:00.65,*ENG,213,0,0,0,,Essential bit of equipment, Harry.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.15,0:20:03.65,*ENG,214,0,0,0,,''One pair of dragon hide gloves.''
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.65,0:20:06.97,*ENG,215,0,0,0,,Do they mean from a real dragon?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.37,0:20:08.97,*ENG,216,0,0,0,,They don't mean a penguin, do they?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.56,0:20:13.97,*ENG,217,0,0,0,,Crikey. l'd love a dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.07,0:20:15.07,*ENG,218,0,0,0,,You'd like a dragon?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.27,0:20:20.37,*ENG,219,0,0,0,,Vastly misunderstood beasts, Harry. Vastly misunderstood.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.37,0:20:30.70,*ENG,220,0,0,0,,"All students must be equipped with...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.81,0:20:33.87,*ENG,221,0,0,0,,...one standard size 2 pewter cauldron...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.98,0:20:35.57,*ENG,222,0,0,0,,...and may bring, if they desire,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.68,0:20:39.28,*ENG,223,0,0,0,,either an owl, a cat or a toad."
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.08,0:20:42.45,*ENG,224,0,0,0,,Can we find all this in London?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.55,0:20:44.38,*ENG,225,0,0,0,,If you know where to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.80,0:21:00.63,*ENG,226,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.94,0:21:04.37,*ENG,227,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.01,0:21:11.07,*ENG,228,0,0,0,,Ah, Hagrid! The usual, I presume?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.18,0:21:11.98,*ENG,229,0,0,0,,No, thanks, Tom.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.08,0:21:14.34,*ENG,230,0,0,0,,I'm on official Hogwarts business.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.22,0:21:18.41,*ENG,231,0,0,0,,Just helping Harry buy his school supplies.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.55,0:21:20.02,*ENG,232,0,0,0,,Bless my soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.22,0:21:22.05,*ENG,233,0,0,0,,It's Harry Potter!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.40,0:21:28.09,*ENG,234,0,0,0,,Welcome back, Mr. Potter.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.20,0:21:29.69,*ENG,235,0,0,0,,Welcome back.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.10,0:21:31.62,*ENG,236,0,0,0,,Doris Crockford.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.73,0:21:34.79,*ENG,237,0,0,0,,I can't believe I'm meeting you at last.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.90,0:21:37.90,*ENG,238,0,0,0,,Harry Potter.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.07,0:21:40.06,*ENG,239,0,0,0,,Can't tell you how pleased I am to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.18,0:21:42.91,*ENG,240,0,0,0,,Hello, professor. I didn't see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.01,0:21:48.21,*ENG,241,0,0,0,,Professor Quirrell will be your Defense Against the Dark Arts teacher.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.38,0:21:50.18,*ENG,242,0,0,0,,Oh, nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.95,0:21:53.92,*ENG,243,0,0,0,,Fearfully fascinating subject.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.02,0:21:58.52,*ENG,244,0,0,0,,Not that you need it, eh, Potter?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.90,0:22:04.36,*ENG,245,0,0,0,,Yes, well, must be going now. Lots to buy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.47,0:22:05.56,*ENG,246,0,0,0,,Goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.04,0:22:10.30,*ENG,247,0,0,0,,See, Harry?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.41,0:22:12.64,*ENG,248,0,0,0,,- You're famous. - But why am I famous?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.74,0:22:16.04,*ENG,249,0,0,0,,All those people, how is it they know who I am?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.14,0:22:19.44,*ENG,250,0,0,0,,I'm not sure I'm the right person to tell you that.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.93,0:22:39.92,*ENG,251,0,0,0,,Welcome, Harry, to Diagon Alley.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.02,0:22:59.32,*ENG,252,0,0,0,,Here, you get your quills and ink.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.79,0:23:02.92,*ENG,253,0,0,0,,Over there, all your bits and bobs for doing wizardry.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.18,0:23:29.05,*ENG,254,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.15,0:23:30.52,*ENG,255,0,0,0,,It's a world-class racing broom.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.62,0:23:34.75,*ENG,256,0,0,0,,Look at it! The new Nimbus 2000!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.16,0:23:37.65,*ENG,257,0,0,0,,It's the fastest model yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.50,0:23:41.43,*ENG,258,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.46,0:23:45.40,*ENG,259,0,0,0,,But how am I to pay for all this?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.50,0:23:46.93,*ENG,260,0,0,0,,I haven't any money.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.07,0:23:48.54,*ENG,261,0,0,0,,There's your money.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.64,0:23:50.40,*ENG,262,0,0,0,,Gringotts, the wizard bank.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.51,0:23:52.91,*ENG,263,0,0,0,,Ain't no safer place, not one.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.01,0:23:54.70,*ENG,264,0,0,0,,Except perhaps Hogwarts.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.16,0:24:10.05,*ENG,265,0,0,0,,Hagrid
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.33,0:24:12.79,*ENG,266,0,0,0,,what exactly are these things?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.89,0:24:14.79,*ENG,267,0,0,0,,They're goblins.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.93,0:24:18.42,*ENG,268,0,0,0,,Clever as they come, but not the most friendly of beasts.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.53,0:24:20.13,*ENG,269,0,0,0,,Best stay close.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.31,0:24:27.54,*ENG,270,0,0,0,,Mr. Harry Potter wishes to make a withdrawal.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.45,0:24:36.24,*ENG,271,0,0,0,,And does Mr. Harry Potter have his key?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.39,0:24:38.91,*ENG,272,0,0,0,,Wait a minute. Got it here somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.66,0:24:44.73,*ENG,273,0,0,0,,Ha! There's the little devil.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.39,0:24:47.79,*ENG,274,0,0,0,,And there's something else as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.66,0:24:51.83,*ENG,275,0,0,0,,Professor Dumbledore gave me this.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.57,0:24:56.73,*ENG,276,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.84,0:25:01.61,*ENG,277,0,0,0,,It's about You-Know-What in vault you-know-which.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.38,0:25:04.47,*ENG,278,0,0,0,,Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.49,0:25:12.82,*ENG,279,0,0,0,,Vault 687.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.29,0:25:16.59,*ENG,280,0,0,0,,Lamp, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.17,0:25:27.23,*ENG,281,0,0,0,,Key, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.96,0:25:53.99,*ENG,282,0,0,0,,Did you think your parents would leave you with nothing?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.96,0:25:58.30,*ENG,283,0,0,0,,Vault 713.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.40,0:25:59.77,*ENG,284,0,0,0,,What's in there, Hagrid?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.87,0:26:01.33,*ENG,285,0,0,0,,Can't tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.44,0:26:04.30,*ENG,286,0,0,0,,Hogwarts business.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.31,0:26:06.23,*ENG,287,0,0,0,,- Very secret. - Stand back.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.14,0:26:36.66,*ENG,288,0,0,0,,Best not to mention this to anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.28,0:26:49.24,*ENG,289,0,0,0,,I still need a wand.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.32,0:26:51.95,*ENG,290,0,0,0,,A wand? You want OIlivanders.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.05,0:26:53.21,*ENG,291,0,0,0,,There ain't no place better.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.86,0:26:55.76,*ENG,292,0,0,0,,Run along there and wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.86,0:26:58.35,*ENG,293,0,0,0,,I got one more thing to do. Won't be long.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.78,0:27:18.04,*ENG,294,0,0,0,,Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.42,0:27:22.44,*ENG,295,0,0,0,,Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.82,0:27:29.59,*ENG,296,0,0,0,,I wondered when I'd be seeing you,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.69,0:27:30.99,*ENG,297,0,0,0,,Mr. Potter.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.90,0:27:41.27,*ENG,298,0,0,0,,It seems only yesterday...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.37,0:27:46.47,*ENG,299,0,0,0,,...that your mother and father were in here buying their first wands.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.88,0:27:55.85,*ENG,300,0,0,0,,Here we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.76,0:28:06.59,*ENG,301,0,0,0,,Give it a wave.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.74,0:28:15.50,*ENG,302,0,0,0,,Apparently not.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.88,0:28:25.51,*ENG,303,0,0,0,,Perhaps...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.65,0:28:29.08,*ENG,304,0,0,0,,...this.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.86,0:28:39.73,*ENG,305,0,0,0,,No, no, definitely not.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.56,0:28:41.86,*ENG,306,0,0,0,,No matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.77,0:28:51.03,*ENG,307,0,0,0,,I wonder...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.63,0:29:21.60,*ENG,308,0,0,0,,Curious.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.17,0:29:24.30,*ENG,309,0,0,0,,Very curious.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.37,0:29:29.07,*ENG,310,0,0,0,,Sorry, but what's curious?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.01,0:29:32.81,*ENG,311,0,0,0,,I remember every wand I've ever sold, Mr. Potter.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.55,0:29:39.20,*ENG,312,0,0,0,,It so happens that the phoenix whose tail feather resides in your wand
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.22,0:29:41.71,*ENG,313,0,0,0,,gave another feather.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.82,0:29:44.85,*ENG,314,0,0,0,,Just one other.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.96,0:29:49.49,*ENG,315,0,0,0,,It is curious that you should be destined for this wand...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.56,0:29:54.19,*ENG,316,0,0,0,,...when its brother gave you that scar.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.81,0:29:59.54,*ENG,317,0,0,0,,And who owned that wand?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.64,0:30:03.91,*ENG,318,0,0,0,,We do not speak his name.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.01,0:30:07.54,*ENG,319,0,0,0,,The wand chooses the wizard, Mr. Potter.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.68,0:30:10.62,*ENG,320,0,0,0,,It's not always clear why.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.95,0:30:14.79,*ENG,321,0,0,0,,But I think it is clear...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.89,0:30:18.12,*ENG,322,0,0,0,,...that we can expect great things from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.79,0:30:23.39,*ENG,323,0,0,0,,After all, He-Who-Must-Not-Be-Named...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.43,0:30:26.03,*ENG,324,0,0,0,,...did great things.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.13,0:30:29.97,*ENG,325,0,0,0,,Terrible...yes
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.34,0:30:33.21,*ENG,326,0,0,0,,but great.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.58,0:30:39.48,*ENG,327,0,0,0,,Harry! Harry!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.01,0:30:41.61,*ENG,328,0,0,0,,Happy birthday.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.32,0:30:52.72,*ENG,329,0,0,0,,You all right, Harry? You seem very quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.39,0:30:56.56,*ENG,330,0,0,0,,He killed my parents, didn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.66,0:30:58.46,*ENG,331,0,0,0,,The one who gave me this.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.73,0:31:01.07,*ENG,332,0,0,0,,You know, Hagrid.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.67,0:31:03.16,*ENG,333,0,0,0,,I know you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.71,0:31:11.50,*ENG,334,0,0,0,,First, and understand this because it's very important:
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.68,0:31:14.61,*ENG,335,0,0,0,,Not all wizards are good.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.68,0:31:16.21,*ENG,336,0,0,0,,Some of them go bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.22,0:31:17.08,*ENG,337,0,0,0,,A few years ago...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.10,0:31:19.52,*ENG,338,0,0,0,,...there was a wizard who went as bad as you can go.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.52,0:31:22.21,*ENG,339,0,0,0,,His name was V...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.42,0:31:24.00,*ENG,340,0,0,0,,His name was V...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.09,0:31:25.78,*ENG,341,0,0,0,,Maybe if you wrote it down?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.89,0:31:29.35,*ENG,342,0,0,0,,No, I can't spell it.All right,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.86,0:31:31.20,*ENG,343,0,0,0,,Voldemort.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.30,0:31:32.79,*ENG,344,0,0,0,,Voldemort?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.44,0:31:38.63,*ENG,345,0,0,0,,It was dark times, Harry.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.88,0:31:44.14,*ENG,346,0,0,0,,Voldemort started to gather some followers.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.25,0:31:46.91,*ENG,347,0,0,0,,Brought them over to the Dark Side.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.15,0:31:53.24,*ENG,348,0,0,0,,Anyone that stood up to him ended up dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.39,0:31:56.35,*ENG,349,0,0,0,,Your parents fought against him.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.86,0:32:01.39,*ENG,350,0,0,0,,But nobody lived once he decided to kill them.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.53,0:32:06.76,*ENG,351,0,0,0,,Nobody, not one.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.40,0:32:08.89,*ENG,352,0,0,0,,Except you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.41,0:32:16.28,*ENG,353,0,0,0,,Me? Voldemort tried to kill me?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.38,0:32:20.84,*ENG,354,0,0,0,,Yes. That ain't no ordinary cut on your forehead, Harry.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.95,0:32:24.28,*ENG,355,0,0,0,,A mark like that only comes from being touched by a curse,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.39,0:32:26.28,*ENG,356,0,0,0,,an evil curse.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.62,0:32:31.22,*ENG,357,0,0,0,,What happened to V... To You-Know-Who?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.39,0:32:34.66,*ENG,358,0,0,0,,Well, some say he died.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.13,0:32:37.60,*ENG,359,0,0,0,,Codswallop, in my opinion.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.70,0:32:41.53,*ENG,360,0,0,0,,Nope, I reckon he's out there still...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.64,0:32:44.13,*ENG,361,0,0,0,,...too tired to carry on.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.24,0:32:46.43,*ENG,362,0,0,0,,But one thing's certain.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.54,0:32:49.60,*ENG,363,0,0,0,,Something about you stumped him that night.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.64,0:32:51.30,*ENG,364,0,0,0,,That's why you're famous.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.31,0:32:54.74,*ENG,365,0,0,0,,That's why everybody knows your name.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.85,0:32:58.08,*ENG,366,0,0,0,,You're the boy who lived.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.86,0:33:09.35,*ENG,367,0,0,0,,What are you looking at?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.43,0:33:14.23,*ENG,368,0,0,0,,Blimey, is that the time?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.34,0:33:15.93,*ENG,369,0,0,0,,I'm gonna have to leave you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.04,0:33:18.63,*ENG,370,0,0,0,,Dumbledore will be wanting his...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.74,0:33:20.47,*ENG,371,0,0,0,,Well, he'll be wanting to see me.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.58,0:33:23.41,*ENG,372,0,0,0,,Your train leaves in 10 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.51,0:33:24.74,*ENG,373,0,0,0,,Here's your ticket.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.85,0:33:27.87,*ENG,374,0,0,0,,Stick to your ticket, that's very important.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.72,0:33:31.84,*ENG,375,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.95,0:33:34.35,*ENG,376,0,0,0,,"Platform 93/4"?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.46,0:33:37.08,*ENG,377,0,0,0,,But, Hagrid, there must be a mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.19,0:33:39.28,*ENG,378,0,0,0,,This says platform 93/4.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.39,0:33:41.62,*ENG,379,0,0,0,,There's no such thing, is there?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.44,0:33:57.04,*ENG,380,0,0,0,,Stay out of the way

.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.25,0:34:02.24,*ENG,381,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.52,0:34:06.92,*ENG,382,0,0,0,,Excuse me. Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.52,0:34:09.05,*ENG,383,0,0,0,,On your left.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.16,0:34:12.95,*ENG,384,0,0,0,,Can you tell me where I might find platform 93/4?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.03,0:34:15.32,*ENG,385,0,0,0,,Think you're being funny, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.66,0:34:19.36,*ENG,386,0,0,0,,It's the same every year, packed with Muggles.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.67,0:34:21.76,*ENG,387,0,0,0,,- Muggles? - Platform 93/4, this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.78,0:34:30.94,*ENG,388,0,0,0,,All right, Percy, you first.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.86,0:34:43.35,*ENG,389,0,0,0,,Fred, you next.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.52,0:34:44.82,*ENG,390,0,0,0,,He's not Fred, I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.93,0:34:47.26,*ENG,391,0,0,0,,You call yourself our mother?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.36,0:34:49.49,*ENG,392,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, George.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.30,0:34:55.27,*ENG,393,0,0,0,,I'm only joking. I am Fred.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.54,0:35:02.98,*ENG,394,0,0,0,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.21,0:35:08.04,*ENG,395,0,0,0,,Could you tell me how to?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.32,0:35:10.22,*ENG,396,0,0,0,,How to get onto the platform?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.32,0:35:11.81,*ENG,397,0,0,0,,Not to worry, dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.92,0:35:14.44,*ENG,398,0,0,0,,It's Ron's first time to Hogwarts as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.56,0:35:20.99,*ENG,399,0,0,0,,All you do is walk straight at the wall between platforms 9 and 10.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.06,0:35:22.75,*ENG,400,0,0,0,,Best to run if you're nervous.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.86,0:35:23.99,*ENG,401,0,0,0,,Good luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.73,0:36:01.10,*ENG,402,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.86,0:36:23.35,*ENG,403,0,0,0,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.46,0:36:26.29,*ENG,404,0,0,0,,Do you mind? Everywhere else is full.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.39,0:36:27.69,*ENG,405,0,0,0,,Not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.57,0:36:32.90,*ENG,406,0,0,0,,I'm Ron, by the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.00,0:36:34.09,*ENG,407,0,0,0,,Ron Weasley.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.20,0:36:35.90,*ENG,408,0,0,0,,I'm Harry. Harry Potter.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.21,0:36:40.37,*ENG,409,0,0,0,,So it's true!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.48,0:36:43.91,*ENG,410,0,0,0,,I mean, do you really have the?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.01,0:36:45.48,*ENG,411,0,0,0,,The what?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.08,0:36:47.14,*ENG,412,0,0,0,,The scar?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.95,0:36:51.28,*ENG,413,0,0,0,,Wicked!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.66,0:36:56.55,*ENG,414,0,0,0,,Anything off the trolley, dears?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.56,0:36:59.45,*ENG,415,0,0,0,,No, thanks. I'm all set.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.76,0:37:05.32,*ENG,416,0,0,0,,We'll take the lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.94,0:37:18.78,*ENG,417,0,0,0,,Bertie Bott's Every Flavor Beans?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.88,0:37:21.11,*ENG,418,0,0,0,,They mean every flavor.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.95,0:37:25.51,*ENG,419,0,0,0,,There's chocolate and peppermint and also...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.62,0:37:28.85,*ENG,420,0,0,0,,...spinach, liver and tripe.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.69,0:37:33.06,*ENG,421,0,0,0,,George sweared he got a booger-flavored one once.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.53,0:37:40.19,*ENG,422,0,0,0,,Are they real frogs?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.30,0:37:41.53,*ENG,423,0,0,0,,It's a spell.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.64,0:37:43.93,*ENG,424,0,0,0,,You want the cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.04,0:37:46.37,*ENG,425,0,0,0,,Each pack's got a famous witch or wizard.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.47,0:37:48.41,*ENG,426,0,0,0,,I've got about 500 meself.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.08,0:37:52.48,*ENG,427,0,0,0,,Watch it!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.38,0:37:57.11,*ENG,428,0,0,0,,That's rotten luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.22,0:37:59.65,*ENG,429,0,0,0,,They've only got one good jump in them.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.92,0:38:02.45,*ENG,430,0,0,0,,I've got Dumbledore!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.56,0:38:05.36,*ENG,431,0,0,0,,I got about six of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.70,0:38:08.86,*ENG,432,0,0,0,,Hey, he's gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.96,0:38:12.59,*ENG,433,0,0,0,,You can't expect him to hang around all day, can you?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.50,0:38:15.16,*ENG,434,0,0,0,,This is Scabbers.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.27,0:38:16.70,*ENG,435,0,0,0,,Pathetic, isn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.80,0:38:18.03,*ENG,436,0,0,0,,A little.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.14,0:38:21.73,*ENG,437,0,0,0,,Fred gave me a spell to turn him yellow. Want to see?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.84,0:38:22.83,*ENG,438,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.65,0:38:32.59,*ENG,439,0,0,0,,Has anyone seen a toad?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.69,0:38:34.42,*ENG,440,0,0,0,,A boy named Neville's lost one.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.52,0:38:35.78,*ENG,441,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.89,0:38:37.76,*ENG,442,0,0,0,,Oh, are you doing magic?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.86,0:38:39.26,*ENG,443,0,0,0,,Let's see, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.26,0:38:45.70,*ENG,444,0,0,0,,Sunshine, daisies, butter mellow
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.80,0:38:48.50,*ENG,445,0,0,0,,Turn this stupid, fat rat yellow
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.64,0:38:54.37,*ENG,446,0,0,0,,Are you sure that's a real spell?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.48,0:38:57.04,*ENG,447,0,0,0,,Well, it's not very good, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.45,0:39:00.77,*ENG,448,0,0,0,,I've only tried a few simple ones myself...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.82,0:39:02.41,*ENG,449,0,0,0,,...but they've all worked for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.12,0:39:08.52,*ENG,450,0,0,0,,For example:
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.39,0:39:11.35,*ENG,451,0,0,0,,Oculus Reparo.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.66,0:39:15.39,*ENG,452,0,0,0,,That's better, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.50,0:39:22.27,*ENG,453,0,0,0,,Holy cricket, you're Harry Potter!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.37,0:39:23.84,*ENG,454,0,0,0,,I'm Hermione Granger.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.94,0:39:26.34,*ENG,455,0,0,0,,And you are?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.44,0:39:28.57,*ENG,ENG,0,0,0,,I'm Ron Weasley.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.68,0:39:29.77,*ENG,457,0,0,0,,Pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.08,0:39:32.14,*ENG,458,0,0,0,,You two better change into robes.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.25,0:39:34.11,*ENG,459,0,0,0,,I expect we'll be arriving soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.22,0:39:42.99,*ENG,460,0,0,0,,You've got dirt on your nose. Did you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.09,0:39:44.35,*ENG,461,0,0,0,,Just there.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.27,0:39:59.33,*ENG,462,0,0,0,,Right, then. First years,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.44,0:40:00.96,*ENG,463,0,0,0,,this way, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.34,0:40:03.78,*ENG,464,0,0,0,,Come on, first years, don't be shy.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.11,0:40:06.51,*ENG,465,0,0,0,,Come on now, hurry up.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.52,0:40:14.65,*ENG,466,0,0,0,,Hello, Harry.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.76,0:40:15.92,*ENG,467,0,0,0,,Hi, Hagrid.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.63,0:40:20.29,*ENG,468,0,0,0,,Right, then. This way to the boats.Come on now,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.39,0:40:20.83,*ENG,469,0,0,0,,follow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.67,0:41:39.80,*ENG,470,0,0,0,,Welcome to Hogwarts.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.97,0:41:44.41,*ENG,471,0,0,0,,Shortly, you'll pass through these doors and join your classmates.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.45,0:41:46.04,*ENG,472,0,0,0,,But before you take your seats,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.15,0:41:49.17,*ENG,473,0,0,0,,you must be sorted into your houses.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.52,0:41:52.71,*ENG,474,0,0,0,,They are Gryffindor, Hufflepuff...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.82,0:41:56.92,*ENG,475,0,0,0,,...Ravenclaw and Slytherin.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.79,0:42:00.06,*ENG,476,0,0,0,,While you're here,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.16,0:42:02.99,*ENG,477,0,0,0,,your house will be like your family.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.36,0:42:06.33,*ENG,478,0,0,0,,Your triumphs will earn you points.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.83,0:42:10.26,*ENG,479,0,0,0,,Any rule-breaking and you will lose points.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.47,0:42:14.87,*ENG,480,0,0,0,,At the end of the year, the house with the most points wins the house cup.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.21,0:42:18.34,*ENG,481,0,0,0,,Trevor!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.42,0:42:28.45,*ENG,482,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:28.69,0:42:32.42,*ENG,483,0,0,0,,The Sorting Ceremony will begin momentarily.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.13,0:42:35.65,*ENG,484,0,0,0,,It's true then,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.03,0:42:38.02,*ENG,485,0,0,0,,what they're saying on the train.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:38.13,0:42:40.86,*ENG,486,0,0,0,,Harry Potter has come to Hogwarts.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:41.10,0:42:42.73,*ENG,487,0,0,0,,Harry Potter?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:43.10,0:42:48.44,*ENG,488,0,0,0,,This is Crabbe and Goyle.And I'm Malfoy.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:48.48,0:42:50.50,*ENG,489,0,0,0,,Draco Malfoy.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.65,0:42:54.44,*ENG,490,0,0,0,,Think my name's funny, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.55,0:42:56.38,*ENG,491,0,0,0,,I've no need to ask yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.48,0:42:59.68,*ENG,492,0,0,0,,Red hair and a hand-me-down robe?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.79,0:43:02.09,*ENG,493,0,0,0,,You must be a Weasley.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.32,0:43:07.52,*ENG,494,0,0,0,,You'll find out some wizarding families are better than others.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.53,0:43:10.96,*ENG,495,0,0,0,,You don't want to go making friends with the wrong sort.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:11.43,0:43:13.42,*ENG,496,0,0,0,,I can help you there.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.80,0:43:19.00,*ENG,497,0,0,0,,I think I can tell the wrong sort for myself, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:25.45,0:43:28.24,*ENG,498,0,0,0,,We're ready for you now. Follow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:46.30,0:43:48.20,*ENG,499,0,0,0,,The ceiling isn't real.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:48.30,0:43:50.46,*ENG,500,0,0,0,,It's bewitched to look like the night sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.94,0:43:54.40,*ENG,501,0,0,0,,I read about it in Hogwarts, A History.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:07.29,0:44:08.85,*ENG,502,0,0,0,,Will you wait along here, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:11.46,0:44:14.22,*ENG,503,0,0,0,,Now, before we begin...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:14.33,0:44:17.63,*ENG,504,0,0,0,,...Professor Dumbledore would like to say a few words.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:17.97,0:44:20.20,*ENG,505,0,0,0,,I have a few start-of-term notices
Dialogue: 0,0:44:20.30,0:44:22.53,*ENG,506,0,0,0,,I wish to announce.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:23.00,0:44:25.30,*ENG,507,0,0,0,,The first years, please note...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:25.54,0:44:30.74,*ENG,508,0,0,0,,...that the Dark Forest is strictly forbidden to all students.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.78,0:44:37.41,*ENG,509,0,0,0,,Also, our caretaker, Mr. Filch, has asked me to remind you...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:37.59,0:44:42.28,*ENG,510,0,0,0,,...that the third-floor corridor is out of bounds...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:42.39,0:44:46.83,*ENG,511,0,0,0,,...to everyone who does not wish to die a most painful death.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:48.00,0:44:49.39,*ENG,512,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:51.73,0:44:54.10,*ENG,513,0,0,0,,When I call your name,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:54.20,0:44:56.00,*ENG,514,0,0,0,,you will come forth.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.10,0:44:59.07,*ENG,515,0,0,0,,I shall place the Sorting Hat on your head...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:59.87,0:45:02.03,*ENG,516,0,0,0,,...and you will be sorted into your houses.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:03.21,0:45:05.20,*ENG,517,0,0,0,,Hermione Granger.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:08.15,0:45:09.41,*ENG,518,0,0,0,,Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:09.52,0:45:10.88,*ENG,519,0,0,0,,Okay, relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.25,0:45:13.69,*ENG,520,0,0,0,,Mental, that one, I'm telling you.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:18.96,0:45:21.59,*ENG,521,0,0,0,,Right
Dialogue: 0,0:45:21.70,0:45:24.03,*ENG,522,0,0,0,,then. Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:24.13,0:45:25.56,*ENG,523,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:25.67,0:45:27.29,*ENG,524,0,0,0,,Gryffindor!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.34,0:45:38.31,*ENG,525,0,0,0,,Draco Malfoy.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:43.85,0:45:45.32,*ENG,526,0,0,0,,Slytherin!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.99,0:45:50.09,*ENG,527,0,0,0,,Every wizard who went bad was in Slytherin.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:50.19,0:45:51.52,*ENG,528,0,0,0,,Susan Bones.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:01.00,0:46:03.37,*ENG,529,0,0,0,,Harry, what is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:03.50,0:46:06.63,*ENG,530,0,0,0,,Nothing. Nothing, I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:06.74,0:46:08.21,*ENG,531,0,0,0,,Let's see...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:08.31,0:46:09.67,*ENG,532,0,0,0,,I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:09.88,0:46:11.28,*ENG,533,0,0,0,,Hufflepuff!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:13.91,0:46:16.04,*ENG,534,0,0,0,,Ronald Weasley.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:29.60,0:46:32.57,*ENG,535,0,0,0,,Another Weasley!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:32.67,0:46:36.19,*ENG,536,0,0,0,,I know just what to do with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:36.30,0:46:38.33,*ENG,537,0,0,0,,Gryffindor!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.75,0:46:46.27,*ENG,538,0,0,0,,Harry Potter.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:04.33,0:47:08.29,*ENG,539,0,0,0,,Difficult, very difficult.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:08.40,0:47:12.50,*ENG,540,0,0,0,,Plenty of courage, I see. Not a bad mind, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.61,0:47:15.23,*ENG,541,0,0,0,,There's talent, oh, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:15.34,0:47:19.14,*ENG,542,0,0,0,,And a thirst to prove yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:19.25,0:47:21.98,*ENG,543,0,0,0,,But where to put you?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:22.08,0:47:24.64,*ENG,544,0,0,0,,Not Slytherin, not Slytherin!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:24.75,0:47:27.19,*ENG,545,0,0,0,,Not Slytherin, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:27.29,0:47:30.48,*ENG,546,0,0,0,,Are you sure? You could be great,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:30.59,0:47:33.72,*ENG,547,0,0,0,,you know. It's all here, in your head.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:33.83,0:47:37.42,*ENG,548,0,0,0,,And Slytherin will help you on the way to greatness,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:37.53,0:47:39.23,*ENG,549,0,0,0,,no doubt about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:39.33,0:47:44.13,*ENG,550,0,0,0,,No? Well, if you're sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:44.24,0:47:46.07,*ENG,551,0,0,0,,Better be...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:46.17,0:47:48.20,*ENG,552,0,0,0,,...Gryffindor!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:50.41,0:47:54.01,*ENG,553,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:56.32,0:47:59.88,*ENG,554,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:13.77,0:48:15.60,*ENG,555,0,0,0,,Your attention, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:18.51,0:48:21.70,*ENG,556,0,0,0,,Let the feast begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:38.26,0:48:39.69,*ENG,557,0,0,0,,I'm half and half.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:39.86,0:48:42.89,*ENG,558,0,0,0,,Me dad's a Muggle. Mum's a witch.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.26,0:48:45.96,*ENG,559,0,0,0,,Bit of a nasty shock for him when he found out.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:47.94,0:48:51.96,*ENG,560,0,0,0,,Percy, who's that teacher talking to Professor Quirrell?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.04,0:48:53.44,*ENG,561,0,0,0,,Professor Snape,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:53.54,0:48:55.06,*ENG,562,0,0,0,,head of Slytherin house.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:55.31,0:48:56.28,*ENG,563,0,0,0,,What's he teach?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:56.38,0:48:57.40,*ENG,564,0,0,0,,Potions.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:57.51,0:48:59.60,*ENG,565,0,0,0,,But he fancies the Dark Arts.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:59.71,0:49:02.15,*ENG,566,0,0,0,,He's been after Quirrell's job for years.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:07.55,0:49:12.75,*ENG,567,0,0,0,,Hello! How are you? Welcome to Gryffindor.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:23.57,0:49:25.33,*ENG,568,0,0,0,,It's the Bloody Baron!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:30.84,0:49:31.74,*ENG,569,0,0,0,,Hello, Sir Nicholas.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:31.85,0:49:33.24,*ENG,570,0,0,0,,Have a nice summer?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:33.71,0:49:38.41,*ENG,571,0,0,0,,Dismal. Once again, my request to join the Headless Hunt has been denied.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:42.19,0:49:43.55,*ENG,572,0,0,0,,I know you.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:43.66,0:49:45.25,*ENG,573,0,0,0,,You're Nearly Headless Nick.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:45.36,0:49:48.19,*ENG,574,0,0,0,,I prefer Sir Nicholas, if you don't mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:48.30,0:49:49.79,*ENG,575,0,0,0,,"Nearly" headless?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:49.90,0:49:52.02,*ENG,576,0,0,0,,How can you be nearly headless?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:52.13,0:49:53.46,*ENG,577,0,0,0,,like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:04.11,0:50:06.27,*ENG,578,0,0,0,,Gryffindors, follow me, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:06.28,0:50:07.31,*ENG,579,0,0,0,,Keep up. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:08.25,0:50:09.77,*ENG,580,0,0,0,,Ravenclaw, follow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:10.68,0:50:11.91,*ENG,581,0,0,0,,This way.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:12.65,0:50:15.55,*ENG,582,0,0,0,,This is the most direct path to the dormitories.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:15.66,0:50:19.68,*ENG,583,0,0,0,,Keep an eye on the staircases. They like to change.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:28.60,0:50:32.16,*ENG,584,0,0,0,,Keep up, please, and follow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:32.31,0:50:35.21,*ENG,585,0,0,0,,Quickly now, come on. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:35.68,0:50:37.74,*ENG,586,0,0,0,,That picture's moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:38.08,0:50:41.24,*ENG,587,0,0,0,,- Look at that one. - I think she fancies you.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:41.35,0:50:42.61,*ENG,588,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:44.55,0:50:46.08,*ENG,589,0,0,0,,Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:46.19,0:50:46.94,*ENG,590,0,0,0,,Who's that girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:46.95,0:50:48.75,*ENG,591,0,0,0,,Welcome to Hogwarts.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:49.82,0:50:51.69,*ENG,592,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:04.60,0:51:06.40,*ENG,593,0,0,0,,Password?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:06.74,0:51:08.94,*ENG,594,0,0,0,,Caput Draconis.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:17.45,0:51:18.55,*ENG,595,0,0,0,,Follow me, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:18.59,0:51:21.65,*ENG,596,0,0,0,,Keep up. Quickly, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:24.02,0:51:25.49,*ENG,597,0,0,0,,Gather around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:28.10,0:51:30.79,*ENG,598,0,0,0,,Welcome to the Gryffindor common room.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:31.63,0:51:34.10,*ENG,599,0,0,0,,Boys' dormitory is upstairs to the left.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:34.20,0:51:36.14,*ENG,600,0,0,0,,Girls, the same on your right.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:36.24,0:51:39.36,*ENG,601,0,0,0,,Your belongings have already been brought up.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:46.74,0:52:49.07,*ENG,602,0,0,0,,Made it!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:49.41,0:52:52.71,*ENG,603,0,0,0,,Can you imagine the look on old McGonagall's face if we were late?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:57.18,0:52:59.15,*ENG,604,0,0,0,,That was bloody brilliant!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:59.25,0:53:01.95,*ENG,605,0,0,0,,Thank you for that assessment.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:02.12,0:53:06.76,*ENG,606,0,0,0,,It'd be better if I transfigured Mr. Potter and you into a watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:06.86,0:53:08.73,*ENG,607,0,0,0,,Then one of you might be on time.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:08.83,0:53:10.13,*ENG,608,0,0,0,,We got lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:10.23,0:53:12.13,*ENG,609,0,0,0,,Then perhaps a map?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:12.60,0:53:15.09,*ENG,610,0,0,0,,I trust you don't need one to find your seats.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:24.18,0:53:29.47,*ENG,611,0,0,0,,There will be no foolish wand-waving or silly incantations in this class.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:30.02,0:53:31.48,*ENG,612,0,0,0,,As such,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:31.62,0:53:33.78,*ENG,613,0,0,0,,I don't expect many of you to appreciate...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:33.79,0:53:37.22,*ENG,614,0,0,0,,...the subtle science and exact art that is potion-making.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:37.32,0:53:41.66,*ENG,615,0,0,0,,However, for those select few...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:41.76,0:53:45.92,*ENG,616,0,0,0,,...who possess the predisposition...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:48.70,0:53:52.54,*ENG,617,0,0,0,,...I can teach you how to bewitch the mind...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:52.64,0:53:55.34,*ENG,618,0,0,0,,...and ensnare the senses.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:55.44,0:53:59.50,*ENG,619,0,0,0,,I can tell you how to bottle fame...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:59.61,0:54:03.71,*ENG,620,0,0,0,,...brew glory and even put a stopper in death.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:08.39,0:54:10.36,*ENG,621,0,0,0,,Then again,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:10.46,0:54:15.53,*ENG,622,0,0,0,,maybe some of you have come to Hogwarts in possession of abilities...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:15.70,0:54:18.26,*ENG,623,0,0,0,,so formidable that you feel confident enough
Dialogue: 0,0:54:18.37,0:54:21.60,*ENG,624,0,0,0,,...to not pay attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:28.34,0:54:30.40,*ENG,625,0,0,0,,Mr. Potter.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:32.15,0:54:36.64,*ENG,626,0,0,0,,Our new celebrity.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:38.22,0:54:43.18,*ENG,627,0,0,0,,What would I get if I added root of asphodel to an infusion of wormwood?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:47.16,0:54:48.56,*ENG,628,0,0,0,,You don't know?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:48.83,0:54:49.80,*ENG,629,0,0,0,,Let's try again.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:49.90,0:54:53.56,*ENG,630,0,0,0,,Where would you look if I asked you to find a bezoar?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:55.40,0:54:57.37,*ENG,631,0,0,0,,I don't know, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:57.47,0:55:00.60,*ENG,632,0,0,0,,What is the difference between monkshood and wolfsbane?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:03.74,0:55:05.23,*ENG,633,0,0,0,,I don't know, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:07.21,0:55:09.01,*ENG,634,0,0,0,,Pity.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:10.22,0:55:15.05,*ENG,635,0,0,0,,Clearly, fame isn't everything...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:15.16,0:55:17.39,*ENG,636,0,0,0,,...is it, Mr. Potter?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:46.36,0:56:48.52,*ENG,637,0,0,0,,Eye of rabbit, harp string hum
Dialogue: 0,0:56:48.63,0:56:51.15,*ENG,638,0,0,0,,Turn this water into rum
Dialogue: 0,0:56:53.07,0:56:55.23,*ENG,639,0,0,0,,Eye of rabbit...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:55.34,0:56:57.60,*ENG,640,0,0,0,,What's Seamus trying to do to the water?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:57.70,0:56:59.19,*ENG,641,0,0,0,,Turn it to rum.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:59.31,0:57:02.97,*ENG,642,0,0,0,,Actually managed a weak tea yesterday, before...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:07.98,0:57:11.01,*ENG,643,0,0,0,,Mail's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:43.52,0:57:45.14,*ENG,644,0,0,0,,Can I borrow this? Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:45.72,0:57:46.65,*ENG,645,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:48.86,0:57:52.72,*ENG,646,0,0,0,,Look, Neville's got a Remembrall.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:52.89,0:57:54.38,*ENG,647,0,0,0,,I've read about those.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:54.50,0:57:58.17,*ENG,648,0,0,0,,The smoke turns red when you've forgotten something.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:58.70,0:58:00.13,*ENG,649,0,0,0,,The problem is,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:00.23,0:58:02.33,*ENG,650,0,0,0,,I can't remember what I've forgotten.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:03.64,0:58:05.80,*ENG,651,0,0,0,,Somebody broke into Gringotts.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:05.91,0:58:07.17,*ENG,652,0,0,0,,Listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:07.27,0:58:10.64,*ENG,653,0,0,0,,"Believed to be the work of Dark wizards or witches...
Dialogue: 0,0:58:10.74,0:58:15.37,*ENG,654,0,0,0,,Gringotts goblins acknowledge the breach but insist nothing was taken.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:15.42,0:58:17.58,*ENG,655,0,0,0,,The vault in question, number 713,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:17.68,0:58:21.31,*ENG,656,0,0,0,,had been emptied earlier that same day."
Dialogue: 0,0:58:21.86,0:58:23.02,*ENG,657,0,0,0,,That's odd.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:23.12,0:58:25.39,*ENG,658,0,0,0,,That's the vault Hagrid and I went to
Dialogue: 0,0:58:34.94,0:58:36.27,*ENG,659,0,0,0,,Good afternoon, class.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:36.37,0:58:38.84,*ENG,660,0,0,0,,Good afternoon, Madam Hooch.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:38.94,0:58:40.84,*ENG,661,0,0,0,,Good afternoon, Amanda. Good afternoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:42.94,0:58:45.54,*ENG,662,0,0,0,,Welcome to your first flying lesson.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:45.68,0:58:47.11,*ENG,663,0,0,0,,What are you waiting for?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:47.21,0:58:49.81,*ENG,664,0,0,0,,Step up to your broomstick.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:49.92,0:58:51.51,*ENG,665,0,0,0,,Come on now, hurry up.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:51.82,0:58:54.29,*ENG,666,0,0,0,,Stick your hand over the broom and say,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:54.39,0:58:55.51,*ENG,667,0,0,0,,"Up."
Dialogue: 0,0:58:55.62,0:58:58.99,*ENG,668,0,0,0,,Up!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:00.13,0:59:02.06,*ENG,669,0,0,0,,Up.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:03.16,0:59:05.53,*ENG,670,0,0,0,,Up. Up!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:05.63,0:59:06.50,*ENG,671,0,0,0,,With feeling.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:16.18,0:59:17.80,*ENG,672,0,0,0,,Shut up, Harry.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:18.45,0:59:21.54,*ENG,673,0,0,0,,Now, once you've got hold of your broom,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:21.65,0:59:25.41,*ENG,674,0,0,0,,I want you to mount it.Grip it tight.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:25.52,0:59:27.75,*ENG,675,0,0,0,,You don't wanna be sliding off the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:27.85,0:59:30.48,*ENG,676,0,0,0,,When I blow my whistle,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:30.59,0:59:32.89,*ENG,677,0,0,0,,I want you to kick off from the ground, hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:32.99,0:59:36.96,*ENG,678,0,0,0,,Keep your broom steady, hover for a moment...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:37.06,0:59:39.16,*ENG,679,0,0,0,,...then lean forward slightly
Dialogue: 0,0:59:39.27,0:59:40.73,*ENG,680,0,0,0,,and touch back down.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:41.37,0:59:45.10,*ENG,681,0,0,0,,On my whistle. Three, two...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:46.11,0:59:48.07,*ENG,682,0,0,0,,Mr. Longbottom.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:48.18,0:59:49.77,*ENG,683,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:49.88,0:59:51.57,*ENG,684,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:53.15,0:59:55.84,*ENG,685,0,0,0,,Mr. Longbottom! Down, down!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:55.95,0:59:57.58,*ENG,686,0,0,0,,Neville!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:58.95,1:00:00.68,*ENG,687,0,0,0,,Help! Help!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:01.19,1:00:02.71,*ENG,688,0,0,0,,Come back down this instant!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:02.82,1:00:05.19,*ENG,689,0,0,0,,Oh! No!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:11.53,1:00:13.32,*ENG,690,0,0,0,,Help!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:13.80,1:00:14.89,*ENG,691,0,0,0,,Mr. Longbottom.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:15.14,1:00:17.04,*ENG,692,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:18.27,1:00:21.76,*ENG,693,0,0,0,,Help!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:32.99,1:00:34.65,*ENG,694,0,0,0,,Everyone out of the way!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:40.46,1:00:41.69,*ENG,695,0,0,0,,Is he all right?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:41.80,1:00:46.03,*ENG,696,0,0,0,,Oh, dear, it's a broken wrist. Poor boy.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:48.03,1:00:49.70,*ENG,697,0,0,0,,Come on now, up you get.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:50.30,1:00:52.57,*ENG,698,0,0,0,,Keep your feet on the ground
Dialogue: 0,1:00:52.67,1:00:55.16,*ENG,699,0,0,0,,while I take him to the hospital wing.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:55.28,1:00:56.40,*ENG,700,0,0,0,,Understand?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:56.71,1:00:59.04,*ENG,701,0,0,0,,If I see a single broom in the air...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:59.15,1:01:03.34,*ENG,702,0,0,0,,...the one riding it will be expelled before they can say Quidditch.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:04.58,1:01:06.52,*ENG,703,0,0,0,,Did you see his face?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:06.69,1:01:08.92,*ENG,704,0,0,0,,If he had squeezed this,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:09.02,1:01:10.89,*ENG,705,0,0,0,,he'd have remembered to fall on his arse.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:10.99,1:01:12.48,*ENG,706,0,0,0,,Give it here, Malfoy.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:13.96,1:01:17.99,*ENG,707,0,0,0,,No. I'll leave it somewhere for Longbottom to find.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:21.94,1:01:23.37,*ENG,708,0,0,0,,How about on the roof?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:25.71,1:01:28.97,*ENG,709,0,0,0,,What's the matter, Potter? Bit beyond your reach?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:31.68,1:01:33.65,*ENG,710,0,0,0,,Harry, no way!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:33.75,1:01:35.21,*ENG,711,0,0,0,,You heard what Madam Hooch said.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:35.32,1:01:37.98,*ENG,712,0,0,0,,Besides, you don't know how to fly.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:39.02,1:01:40.92,*ENG,713,0,0,0,,What an idiot.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:44.36,1:01:45.59,*ENG,714,0,0,0,,Give it here
Dialogue: 0,1:01:45.69,1:01:47.49,*ENG,715,0,0,0,,or I'll knock you off your broom!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:48.03,1:01:49.39,*ENG,716,0,0,0,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:53.10,1:01:54.86,*ENG,717,0,0,0,,Have it your way, then.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:28.60,1:02:29.69,*ENG,718,0,0,0,,Nice going, Harry.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:29.80,1:02:31.29,*ENG,719,0,0,0,,That was wicked, Harry!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:32.27,1:02:33.64,*ENG,720,0,0,0,,Harry Potter!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:35.31,1:02:36.57,*ENG,721,0,0,0,,Follow me.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:49.06,1:02:50.15,*ENG,722,0,0,0,,You wait here.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:53.03,1:02:54.58,*ENG,723,0,0,0,,Professor Quirrell, excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:54.69,1:02:57.96,*ENG,724,0,0,0,,Could I borrow Wood for a moment?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:58.37,1:03:00.70,*ENG,725,0,0,0,,Yes, of course.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:05.77,1:03:08.21,*ENG,726,0,0,0,,Potter, this is Oliver Wood.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:08.41,1:03:12.40,*ENG,727,0,0,0,,Wood, I have found you a Seeker.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:13.91,1:03:14.90,*ENG,728,0,0,0,,Have you heard?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:15.02,1:03:17.54,*ENG,729,0,0,0,,Harry Potter's the new Gryffindor Seeker.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:17.65,1:03:20.18,*ENG,730,0,0,0,,I always knew he'd do well.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:20.29,1:03:21.28,*ENG,731,0,0,0,,Seeker?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:21.39,1:03:24.32,*ENG,732,0,0,0,,But first years never make the house teams.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:24.42,1:03:28.05,*ENG,733,0,0,0,,You must be the youngest player in...
Dialogue: 0,1:03:28.16,1:03:29.13,*ENG,734,0,0,0,,A century, McGonagall says.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:29.23,1:03:31.90,*ENG,735,0,0,0,,Well done, Harry. Wood's just told us.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:32.07,1:03:33.93,*ENG,736,0,0,0,,Fred and George are on the team.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:34.03,1:03:34.76,*ENG,737,0,0,0,,Beaters.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:34.87,1:03:38.60,*ENG,738,0,0,0,,Our job is to make sure you don't get bloodied up too bad.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:38.71,1:03:40.20,*ENG,739,0,0,0,,Can't make any promises.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:40.31,1:03:41.57,*ENG,740,0,0,0,,Rough game, Quidditch.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:41.68,1:03:43.97,*ENG,741,0,0,0,,But no one's died in years.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:44.08,1:03:45.94,*ENG,742,0,0,0,,Someone vanishes occasionally.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:45.95,1:03:48.11,*ENG,743,0,0,0,,But they'll turn up in a month or two.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:48.68,1:03:50.27,*ENG,744,0,0,0,,Go on. Quidditch is great.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:50.38,1:03:54.54,*ENG,745,0,0,0,,Best game there is, and you'll be great too.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:54.62,1:03:56.59,*ENG,746,0,0,0,,I've never played.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:56.69,1:03:57.99,*ENG,747,0,0,0,,What if I make a fool of myself?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:58.09,1:04:00.32,*ENG,748,0,0,0,,You won't make a fool of yourself.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:00.43,1:04:02.12,*ENG,749,0,0,0,,It's in your blood.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:09.10,1:04:11.17,*ENG,750,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:04:11.27,1:04:14.37,*ENG,751,0,0,0,,You never told me your father was a Seeker too.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:15.01,1:04:17.48,*ENG,752,0,0,0,,I didn't know.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:23.12,1:04:25.68,*ENG,753,0,0,0,,I'm telling you, it's spooky.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:25.79,1:04:27.75,*ENG,754,0,0,0,,She knows more about you than you do.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:27.85,1:04:29.25,*ENG,755,0,0,0,,Who doesn't?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:31.16,1:04:32.56,*ENG,756,0,0,0,,What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:33.39,1:04:36.73,*ENG,757,0,0,0,,The staircases change, remember?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:42.77,1:04:43.83,*ENG,758,0,0,0,,Let's go this way.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:43.94,1:04:46.34,*ENG,759,0,0,0,,Before the staircase moves again.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:55.18,1:04:58.64,*ENG,760,0,0,0,,Does anybody feel like we shouldn't be here?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:58.75,1:05:00.91,*ENG,761,0,0,0,,We're not supposed to be here.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:01.02,1:05:04.12,*ENG,762,0,0,0,,This is the third floor. It's forbidden.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:06.23,1:05:07.49,*ENG,763,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:09.90,1:05:11.16,*ENG,764,0,0,0,,It's Filch's cat!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:11.26,1:05:12.25,*ENG,765,0,0,0,,Run!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:17.40,1:05:19.37,*ENG,766,0,0,0,,Quick, let's hide through that door!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:25.05,1:05:25.84,*ENG,767,0,0,0,,It's locked!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:25.95,1:05:27.31,*ENG,768,0,0,0,,We're done for!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:27.41,1:05:29.04,*ENG,769,0,0,0,,Move over!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:30.52,1:05:32.08,*ENG,770,0,0,0,,Alohomora.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:33.62,1:05:34.55,*ENG,771,0,0,0,,Get in.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:36.69,1:05:37.78,*ENG,772,0,0,0,,Alohomora?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:37.89,1:05:40.52,*ENG,773,0,0,0,,Standard Book of Spells, chapter seven.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:40.63,1:05:43.29,*ENG,774,0,0,0,,Anyone here, my sweet?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:50.60,1:05:51.76,*ENG,775,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:52.31,1:05:53.27,*ENG,776,0,0,0,,Filch is gone.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:53.37,1:05:54.74,*ENG,777,0,0,0,,He thinks this door's locked.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:54.84,1:05:55.93,*ENG,778,0,0,0,,It was locked.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:56.04,1:05:57.81,*ENG,779,0,0,0,,And for good reason.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:17.06,1:06:19.69,*ENG,780,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:06:24.04,1:06:25.83,*ENG,781,0,0,0,,What are they doing,
Dialogue: 0,1:06:25.94,1:06:29.60,*ENG,782,0,0,0,,keeping a thing like that locked up in a school?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:29.84,1:06:33.74,*ENG,783,0,0,0,,Didn't you see what it was standing on?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:33.78,1:06:35.65,*ENG,784,0,0,0,,I wasn't looking at its feet!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:35.75,1:06:38.08,*ENG,785,0,0,0,,I was preoccupied with its heads.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:38.18,1:06:41.15,*ENG,786,0,0,0,,Or maybe you didn't notice. There were three!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:41.25,1:06:42.78,*ENG,787,0,0,0,,It was standing on a trap door.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:42.89,1:06:45.02,*ENG,788,0,0,0,,It wasn't there by accident.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:45.13,1:06:46.89,*ENG,789,0,0,0,,It's guarding something.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:47.53,1:06:48.72,*ENG,790,0,0,0,,Guarding something?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:48.83,1:06:49.99,*ENG,791,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:50.10,1:06:52.93,*ENG,792,0,0,0,,Now, if you two don't mind, I'm going to bed...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:52.93,1:06:55.43,*ENG,793,0,0,0,,...before you come up with another idea
Dialogue: 0,1:06:55.54,1:06:56.59,*ENG,794,0,0,0,,to get us killed.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:56.70,1:06:59.04,*ENG,795,0,0,0,,Or worse, expelled.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:03.24,1:07:06.64,*ENG,796,0,0,0,,She needs to sort out her priorities.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:12.15,1:07:14.71,*ENG,797,0,0,0,,Quidditch is easy to understand.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:14.89,1:07:16.48,*ENG,798,0,0,0,,Each team has seven players.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:16.59,1:07:18.68,*ENG,799,0,0,0,,Three Chasers, two Beaters,
Dialogue: 0,1:07:18.79,1:07:20.49,*ENG,800,0,0,0,,one Keeper
Dialogue: 0,1:07:20.59,1:07:21.65,*ENG,801,0,0,0,,and a Seeker. That's you.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:27.60,1:07:29.33,*ENG,802,0,0,0,,There are three kinds of balls.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:29.54,1:07:31.20,*ENG,803,0,0,0,,This one's called the Quaffle.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:31.70,1:07:34.30,*ENG,804,0,0,0,,The Chasers handle the Quaffle
Dialogue: 0,1:07:34.41,1:07:37.10,*ENG,805,0,0,0,,and try to put it through one of those hoops.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:37.88,1:07:41.04,*ENG,806,0,0,0,,The Keeper, that's me, defends the hoops.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:41.18,1:07:42.38,*ENG,807,0,0,0,,With me so far?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:42.48,1:07:43.64,*ENG,808,0,0,0,,I think so.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:44.35,1:07:45.87,*ENG,809,0,0,0,,What are those?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:49.26,1:07:50.55,*ENG,810,0,0,0,,You better take this.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:01.67,1:08:03.26,*ENG,811,0,0,0,,Careful now, it's coming back.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:10.64,1:08:11.97,*ENG,812,0,0,0,,Not bad, Potter.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:13.31,1:08:14.75,*ENG,813,0,0,0,,You'd make a fair Beater.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:31.13,1:08:32.50,*ENG,814,0,0,0,,What was that?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:34.10,1:08:35.43,*ENG,815,0,0,0,,Bludger.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:35.84,1:08:37.20,*ENG,816,0,0,0,,Nasty little buggers.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:37.97,1:08:41.06,*ENG,817,0,0,0,,But you are a Seeker.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:45.15,1:08:49.31,*ENG,818,0,0,0,,The only thing I want you to worry about is this.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:49.95,1:08:51.75,*ENG,819,0,0,0,,The Golden Snitch.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:52.99,1:08:54.04,*ENG,820,0,0,0,,I like this ball.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:54.15,1:08:57.25,*ENG,821,0,0,0,,Just wait.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:57.36,1:09:00.12,*ENG,822,0,0,0,,It's wicked fast and damn near impossible to see.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:00.23,1:09:02.22,*ENG,823,0,0,0,,What do I do with it?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:02.33,1:09:05.73,*ENG,824,0,0,0,,You catch it. Before the other team's Seeker.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:05.83,1:09:08.43,*ENG,825,0,0,0,,You catch this, the game's over.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:08.57,1:09:10.33,*ENG,826,0,0,0,,You catch this, Potter,
Dialogue: 0,1:09:10.44,1:09:12.03,*ENG,827,0,0,0,,and we win.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:21.51,1:09:27.04,*ENG,828,0,0,0,,One of a wizard's most rudimentary skills is levitation...
Dialogue: 0,1:09:27.15,1:09:30.44,*ENG,829,0,0,0,,...or the ability to make objects fly.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:30.66,1:09:32.63,*ENG,830,0,0,0,,Do you have your feathers?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:32.73,1:09:33.75,*ENG,831,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:33.86,1:09:38.69,*ENG,832,0,0,0,,Now, don't forget the nice wrist movement we've been practicing.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:38.83,1:09:41.49,*ENG,833,0,0,0,,The swish and flick.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:41.60,1:09:43.09,*ENG,834,0,0,0,,Everyone.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:43.24,1:09:46.00,*ENG,835,0,0,0,,The swish and flick.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:46.37,1:09:47.24,*ENG,836,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:47.34,1:09:49.47,*ENG,837,0,0,0,,Oh, and enunciate.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:49.58,1:09:52.20,*ENG,838,0,0,0,,Wingardium Leviosa.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:52.31,1:09:53.94,*ENG,839,0,0,0,,Off you go, then.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:54.81,1:09:57.51,*ENG,840,0,0,0,,Wingardium Leviosa.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:57.62,1:09:59.85,*ENG,841,0,0,0,,Wingardium Leviosa.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:59.95,1:10:03.01,*ENG,842,0,0,0,,Wingardium Leviosa.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:03.69,1:10:05.66,*ENG,843,0,0,0,,No, stop, stop, stop!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:05.76,1:10:08.09,*ENG,844,0,0,0,,You're going to take someone's eye out.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:08.19,1:10:10.49,*ENG,845,0,0,0,,Besides, you're saying it wrong.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:10.60,1:10:12.59,*ENG,846,0,0,0,,It's Leviosa,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:12.70,1:10:14.63,*ENG,847,0,0,0,,not Leviosar.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:14.73,1:10:18.10,*ENG,848,0,0,0,,You do it then, if you're so clever.Go on, go on.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:20.27,1:10:22.43,*ENG,849,0,0,0,,Wingardium Leviosa.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:31.02,1:10:32.99,*ENG,850,0,0,0,,Well done!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:33.09,1:10:36.25,*ENG,851,0,0,0,,See here, everyone, Miss Granger's done it!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:36.36,1:10:37.82,*ENG,852,0,0,0,,Splendid!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:38.02,1:10:39.96,*ENG,853,0,0,0,,Wingardium Leviosa.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:40.06,1:10:41.22,*ENG,854,0,0,0,,Well done, dear.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:46.57,1:10:49.80,*ENG,855,0,0,0,,I think we're going to need another feather over here.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:56.91,1:10:59.07,*ENG,856,0,0,0,,"It's Leviosa,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:59.18,1:11:01.37,*ENG,857,0,0,0,,not Leviosar."
Dialogue: 0,1:11:01.48,1:11:03.47,*ENG,858,0,0,0,,She's a nightmare, honestly!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:03.58,1:11:05.88,*ENG,859,0,0,0,,No wonder she hasn't got any friends.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:07.62,1:11:09.09,*ENG,860,0,0,0,,I think she heard you.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:39.25,1:11:40.62,*ENG,861,0,0,0,,Where's Hermione?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:40.72,1:11:44.18,*ENG,862,0,0,0,,Parvati said she wouldn't come out of the bathroom.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:44.29,1:11:47.59,*ENG,863,0,0,0,,She said that she'd been in there all afternoon, crying.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:52.97,1:11:56.52,*ENG,864,0,0,0,,Troll in the dungeon!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:56.67,1:11:59.54,*ENG,865,0,0,0,,Troll in the dungeon!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:02.91,1:12:04.27,*ENG,866,0,0,0,,Thought you ought to know.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:12.22,1:12:15.21,*ENG,867,0,0,0,,Silence!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:16.42,1:12:19.82,*ENG,868,0,0,0,,Everyone will please not panic!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:21.13,1:12:22.59,*ENG,869,0,0,0,,Now...
Dialogue: 0,1:12:22.90,1:12:27.73,*ENG,870,0,0,0,,...prefects will lead their house back to the dormitories.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:27.93,1:12:32.34,*ENG,871,0,0,0,,Teachers will follow me to the dungeons.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:44.08,1:12:45.88,*ENG,872,0,0,0,,Gryffindors, keep up, please,
Dialogue: 0,1:12:45.99,1:12:47.54,*ENG,873,0,0,0,,and stay alert.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:47.65,1:12:49.05,*ENG,874,0,0,0,,How could a troll get in?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:49.16,1:12:50.42,*ENG,875,0,0,0,,Not on its own. Trolls are really stupid.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:50.52,1:12:54.19,*ENG,876,0,0,0,,Probably people playing jokes.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:54.56,1:12:55.39,*ENG,877,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:55.50,1:12:57.66,*ENG,878,0,0,0,,Hermione! She doesn't know.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:10.98,1:13:13.34,*ENG,879,0,0,0,,I think the troll's left the dungeon.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:18.35,1:13:20.22,*ENG,880,0,0,0,,It's going into the girls' bathroom.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:51.25,1:13:52.88,*ENG,881,0,0,0,,Hermione, move!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:57.06,1:13:58.46,*ENG,882,0,0,0,,Help! Help!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:59.26,1:14:00.78,*ENG,883,0,0,0,,Help!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:03.13,1:14:05.43,*ENG,884,0,0,0,,Hey, pea brain!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:17.78,1:14:19.07,*ENG,885,0,0,0,,Help!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:40.67,1:14:42.29,*ENG,886,0,0,0,,Do something!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:44.40,1:14:45.89,*ENG,887,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:46.24,1:14:47.57,*ENG,888,0,0,0,,Anything!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:49.14,1:14:50.07,*ENG,889,0,0,0,,Hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:50.18,1:14:51.73,*ENG,890,0,0,0,,Swish and flick.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:51.84,1:14:54.24,*ENG,891,0,0,0,,Wingardium Leviosa.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:05.02,1:15:06.39,*ENG,892,0,0,0,,Cool.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:31.48,1:15:33.94,*ENG,893,0,0,0,,Is it dead?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:34.25,1:15:37.52,*ENG,894,0,0,0,,I don't think so. Just knocked out.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:44.73,1:15:46.25,*ENG,895,0,0,0,,Troll boogers.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:48.24,1:15:50.70,*ENG,896,0,0,0,,Oh, my goodness!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:50.80,1:15:53.17,*ENG,897,0,0,0,,Explain yourselves, both of you!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:54.37,1:15:57.07,*ENG,898,0,0,0,,It's my fault, Professor McGonagall.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:59.91,1:16:01.54,*ENG,899,0,0,0,,Miss Granger?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:01.88,1:16:03.75,*ENG,900,0,0,0,,I went looking for the troll.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:03.85,1:16:06.71,*ENG,901,0,0,0,,I thought I could handle it.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:07.32,1:16:09.15,*ENG,902,0,0,0,,But I was wrong.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:09.46,1:16:12.65,*ENG,903,0,0,0,,If Harry and Ron hadn't come and found me,
Dialogue: 0,1:16:12.79,1:16:14.85,*ENG,904,0,0,0,,I'd probably be dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:15.46,1:16:16.72,*ENG,905,0,0,0,,Be that as it may,
Dialogue: 0,1:16:16.73,1:16:19.23,*ENG,906,0,0,0,,it was an extremely foolish thing to do.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:19.53,1:16:21.93,*ENG,907,0,0,0,,I expected more rational behavior
Dialogue: 0,1:16:21.94,1:16:25.23,*ENG,908,0,0,0,,and am very disappointed in you.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:26.04,1:16:29.13,*ENG,909,0,0,0,,Five points will be taken from Gryffindor...
Dialogue: 0,1:16:29.28,1:16:32.24,*ENG,910,0,0,0,,...for your serious lack of judgment.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:33.18,1:16:35.34,*ENG,911,0,0,0,,As for you two gentlemen...
Dialogue: 0,1:16:35.45,1:16:38.71,*ENG,912,0,0,0,,...I just hope you realize how fortunate you are.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:39.09,1:16:42.42,*ENG,913,0,0,0,,Not many first-year students could take on a troll...
Dialogue: 0,1:16:42.49,1:16:45.42,*ENG,914,0,0,0,,...and live to tell the tale.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:45.59,1:16:48.56,*ENG,915,0,0,0,,Five points...
Dialogue: 0,1:16:49.43,1:16:52.36,*ENG,916,0,0,0,,...will be awarded to each of you...
Dialogue: 0,1:16:54.17,1:16:56.96,*ENG,917,0,0,0,,...for sheer dumb luck.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:01.84,1:17:04.04,*ENG,918,0,0,0,,Perhaps you ought to go.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:04.14,1:17:05.51,*ENG,919,0,0,0,,It might wake up.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:15.39,1:17:17.82,*ENG,920,0,0,0,,Good of you to get us out of trouble
Dialogue: 0,1:17:18.00,1:17:20.51,*ENG,921,0,0,0,,We did save her life.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:20.52,1:17:24.12,*ENG,922,0,0,0,,She might not have needed saving if you hadn't insulted her.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:24.96,1:17:27.36,*ENG,923,0,0,0,,What are friends for?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:31.12,1:17:33.35,*ENG,924,0,0,0,,Take a bit of toast, mate. Go on.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:33.92,1:17:35.08,*ENG,925,0,0,0,,Ron's right.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:35.19,1:17:37.22,*ENG,926,0,0,0,,You'll need your strength today.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:37.43,1:17:38.95,*ENG,927,0,0,0,,I'm not hungry.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:40.26,1:17:42.05,*ENG,928,0,0,0,,Good luck today, Potter.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:43.47,1:17:45.43,*ENG,929,0,0,0,,You've proven yourself against a troll.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:45.43,1:17:48.50,*ENG,930,0,0,0,,A game of Quidditch should be easy work.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:49.37,1:17:52.90,*ENG,931,0,0,0,,Even if it is against Slytherin.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:00.25,1:18:02.05,*ENG,932,0,0,0,,That explains the blood.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:02.72,1:18:04.08,*ENG,933,0,0,0,,Blood?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:04.19,1:18:07.31,*ENG,934,0,0,0,,Last night, I'm guessing Snape let
Dialogue: 0,1:18:07.42,1:18:08.95,*ENG,935,0,0,0,,the troll in as a diversion...
Dialogue: 0,1:18:09.06,1:18:11.05,*ENG,936,0,0,0,,...so he could get past that dog.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:11.16,1:18:12.96,*ENG,937,0,0,0,,But he got bit,
Dialogue: 0,1:18:13.06,1:18:14.12,*ENG,938,0,0,0,,that's why he's limping.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:14.23,1:18:17.03,*ENG,939,0,0,0,,But why would anyone go near that dog?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:17.13,1:18:19.06,*ENG,940,0,0,0,,At Gringotts, Hagrid took
Dialogue: 0,1:18:19.07,1:18:20.46,*ENG,941,0,0,0,,something out of the vault.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:20.57,1:18:23.54,*ENG,942,0,0,0,,Said it was Hogwarts business, very secret.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:23.87,1:18:25.36,*ENG,943,0,0,0,,You're saying...
Dialogue: 0,1:18:25.47,1:18:27.17,*ENG,944,0,0,0,,That's what the dog's guarding.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:27.28,1:18:29.01,*ENG,945,0,0,0,,That's what Snape wants.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:43.03,1:18:44.93,*ENG,946,0,0,0,,Bit early for mail, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:45.03,1:18:47.36,*ENG,947,0,0,0,,But I never get mail.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:47.63,1:18:49.19,*ENG,948,0,0,0,,Let's open it.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:59.37,1:19:01.17,*ENG,949,0,0,0,,It's a broomstick.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:01.28,1:19:03.74,*ENG,950,0,0,0,,That's not just a broomstick,
Dialogue: 0,1:19:03.85,1:19:05.94,*ENG,951,0,0,0,,it's a Nimbus 2000!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:07.32,1:19:09.01,*ENG,952,0,0,0,,But who...
Dialogue: 0,1:19:30.57,1:19:31.80,*ENG,953,0,0,0,,Scared, Harry?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:32.17,1:19:33.37,*ENG,954,0,0,0,,A little.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:33.48,1:19:34.74,*ENG,955,0,0,0,,It's all right.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:34.88,1:19:36.94,*ENG,956,0,0,0,,I felt the same way before my first game.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:37.15,1:19:38.17,*ENG,957,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:38.28,1:19:40.77,*ENG,958,0,0,0,,I don't really remember.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:41.02,1:19:43.68,*ENG,959,0,0,0,,I took a Bludger to the head two minutes in.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:43.79,1:19:45.95,*ENG,960,0,0,0,,Woke up in hospital a week later.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:08.91,1:20:10.54,*ENG,961,0,0,0,,Welcome to Hogwarts' first
Dialogue: 0,1:20:10.65,1:20:12.31,*ENG,962,0,0,0,,Quidditch game of the season.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:12.41,1:20:15.98,*ENG,963,0,0,0,,Today's game, Slytherin versus Gryffindor!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:21.99,1:20:23.98,*ENG,964,0,0,0,,Gryffindor!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:26.50,1:20:29.95,*ENG,965,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:20:47.58,1:20:49.48,*ENG,966,0,0,0,,The players take their positions...
Dialogue: 0,1:20:49.59,1:20:53.28,*ENG,967,0,0,0,,...as Madam Hooch steps onto the field to begin the game!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:54.12,1:20:57.32,*ENG,968,0,0,0,,Now, I want a nice, clean game...
Dialogue: 0,1:20:58.09,1:21:00.06,*ENG,969,0,0,0,,...from all of you!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:05.97,1:21:08.70,*ENG,970,0,0,0,,The Bludgers are up, followed by the Golden Snitch.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:08.80,1:21:11.57,*ENG,971,0,0,0,,Remember, the Snitch is worth 150 points.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:11.71,1:21:14.68,*ENG,972,0,0,0,,The Seeker who catches the Snitch ends the game.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:21.72,1:21:23.38,*ENG,973,0,0,0,,The Quaffle is released
Dialogue: 0,1:21:23.72,1:21:25.12,*ENG,974,0,0,0,,and the game begins!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:44.37,1:21:46.20,*ENG,975,0,0,0,,Angelina Johnson scores!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:46.31,1:21:48.07,*ENG,976,0,0,0,,Ten points for Gryffindor!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:51.71,1:21:52.87,*ENG,977,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:54.52,1:21:55.74,*ENG,978,0,0,0,,Well done!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:00.22,1:22:02.21,*ENG,979,0,0,0,,Slytherin takes the Quaffle.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:02.32,1:22:04.55,*ENG,980,0,0,0,,Bletchley passes to Captain Marcus Flint.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:36.93,1:22:37.79,*ENG,981,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:37.89,1:22:40.23,*ENG,982,0,0,0,,Another 10 points to Gryffindor!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:42.80,1:22:44.20,*ENG,983,0,0,0,,Oh, Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:54.61,1:22:55.60,*ENG,984,0,0,0,,Give me that!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:27.78,1:23:29.24,*ENG,985,0,0,0,,Take that side!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:16.43,1:24:18.36,*ENG,986,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:24:19.76,1:24:21.89,*ENG,987,0,0,0,,What's going on with Harry's broomstick?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:32.11,1:24:34.34,*ENG,988,0,0,0,,It's Snape. He's jinxing the broom!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:34.44,1:24:36.60,*ENG,989,0,0,0,,Jinxing the broom? What do we do?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:36.71,1:24:37.74,*ENG,990,0,0,0,,Leave it to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:42.22,1:24:43.34,*ENG,991,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:25:00.77,1:25:02.10,*ENG,992,0,0,0,,Come on, Hermione!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:16.25,1:25:18.81,*ENG,993,0,0,0,,Lacarnum Inflamarae.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:27.13,1:25:28.29,*ENG,994,0,0,0,,Fire!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:28.40,1:25:29.69,*ENG,995,0,0,0,,You're on fire!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:47.98,1:25:50.35,*ENG,996,0,0,0,,Go, go, go, go!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:42.14,1:26:43.54,*ENG,997,0,0,0,,Looks like he's gonna be sick.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:46.71,1:26:47.70,*ENG,998,0,0,0,,He's got the Snitch!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:47.81,1:26:51.31,*ENG,999,0,0,0,,Harry Potter receives 150 points for catching the Snitch!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:51.48,1:26:53.11,*ENG,1000,0,0,0,,Gryffindor wins!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:57.05,1:26:58.21,*ENG,1001,0,0,0,,Oh, No!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:02.12,1:27:03.45,*ENG,1002,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:29.02,1:27:31.38,*ENG,1003,0,0,0,,Gryffindor! Gryffindor!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:31.49,1:27:35.22,*ENG,1004,0,0,0,,Gryffindor! Gryffindor!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:36.59,1:27:37.45,*ENG,1005,0,0,0,,Nonsense!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:37.56,1:27:39.82,*ENG,1006,0,0,0,,Why would Snape put a curse on Harry's broom?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:40.23,1:27:41.39,*ENG,1007,0,0,0,,Who knows?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:42.20,1:27:45.33,*ENG,1008,0,0,0,,Why was he trying to get past that three-headed dog?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:45.50,1:27:46.90,*ENG,1009,0,0,0,,Who told you about Fluffy?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:47.00,1:27:47.87,*ENG,1010,0,0,0,,Fluffy?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:47.97,1:27:49.77,*ENG,1011,0,0,0,,That thing has a name?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:49.87,1:27:51.81,*ENG,1012,0,0,0,,Of course he has a name. He's mine.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:51.91,1:27:55.07,*ENG,1013,0,0,0,,I bought him off an Irishman.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:55.08,1:27:57.27,*ENG,1014,0,0,0,,I lent him to Dumbledore to guard...
Dialogue: 0,1:27:57.38,1:27:59.57,*ENG,1015,0,0,0,,Shouldn't have said that.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:59.68,1:28:02.21,*ENG,1016,0,0,0,,No more questions! That's top-secret.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:03.62,1:28:06.71,*ENG,1017,0,0,0,,But whatever Fluffy's guarding, Snape's trying to steal it.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:06.82,1:28:08.29,*ENG,1018,0,0,0,,Codswallop.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:08.39,1:28:10.55,*ENG,1019,0,0,0,,Professor Snape is a Hogwarts teacher.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:10.66,1:28:12.49,*ENG,1020,0,0,0,,Teacher or not,
Dialogue: 0,1:28:12.59,1:28:13.96,*ENG,1021,0,0,0,,I know a spell when I see one.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:14.06,1:28:16.22,*ENG,1022,0,0,0,,I've read all about them.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:16.33,1:28:17.73,*ENG,1023,0,0,0,,You've got to keep eye contact,
Dialogue: 0,1:28:17.83,1:28:19.89,*ENG,1024,0,0,0,,and Snape wasn't blinking.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:20.00,1:28:21.40,*ENG,1025,0,0,0,,Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:22.57,1:28:25.60,*ENG,1026,0,0,0,,Now, you listen to me, all three of you.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:25.71,1:28:28.68,*ENG,1027,0,0,0,,You're meddling in things that ought not to be meddled in.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:28.91,1:28:30.47,*ENG,1028,0,0,0,,It's dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:30.58,1:28:32.01,*ENG,1029,0,0,0,,What that dog is guarding is
Dialogue: 0,1:28:32.11,1:28:35.74,*ENG,1030,0,0,0,,between Dumbledore and Nicholas Flamel.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:35.85,1:28:37.72,*ENG,1031,0,0,0,,Nicholas Flamel?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:38.35,1:28:39.79,*ENG,1032,0,0,0,,I shouldn't have said that.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:39.89,1:28:43.35,*ENG,1033,0,0,0,,I should not have said that.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:43.36,1:28:44.52,*ENG,1034,0,0,0,,Nicholas Flamel.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:45.49,1:28:47.39,*ENG,1035,0,0,0,,Who's Nicholas Flamel?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:47.56,1:28:49.03,*ENG,1036,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:08.52,1:29:09.78,*ENG,1037,0,0,0,,Merry Christmas
Dialogue: 0,1:29:09.88,1:29:11.32,*ENG,1038,0,0,0,,Merry Christmas
Dialogue: 0,1:29:11.42,1:29:14.15,*ENG,1039,0,0,0,,Ring the Hogwart bell
Dialogue: 0,1:29:34.11,1:29:36.48,*ENG,1040,0,0,0,,Knight to E-5.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:44.99,1:29:46.98,*ENG,1041,0,0,0,,Queen to E-5.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:52.73,1:29:54.59,*ENG,1042,0,0,0,,That's totally barbaric!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:54.70,1:29:56.79,*ENG,1043,0,0,0,,That's wizard's chess.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:57.37,1:29:58.46,*ENG,1044,0,0,0,,I see you've packed.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:58.57,1:30:00.06,*ENG,1045,0,0,0,,I see you haven't.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:00.17,1:30:02.00,*ENG,1046,0,0,0,,Change of plans. My parents
Dialogue: 0,1:30:02.10,1:30:05.27,*ENG,1047,0,0,0,,went to Romania to visit my brother Charlie.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:05.64,1:30:07.20,*ENG,1048,0,0,0,,He's studying dragons there.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:07.31,1:30:09.74,*ENG,1049,0,0,0,,Good. You can help Harry.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:09.84,1:30:13.54,*ENG,1050,0,0,0,,He's going to the library to look up Nicholas Flamel.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:13.65,1:30:16.24,*ENG,1051,0,0,0,,We've looked a hundred times!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:17.59,1:30:19.92,*ENG,1052,0,0,0,,Not in the restricted section.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:20.42,1:30:21.68,*ENG,1053,0,0,0,,Happy Christmas.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:24.93,1:30:27.79,*ENG,1054,0,0,0,,I think we've had a bad influence on her.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:30.40,1:30:31.96,*ENG,1055,0,0,0,,Harry, wake up!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:32.17,1:30:33.96,*ENG,1056,0,0,0,,Come on, Harry, wake up!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:44.68,1:30:45.81,*ENG,1057,0,0,0,,Happy Christmas, Harry.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:45.91,1:30:47.35,*ENG,1058,0,0,0,,Happy Christmas, Ron.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:48.18,1:30:49.98,*ENG,1059,0,0,0,,What are you wearing?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:50.19,1:30:53.15,*ENG,1060,0,0,0,,Oh, my mum made it.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:53.32,1:30:54.85,*ENG,1061,0,0,0,,Looks like you've got one too.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:54.96,1:30:57.22,*ENG,1062,0,0,0,,I've got presents?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:57.33,1:30:58.49,*ENG,1063,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:04.73,1:31:07.00,*ENG,1064,0,0,0,,There they are.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:19.05,1:31:22.24,*ENG,1065,0,0,0,,"Your father left this in my possession before he died.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:22.35,1:31:24.91,*ENG,1066,0,0,0,,It is time it was returned to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:25.02,1:31:26.51,*ENG,1067,0,0,0,,Use it well."
Dialogue: 0,1:31:43.54,1:31:44.87,*ENG,1068,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:45.11,1:31:47.34,*ENG,1069,0,0,0,,Some kind of cloak.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:47.44,1:31:49.50,*ENG,1070,0,0,0,,Well, let's see, then. Put it on.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:56.25,1:31:57.41,*ENG,1071,0,0,0,,My body's gone!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:57.45,1:32:01.45,*ENG,1072,0,0,0,,I know what that is. That's an invisibility cloak!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:01.56,1:32:02.92,*ENG,1073,0,0,0,,I'm invisible?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:03.76,1:32:05.42,*ENG,1074,0,0,0,,They're really rare.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:07.16,1:32:08.63,*ENG,1075,0,0,0,,I wonder who gave it to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:08.73,1:32:10.13,*ENG,1076,0,0,0,,There was no name.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:10.37,1:32:12.09,*ENG,1077,0,0,0,,It just said,
Dialogue: 0,1:32:12.27,1:32:13.13,*ENG,1078,0,0,0,,"Use it well."
Dialogue: 0,1:32:25.48,1:32:27.31,*ENG,1079,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:32:41.70,1:32:43.99,*ENG,1080,0,0,0,,Famous Fire-Eaters.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:44.10,1:32:47.07,*ENG,1081,0,0,0,,Fifteenth-Century Fiends.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:47.64,1:32:49.30,*ENG,1082,0,0,0,,Flamel. Nicholas Flamel.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:49.40,1:32:50.63,*ENG,1083,0,0,0,,Where are you?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:51.04,1:32:52.27,*ENG,1084,0,0,0,,Where are you?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:12.33,1:33:13.56,*ENG,1085,0,0,0,,Who's there?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:20.47,1:33:21.96,*ENG,1086,0,0,0,,I know you're in there.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:23.17,1:33:24.87,*ENG,1087,0,0,0,,You can't hide.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:33.45,1:33:34.64,*ENG,1088,0,0,0,,Who is it?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:34.95,1:33:36.28,*ENG,1089,0,0,0,,Show yourself.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:24.00,1:34:26.46,*ENG,1090,0,0,0,,Severus, I...
Dialogue: 0,1:34:26.57,1:34:30.13,*ENG,1091,0,0,0,,You don't want me as your enemy, Quirrell.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:30.51,1:34:32.44,*ENG,1092,0,0,0,,I don't know what you mean.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:32.54,1:34:34.30,*ENG,1093,0,0,0,,You know perfectly well what I mean.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:52.53,1:34:55.36,*ENG,1094,0,0,0,,We'll have another little chat soon.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:55.70,1:35:00.50,*ENG,1095,0,0,0,,When you've had time to decide where your loyalties lie.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:00.80,1:35:02.50,*ENG,1096,0,0,0,,Professors.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:02.60,1:35:06.44,*ENG,1097,0,0,0,,I found this in the restricted section.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:06.54,1:35:08.13,*ENG,1098,0,0,0,,It's still hot.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:08.24,1:35:10.87,*ENG,1099,0,0,0,,That means there's a student out of bed.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:43.67,1:36:45.16,*ENG,1100,0,0,0,,Mum?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:48.78,1:36:50.11,*ENG,1101,0,0,0,,Dad?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:25.35,1:37:27.51,*ENG,1102,0,0,0,,Ron, you've really gotta see this!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:27.62,1:37:29.01,*ENG,1103,0,0,0,,Ron, you've gotta see this!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:32.19,1:37:35.31,*ENG,1104,0,0,0,,Ron, come on, get out of bed!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:35.42,1:37:36.25,*ENG,1105,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:36.36,1:37:38.99,*ENG,1106,0,0,0,,There's something you've got to see!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:45.63,1:37:47.16,*ENG,1107,0,0,0,,Come on! Come!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:47.27,1:37:48.70,*ENG,1108,0,0,0,,Come look, it's my parents!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:51.37,1:37:53.43,*ENG,1109,0,0,0,,I only see us.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:53.54,1:37:56.64,*ENG,1110,0,0,0,,Look in properly. Go on, stand there.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:57.08,1:37:59.27,*ENG,1111,0,0,0,,There. You see them, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:59.38,1:38:03.51,*ENG,1112,0,0,0,,That's me! Only I'm head boy.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:03.62,1:38:05.88,*ENG,1113,0,0,0,,And I'm holding the Quidditch Cup.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:05.99,1:38:10.98,*ENG,1114,0,0,0,,And bloody hell! I'm Quidditch captain too!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:11.33,1:38:13.66,*ENG,1115,0,0,0,,I look good.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:14.53,1:38:18.43,*ENG,1116,0,0,0,,Harry, do you think this mirror shows the future?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:18.53,1:38:20.36,*ENG,1117,0,0,0,,How can it?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:20.50,1:38:22.59,*ENG,1118,0,0,0,,Both my parents are dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:37.39,1:38:38.96,*ENG,1119,0,0,0,,Do you like yours, Ron?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:43.63,1:38:44.63,*ENG,1120,0,0,0,,Ron?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:44.88,1:38:45.97,*ENG,1121,0,0,0,,l'll be right back.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:57.69,1:38:59.67,*ENG,1122,0,0,0,,Wanna play chess
Dialogue: 0,1:38:59.97,1:39:00.50,*ENG,1CHS,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:00.69,1:39:02.30,*ENG,1124,0,0,0,,Wanna go and visit Hagrid?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:02.45,1:39:03.85,*ENG,1125,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:05.15,1:39:07.15,*ENG,1126,0,0,0,,l know what you're thinking, but don't.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:07.20,1:39:11.65,*ENG,1127,0,0,0,,There's something not right about that mirror.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:40.16,1:39:42.99,*ENG,1128,0,0,0,,Back again, Harry?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:44.33,1:39:47.03,*ENG,1129,0,0,0,,I see that you, like many before you...
Dialogue: 0,1:39:47.14,1:39:51.59,*ENG,1130,0,0,0,,...have discovered the delights of the Mirror of Erised.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:52.57,1:39:57.77,*ENG,1131,0,0,0,,I trust by now you realize what it does.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:58.95,1:40:00.60,*ENG,1132,0,0,0,,Let me give you a clue.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:01.08,1:40:03.45,*ENG,1133,0,0,0,,The happiest man on earth...
Dialogue: 0,1:40:03.55,1:40:07.30,*ENG,1134,0,0,0,,...would look in the mirror and see only himself...
Dialogue: 0,1:40:07.31,1:40:09.64,*ENG,1135,0,0,0,,...exactly as he is.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:09.82,1:40:13.16,*ENG,1136,0,0,0,,So then, it shows us what we want.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:13.26,1:40:14.82,*ENG,1137,0,0,0,,Whatever we want.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:14.93,1:40:16.40,*ENG,1138,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:16.50,1:40:18.12,*ENG,1139,0,0,0,,And no.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:18.57,1:40:21.33,*ENG,1140,0,0,0,,It shows us nothing more or less...
Dialogue: 0,1:40:21.44,1:40:26.84,*ENG,1141,0,0,0,,...than the deepest and most desperate desires of our hearts.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:27.48,1:40:31.58,*ENG,1142,0,0,0,,Now you, Harry, who have never known your family...
Dialogue: 0,1:40:31.71,1:40:35.54,*ENG,1143,0,0,0,,...you see them standing beside you.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:35.95,1:40:38.24,*ENG,1144,0,0,0,,But remember this, Harry.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:39.19,1:40:47.12,*ENG,1145,0,0,0,,This mirror gives us neither knowledge or truth.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:48.26,1:40:51.66,*ENG,1146,0,0,0,,Men have wasted away in front of it.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:51.77,1:40:53.79,*ENG,1147,0,0,0,,Even gone mad.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:55.34,1:40:59.36,*ENG,1148,0,0,0,,That is why tomorrow, it will be moved to a new home.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:59.71,1:41:02.30,*ENG,1149,0,0,0,,And I must ask you...
Dialogue: 0,1:41:02.41,1:41:06.51,*ENG,1150,0,0,0,,...not to go looking for it again.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:07.18,1:41:10.91,*ENG,1151,0,0,0,,It does not do to dwell on dreams...
Dialogue: 0,1:41:11.05,1:41:14.08,*ENG,1152,0,0,0,,...and forget to live.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:09.90,1:42:11.10,*ENG,1153,0,0,0,,Hi, Hedwig.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:13.60,1:42:17.50,*ENG,1154,0,0,0,,Look at you, playing with your cards. Pathetic!
Dialogue: 0,1:42:17.80,1:42:19.90,*ENG,1155,0,0,0,,We've got final exams soon.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:20.10,1:42:23.30,*ENG,1156,0,0,0,,l'm ready. Ask me any question.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:23.60,1:42:27.50,*ENG,1157,0,0,0,,What are the ingredients in a Forgetfulness Potion?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:27.80,1:42:29.10,*ENG,1158,0,0,0,,l forgot.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:29.15,1:42:32.20,*ENG,1159,0,0,0,,What do you plan to do if it's in the exam?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:32.28,1:42:33.30,*ENG,1160,0,0,0,,- Copy off you - No, you won't.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:33.30,1:42:40.30,*ENG,1161,0,0,0,,Besides, we're to be given special quills with an Anti-Cheating Spell.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:40.39,1:42:45.50,*ENG,1162,0,0,0,,That's insulting! lt's as if they don't trust us! Dumbledore again!
Dialogue: 0,1:42:50.60,1:42:51.90,*ENG,1163,0,0,0,,Leg-Locker Curse?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:52.20,1:42:54.10,*ENG,1164,0,0,0,,Malfoy.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:59.50,1:43:02.90,*ENG,1165,0,0,0,,You have got to start standing up to people.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:03.10,1:43:06.30,*ENG,1166,0,0,0,,How? l can barely stand at all!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:07.10,1:43:08.90,*ENG,1167,0,0,0,,l'll do the countercurse!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:09.00,1:43:12.98,*ENG,1168,0,0,0,,No, that's all l need! You to set my kneecaps on fire!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:13.99,1:43:17.60,*ENG,1169,0,0,0,,l don't appreciate the insinuation, Longbottom.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:17.64,1:43:20.32,*ENG,1170,0,0,0,,Besides, if anyone cared to notice...
Dialogue: 0,1:43:20.33,1:43:24.92,*ENG,1171,0,0,0,,...my eyebrows have completely grown back!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:28.60,1:43:29.60,*ENG,1172,0,0,0,,l found him!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:30.10,1:43:36.30,*ENG,1173,0,0,0,,''Dumbledore is famous for defeating the dark wizard Grindelwald in 1945.''
Dialogue: 0,1:43:36.50,1:43:42.60,*ENG,1174,0,0,0,,For discovering dragon blood...and his alchemy work with Nicholas Flamel'' !
Dialogue: 0,1:43:42.69,1:43:46.58,*ENG,1175,0,0,0,,l knew it was familiar. l read it on the train.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:46.61,1:43:47.60,*ENG,1176,0,0,0,,Follow me!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:53.10,1:43:56.80,*ENG,1177,0,0,0,,Wait! Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,1:43:57.50,1:44:00.00,*ENG,1178,0,0,0,,What about the countercurse?
Dialogue: 0,1:44:02.88,1:44:05.07,*ENG,1179,0,0,0,,I had you looking in the wrong section.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:05.18,1:44:07.81,*ENG,1180,0,0,0,,How could I be so stupid?
Dialogue: 0,1:44:08.42,1:44:11.78,*ENG,1181,0,0,0,,I checked this out weeks ago for a bit of light reading.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:11.89,1:44:14.18,*ENG,1182,0,0,0,,This is light?
Dialogue: 0,1:44:18.89,1:44:21.05,*ENG,1183,0,0,0,,Of course! Here it is!
Dialogue: 0,1:44:21.16,1:44:25.53,*ENG,1184,0,0,0,,Nicholas Flamel is the only known maker of the Sorcerer's Stone.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:25.63,1:44:27.12,*ENG,1185,0,0,0,,The what?
Dialogue: 0,1:44:27.23,1:44:29.93,*ENG,1186,0,0,0,,Honestly, don't you two read?
Dialogue: 0,1:44:30.37,1:44:33.07,*ENG,1187,0,0,0,,"The Sorcerer's Stone is a legendary
Dialogue: 0,1:44:33.17,1:44:35.20,*ENG,1188,0,0,0,,substance with astonishing powers.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:35.31,1:44:37.74,*ENG,1189,0,0,0,,It'll transform any metal into pure gold...
Dialogue: 0,1:44:37.84,1:44:39.97,*ENG,1190,0,0,0,,...and produces the Elixir of Life
Dialogue: 0,1:44:40.08,1:44:42.01,*ENG,1191,0,0,0,,which will make the drinker immortal."
Dialogue: 0,1:44:42.12,1:44:43.10,*ENG,1192,0,0,0,,Immortal?
Dialogue: 0,1:44:43.22,1:44:44.27,*ENG,1193,0,0,0,,It means you'll never die.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:44.38,1:44:46.32,*ENG,1194,0,0,0,,I know what it means!
Dialogue: 0,1:44:47.35,1:44:49.98,*ENG,1195,0,0,0,,"The only Stone currently in existence
Dialogue: 0,1:44:50.09,1:44:52.29,*ENG,1196,0,0,0,,belongs to Mr. Nicholas Flamel...
Dialogue: 0,1:44:52.39,1:44:54.02,*ENG,1197,0,0,0,,...the noted alchemist
Dialogue: 0,1:44:54.13,1:44:58.53,*ENG,1198,0,0,0,,who last year celebrated his 665th birthday."
Dialogue: 0,1:44:59.13,1:45:01.53,*ENG,1199,0,0,0,,That's what Fluffy's guarding.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:01.63,1:45:05.47,*ENG,1200,0,0,0,,That's what's under the trap door. The Sorcerer's Stone.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:23.99,1:45:25.62,*ENG,1201,0,0,0,,Don't wish to be rude,
Dialogue: 0,1:45:25.73,1:45:27.22,*ENG,1202,0,0,0,,but I'm in no state to entertain.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:27.23,1:45:29.39,*ENG,1203,0,0,0,,We know about the Sorcerer's Stone.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:34.70,1:45:36.13,*ENG,1204,0,0,0,,We think Snape's trying to steal it.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:37.40,1:45:39.63,*ENG,1205,0,0,0,,Are you still on about him?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:39.84,1:45:41.57,*ENG,1206,0,0,0,,We know he's after it.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:41.67,1:45:43.04,*ENG,1207,0,0,0,,We don't know why.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:43.14,1:45:46.04,*ENG,1208,0,0,0,,Snape is one of the teachers protecting the Stone.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:46.21,1:45:48.27,*ENG,1209,0,0,0,,He won't steal it. What?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:48.38,1:45:49.81,*ENG,1210,0,0,0,,You heard.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:49.92,1:45:52.71,*ENG,1211,0,0,0,,Come on, I'm a bit preoccupied today.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:53.12,1:45:55.11,*ENG,1212,0,0,0,,Wait a minute. "One of the teachers"?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:55.22,1:45:58.88,*ENG,1213,0,0,0,,There are other things defending the Stone, aren't there?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:58.99,1:46:00.69,*ENG,1214,0,0,0,,Spells, enchantments.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:00.79,1:46:04.73,*ENG,1215,0,0,0,,Right. Waste of bloody time, if you ask me.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:05.03,1:46:07.66,*ENG,1216,0,0,0,,Ain't no one gonna get past Fluffy.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:07.77,1:46:11.53,*ENG,1217,0,0,0,,Ain't a soul knows how, except for me and Dumbledore.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:11.64,1:46:14.51,*ENG,1218,0,0,0,,I shouldn't have told you that.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:28.42,1:46:31.36,*ENG,1219,0,0,0,,Hagrid, what exactly is that?
Dialogue: 0,1:46:31.46,1:46:33.15,*ENG,1220,0,0,0,,That? It's...
Dialogue: 0,1:46:34.33,1:46:36.06,*ENG,1221,0,0,0,,I know what that is!
Dialogue: 0,1:46:36.70,1:46:39.39,*ENG,1222,0,0,0,,But, Hagrid, how did you get one?
Dialogue: 0,1:46:39.50,1:46:42.96,*ENG,1223,0,0,0,,I won it. Off a stranger I met down at the pub.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:43.07,1:46:46.47,*ENG,1224,0,0,0,,Seemed quite glad to be rid of it, as a matter of fact.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:09.46,1:47:12.16,*ENG,1225,0,0,0,,Is that...
Dialogue: 0,1:47:12.50,1:47:13.90,*ENG,1226,0,0,0,,...a dragon?
Dialogue: 0,1:47:14.00,1:47:18.37,*ENG,1227,0,0,0,,That's not just a dragon. That's a Norwegian Ridgeback.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:18.47,1:47:21.44,*ENG,1228,0,0,0,,My brother works with these in Romania.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:21.54,1:47:23.17,*ENG,1229,0,0,0,,Isn't he beautiful?
Dialogue: 0,1:47:23.28,1:47:25.61,*ENG,1230,0,0,0,,Oh, bless him. Look, he knows his mummy.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:27.01,1:47:28.67,*ENG,1231,0,0,0,,Hello, Norbert.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:29.12,1:47:30.24,*ENG,1232,0,0,0,,Norbert?
Dialogue: 0,1:47:30.35,1:47:32.88,*ENG,1233,0,0,0,,He's gotta have a name, don't he?
Dialogue: 0,1:47:34.19,1:47:36.31,*ENG,1234,0,0,0,,Don't you, Norbert?
Dialogue: 0,1:47:42.70,1:47:45.79,*ENG,1235,0,0,0,,He'll have to be trained up a bit, of course.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:50.57,1:47:51.94,*ENG,1236,0,0,0,,Who's that?
Dialogue: 0,1:47:54.37,1:47:55.84,*ENG,1237,0,0,0,,Malfoy.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:56.54,1:47:58.64,*ENG,1238,0,0,0,,Oh, dear.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:00.48,1:48:02.04,*ENG,1239,0,0,0,,Hagrid always wanted a dragon.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:02.28,1:48:04.05,*ENG,1240,0,0,0,,Told me so the first time I met him.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:04.75,1:48:06.65,*ENG,1241,0,0,0,,It's crazy.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:07.32,1:48:09.62,*ENG,1242,0,0,0,,And worse, Malfoy knows.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:09.72,1:48:11.75,*ENG,1243,0,0,0,,I don't understand. Is that bad?
Dialogue: 0,1:48:11.86,1:48:13.33,*ENG,1244,0,0,0,,It's bad.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:14.03,1:48:15.32,*ENG,1245,0,0,0,,Good evening.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:19.80,1:48:22.79,*ENG,1246,0,0,0,,Nothing, I repeat, nothing...
Dialogue: 0,1:48:22.90,1:48:26.60,*ENG,1247,0,0,0,,...gives a student the right to walk about at night.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:26.74,1:48:29.44,*ENG,1248,0,0,0,,Therefore, as punishment for your actions,
Dialogue: 0,1:48:29.54,1:48:31.64,*ENG,1249,0,0,0,,50 points will be taken.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:31.74,1:48:33.04,*ENG,1250,0,0,0,,50?!
Dialogue: 0,1:48:33.15,1:48:34.74,*ENG,1251,0,0,0,,Each.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:35.15,1:48:37.62,*ENG,1252,0,0,0,,To ensure it doesn't happen again...
Dialogue: 0,1:48:37.72,1:48:40.55,*ENG,1253,0,0,0,,...all four of you will receive detention.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:41.99,1:48:43.32,*ENG,1254,0,0,0,,Excuse me, professor,
Dialogue: 0,1:48:43.42,1:48:44.95,*ENG,1255,0,0,0,,perhaps I heard you wrong.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:45.06,1:48:47.49,*ENG,1256,0,0,0,,I thought you said the four of us.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:47.59,1:48:49.36,*ENG,1257,0,0,0,,No, you heard me correctly.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:49.46,1:48:51.02,*ENG,1258,0,0,0,,Honorable as your intentions were,
Dialogue: 0,1:48:51.03,1:48:55.83,*ENG,1259,0,0,0,,you too were out of bed after hours.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:55.94,1:48:59.43,*ENG,1260,0,0,0,,You will join your classmates in detention.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:10.12,1:49:13.28,*ENG,1261,0,0,0,,A pity they let the old punishments die.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:13.89,1:49:15.75,*ENG,1262,0,0,0,,Was a time detention found you
Dialogue: 0,1:49:15.86,1:49:18.48,*ENG,1263,0,0,0,,hanging by your thumbs in the dungeons.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:18.86,1:49:21.09,*ENG,1264,0,0,0,,God, I miss the screaming.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:23.60,1:49:26.50,*ENG,1265,0,0,0,,You'll be serving detention with Hagrid tonight.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:27.00,1:49:31.87,*ENG,1266,0,0,0,,He's got a little job to do inside the Dark Forest.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:35.51,1:49:37.60,*ENG,1267,0,0,0,,A sorry lot, this, Hagrid.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:40.11,1:49:41.21,*ENG,1268,0,0,0,,Good God,
Dialogue: 0,1:49:41.31,1:49:44.18,*ENG,1269,0,0,0,,you're not still on about that bloody dragon, are you?
Dialogue: 0,1:49:47.85,1:49:48.92,*ENG,1270,0,0,0,,Norbert's gone.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:49.72,1:49:53.55,*ENG,1271,0,0,0,,Dumbledore sent him off to Romania to live in a colony.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:53.66,1:49:55.13,*ENG,1272,0,0,0,,That's good,
Dialogue: 0,1:49:55.23,1:49:57.03,*ENG,1273,0,0,0,,isn't it? He's with his own kind.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:57.13,1:49:59.50,*ENG,1274,0,0,0,,What if he don't like Romania?
Dialogue: 0,1:49:59.60,1:50:02.19,*ENG,1275,0,0,0,,What if the other dragons are mean to him?
Dialogue: 0,1:50:02.37,1:50:04.39,*ENG,1276,0,0,0,,He's only a baby.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:04.50,1:50:08.06,*ENG,1277,0,0,0,,For God's sake, pull yourself together.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:08.17,1:50:09.90,*ENG,1278,0,0,0,,You're going into the Forest.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:10.04,1:50:12.48,*ENG,1279,0,0,0,,Got to have your wits about you.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:12.58,1:50:15.38,*ENG,1280,0,0,0,,The Forest? I thought that was a joke.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:15.48,1:50:17.64,*ENG,1281,0,0,0,,We can't go in there.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:18.08,1:50:20.61,*ENG,1282,0,0,0,,Students aren't allowed.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:20.72,1:50:22.75,*ENG,1283,0,0,0,,And there are...
Dialogue: 0,1:50:24.06,1:50:25.72,*ENG,1284,0,0,0,,...werewolves.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:25.83,1:50:29.09,*ENG,1285,0,0,0,,There's more than werewolves in those trees.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:29.23,1:50:31.46,*ENG,1286,0,0,0,,You can be sure of that.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:33.97,1:50:35.52,*ENG,1287,0,0,0,,Nighty-night.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:39.07,1:50:40.37,*ENG,1288,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:40.87,1:50:42.00,*ENG,1289,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:17.98,1:51:21.14,*ENG,1290,0,0,0,,Hagrid, what is that?
Dialogue: 0,1:51:21.25,1:51:23.41,*ENG,1291,0,0,0,,What we're here for.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:24.25,1:51:25.15,*ENG,1292,0,0,0,,See that?
Dialogue: 0,1:51:25.22,1:51:27.68,*ENG,1293,0,0,0,,That's unicorn blood, that is.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:28.29,1:51:31.09,*ENG,1294,0,0,0,,I found one dead a few weeks ago.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:31.26,1:51:32.49,*ENG,1295,0,0,0,,Now,
Dialogue: 0,1:51:32.96,1:51:35.86,*ENG,1296,0,0,0,,this one's been hurt bad by something.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:44.64,1:51:45.93,*ENG,1297,0,0,0,,So,
Dialogue: 0,1:51:45.97,1:51:47.41,*ENG,1298,0,0,0,,it's our job to go
Dialogue: 0,1:51:47.41,1:51:49.47,*ENG,1299,0,0,0,,and find the poor beast.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:49.58,1:51:51.63,*ENG,1300,0,0,0,,Ron, Hermione, come with me.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:51.78,1:51:52.83,*ENG,1301,0,0,0,,Ok
Dialogue: 0,1:51:53.01,1:51:55.57,*ENG,1302,0,0,0,,And, Harry, you'll go with Malfoy.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:57.72,1:51:59.95,*ENG,1303,0,0,0,,Okay. Then I get Fang.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:00.05,1:52:01.52,*ENG,1304,0,0,0,,Fine.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:01.62,1:52:05.02,*ENG,1305,0,0,0,,Just so you know, he's a bloody coward.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:09.53,1:52:12.09,*ENG,1306,0,0,0,,Wait till my father hears about this.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:12.20,1:52:14.43,*ENG,1307,0,0,0,,This is servant's stuff.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:14.67,1:52:16.64,*ENG,1308,0,0,0,,If I didn't know better,
Dialogue: 0,1:52:16.74,1:52:18.36,*ENG,1309,0,0,0,,I'd say you were scared.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:18.47,1:52:20.87,*ENG,1310,0,0,0,,I'm not scared, Potter.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:22.51,1:52:24.27,*ENG,1311,0,0,0,,Do you hear that?
Dialogue: 0,1:52:26.95,1:52:28.14,*ENG,1312,0,0,0,,Come on, Fang.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:28.85,1:52:30.11,*ENG,1313,0,0,0,,Scared!
Dialogue: 0,1:52:55.27,1:52:56.43,*ENG,1314,0,0,0,,What is it, Fang?
Dialogue: 0,1:53:08.53,1:53:15.49,*ENG,1315,0,0,0,,help...help....
Dialogue: 0,1:54:07.81,1:54:11.17,*ENG,1316,0,0,0,,Harry Potter, you must leave.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:11.28,1:54:13.38,*ENG,1317,0,0,0,,You are known to many creatures here.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:13.49,1:54:16.11,*ENG,1318,0,0,0,,The Forest is not safe at this time.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:16.22,1:54:17.75,*ENG,1319,0,0,0,,Especially for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:17.86,1:54:20.42,*ENG,1320,0,0,0,,What was that thing you saved me from?
Dialogue: 0,1:54:20.53,1:54:23.12,*ENG,1321,0,0,0,,A monstrous creature.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:23.23,1:54:26.13,*ENG,1322,0,0,0,,It is a terrible crime to slay a unicorn.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:26.23,1:54:29.40,*ENG,1323,0,0,0,,Drinking its blood will keep you alive
Dialogue: 0,1:54:29.50,1:54:31.87,*ENG,1324,0,0,0,,even if you are an inch from death.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:31.97,1:54:34.06,*ENG,1325,0,0,0,,But at a terrible price.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:34.17,1:54:37.17,*ENG,1326,0,0,0,,For you have slain something so pure...
Dialogue: 0,1:54:37.28,1:54:40.14,*ENG,1327,0,0,0,,...that the moment the blood touches your lips,
Dialogue: 0,1:54:40.25,1:54:42.48,*ENG,1328,0,0,0,,you will have a half-life.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:42.58,1:54:44.28,*ENG,1329,0,0,0,,A cursed life.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:44.42,1:54:46.88,*ENG,1330,0,0,0,,Who would choose such a life?
Dialogue: 0,1:54:46.99,1:54:48.19,*ENG,1331,0,0,0,,Can you think of no one?
Dialogue: 0,1:54:49.49,1:54:50.75,*ENG,1332,0,0,0,,Do you mean to say that
Dialogue: 0,1:54:50.86,1:54:53.65,*ENG,1333,0,0,0,,that thing that killed the unicorn...
Dialogue: 0,1:54:53.76,1:54:56.19,*ENG,1334,0,0,0,,...that was drinking its blood,
Dialogue: 0,1:54:56.30,1:54:57.82,*ENG,1335,0,0,0,,that was Voldemort?
Dialogue: 0,1:54:57.93,1:54:59.50,*ENG,1336,0,0,0,,Do you know what is hidden
Dialogue: 0,1:54:59.50,1:55:02.23,*ENG,1337,0,0,0,,in the school at this very moment?
Dialogue: 0,1:55:03.87,1:55:05.60,*ENG,1338,0,0,0,,The Sorcerer's Stone.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:06.87,1:55:08.13,*ENG,1339,0,0,0,,Harry!
Dialogue: 0,1:55:09.21,1:55:10.87,*ENG,1340,0,0,0,,Hello there, Firenze.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:11.28,1:55:14.07,*ENG,1341,0,0,0,,See you've met our young Mr. Potter.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:14.28,1:55:15.50,*ENG,1342,0,0,0,,You all right there, Harry?
Dialogue: 0,1:55:17.35,1:55:19.11,*ENG,1343,0,0,0,,Harry Potter,
Dialogue: 0,1:55:19.22,1:55:21.31,*ENG,1344,0,0,0,,this is where I leave you.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:22.46,1:55:24.05,*ENG,1345,0,0,0,,You're safe now.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:24.86,1:55:26.29,*ENG,1346,0,0,0,,Good luck.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:33.73,1:55:36.29,*ENG,1347,0,0,0,,You mean, You-Know-Who is out there
Dialogue: 0,1:55:36.40,1:55:38.27,*ENG,1348,0,0,0,,right now in the Forest?
Dialogue: 0,1:55:38.37,1:55:39.30,*ENG,1349,0,0,0,,But he's weak.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:39.41,1:55:41.31,*ENG,1350,0,0,0,,He's living for unicorn.


Dialogue: 0,1:55:41.41,1:55:42.50,*ENG,1351,0,0,0,,Don't you see?
Dialogue: 0,1:55:42.61,1:55:44.08,*ENG,1352,0,0,0,,We had it wrong.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:44.18,1:55:46.58,*ENG,1353,0,0,0,,Snape doesn't want the Stone for himself.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:46.68,1:55:48.70,*ENG,1354,0,0,0,,He wants it for Voldemort.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:48.88,1:55:50.14,*ENG,1355,0,0,0,,With the Elixir of Life,
Dialogue: 0,1:55:50.25,1:55:51.94,*ENG,1356,0,0,0,,Voldemort will be strong again.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:52.05,1:55:55.51,*ENG,1357,0,0,0,,He'll come back.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:55.62,1:55:57.21,*ENG,1358,0,0,0,,But if he comes back...
Dialogue: 0,1:55:57.32,1:56:01.99,*ENG,1359,0,0,0,,...you don't think he'll try to kill you, do you?
Dialogue: 0,1:56:02.43,1:56:05.69,*ENG,1360,0,0,0,,If he'd had the chance, he might have tried tonight.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:06.33,1:56:10.20,*ENG,1361,0,0,0,,And to think I've been worrying about my Potions final.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:10.30,1:56:14.00,*ENG,1362,0,0,0,,Hang on a minute. We're forgetting one thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:14.11,1:56:18.10,*ENG,1363,0,0,0,,Who's the one wizard Voldemort always feared?
Dialogue: 0,1:56:19.61,1:56:21.08,*ENG,1364,0,0,0,,Dumbledore.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:21.18,1:56:24.71,*ENG,1365,0,0,0,,As long as Dumbledore is around, Harry, you're safe.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:24.92,1:56:26.65,*ENG,1366,0,0,0,,As long as Dumbledore is around,
Dialogue: 0,1:56:26.75,1:56:28.78,*ENG,1367,0,0,0,,you can't be touched.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:34.73,1:56:38.26,*ENG,1368,0,0,0,,I'd heard Hogwarts' final exams were frightful,
Dialogue: 0,1:56:38.33,1:56:40.56,*ENG,1369,0,0,0,,but I found that enjoyable.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:40.67,1:56:42.16,*ENG,1370,0,0,0,,Speak for yourself.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:42.27,1:56:43.83,*ENG,1371,0,0,0,,All right there, Harry?
Dialogue: 0,1:56:44.27,1:56:45.97,*ENG,1372,0,0,0,,My scar.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:46.07,1:56:47.70,*ENG,1373,0,0,0,,It keeps burning.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:48.21,1:56:49.80,*ENG,1374,0,0,0,,It's happened before.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:49.91,1:56:51.04,*ENG,1375,0,0,0,,Not like this.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:51.14,1:56:52.58,*ENG,1376,0,0,0,,You should see the nurse.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:52.68,1:56:54.15,*ENG,1377,0,0,0,,I think it's a warning.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:54.25,1:56:56.41,*ENG,1378,0,0,0,,It means danger's coming.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:02.09,1:57:05.72,*ENG,1379,0,0,0,,- Of course! - What is it?
Dialogue: 0,1:57:06.29,1:57:07.82,*ENG,1380,0,0,0,,Isn't it odd that what Hagrid wants
Dialogue: 0,1:57:07.93,1:57:10.12,*ENG,1381,0,0,0,,more than anything is a dragon...
Dialogue: 0,1:57:10.23,1:57:12.86,*ENG,1382,0,0,0,,...and a stranger just happens to have one?
Dialogue: 0,1:57:12.97,1:57:16.33,*ENG,1383,0,0,0,,How many people wander around with dragon eggs?
Dialogue: 0,1:57:16.44,1:57:18.30,*ENG,1384,0,0,0,,Why didn't I see it before?
Dialogue: 0,1:57:24.34,1:57:26.54,*ENG,1385,0,0,0,,Who gave you the egg?
Dialogue: 0,1:57:26.65,1:57:27.98,*ENG,1386,0,0,0,,What did he look like?
Dialogue: 0,1:57:28.08,1:57:30.07,*ENG,1387,0,0,0,,I never saw his face.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:30.18,1:57:30.94,*ENG,1388,0,0,0,,He kept his hood up.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:31.05,1:57:34.18,*ENG,1389,0,0,0,,You and this stranger must have taliked.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:34.29,1:57:37.95,*ENG,1390,0,0,0,,He wanted to know what sort of creatures I looked after.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:38.06,1:57:40.22,*ENG,1391,0,0,0,,I said, "After Fluffy,
Dialogue: 0,1:57:40.33,1:57:42.19,*ENG,1392,0,0,0,,a dragon's gonna be no problem."
Dialogue: 0,1:57:42.29,1:57:44.49,*ENG,1393,0,0,0,,Was he interested in Fluffy?
Dialogue: 0,1:57:44.66,1:57:46.93,*ENG,1394,0,0,0,,Of course he was interested.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:47.03,1:57:51.36,*ENG,1395,0,0,0,,How often do you come across a three-headed dog?
Dialogue: 0,1:57:51.44,1:57:53.00,*ENG,1396,0,0,0,,But I told him,
Dialogue: 0,1:57:53.11,1:57:55.37,*ENG,1397,0,0,0,,"The trick with any beast is to know
Dialogue: 0,1:57:55.47,1:57:57.14,*ENG,1398,0,0,0,,how to calm him."
Dialogue: 0,1:57:57.24,1:57:58.97,*ENG,1399,0,0,0,,Take Fluffy, for example.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:59.08,1:58:01.87,*ENG,1400,0,0,0,,Play him music and he falls straight to sleep.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:04.38,1:58:06.35,*ENG,1401,0,0,0,,I shouldn't have told you that.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:07.19,1:58:09.45,*ENG,1402,0,0,0,,Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,1:58:16.33,1:58:18.09,*ENG,1403,0,0,0,,We have to see Dumbledore.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:18.20,1:58:19.60,*ENG,1404,0,0,0,,Immediately!
Dialogue: 0,1:58:19.70,1:58:21.93,*ENG,1405,0,0,0,,I'm afraid he's not here.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:22.07,1:58:27.06,*ENG,1406,0,0,0,,He received an urgent owl from the Ministry of Magic and left.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:27.17,1:58:28.40,*ENG,1407,0,0,0,,He's gone?
Dialogue: 0,1:58:28.51,1:58:30.20,*ENG,1408,0,0,0,,But this is important!
Dialogue: 0,1:58:30.31,1:58:32.78,*ENG,1409,0,0,0,,This is about the Sorcerer's Stone!
Dialogue: 0,1:58:34.15,1:58:37.08,*ENG,1410,0,0,0,,- How do you know... - Someone's going to try and steal it.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:38.48,1:58:40.51,*ENG,1411,0,0,0,,I don't know how you know,
Dialogue: 0,1:58:40.62,1:58:43.35,*ENG,1412,0,0,0,,but I assure you it is well protected.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:43.89,1:58:46.36,*ENG,1413,0,0,0,,Now would you go back to your dormitories?
Dialogue: 0,1:58:46.66,1:58:47.69,*ENG,1414,0,0,0,,Quietly.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:56.60,1:58:58.57,*ENG,1415,0,0,0,,That was no stranger Hagrid met.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:58.67,1:58:59.60,*ENG,1416,0,0,0,,It was Snape.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:59.71,1:59:02.14,*ENG,1417,0,0,0,,Which means he knows how to get past Fluffy.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:02.24,1:59:03.71,*ENG,1418,0,0,0,,And with Dumbledore gone...
Dialogue: 0,1:59:03.81,1:59:05.50,*ENG,1419,0,0,0,,Good afternoon.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:09.11,1:59:11.75,*ENG,1420,0,0,0,,What would three young Gryffindors...
Dialogue: 0,1:59:11.75,1:59:15.91,*ENG,1421,0,0,0,,...be doing inside on a day like this?
Dialogue: 0,1:59:22.03,1:59:24.15,*ENG,1422,0,0,0,,- We were just... - You ought to be careful.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:24.76,1:59:27.25,*ENG,1423,0,0,0,,People will think you're...
Dialogue: 0,1:59:31.04,1:59:33.44,*ENG,1424,0,0,0,,...up to something.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:43.95,1:59:45.68,*ENG,1425,0,0,0,,Now what do we do?
Dialogue: 0,1:59:46.45,1:59:48.18,*ENG,1426,0,0,0,,We go down the trap door.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:48.42,1:59:49.65,*ENG,1427,0,0,0,,Tonight.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:04.37,2:00:05.50,*ENG,1428,0,0,0,,Trevor.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:05.64,2:00:06.70,*ENG,1429,0,0,0,,Trevor,
Dialogue: 0,2:00:06.81,2:00:08.24,*ENG,1430,0,0,0,,go! You shouldn't be here!
Dialogue: 0,2:00:09.41,2:00:11.04,*ENG,1431,0,0,0,,Neither should you.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:12.54,2:00:14.74,*ENG,1432,0,0,0,,You're sneaking out again, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,2:00:14.85,2:00:16.68,*ENG,1433,0,0,0,,Neville, listen. We were...
Dialogue: 0,2:00:16.78,2:00:19.05,*ENG,1434,0,0,0,,- We were... - No, I won't let you!
Dialogue: 0,2:00:19.15,2:00:21.42,*ENG,1435,0,0,0,,You'll get Gryffindor into trouble again.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:21.52,2:00:23.85,*ENG,1436,0,0,0,,I'll fight you.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:23.96,2:00:26.29,*ENG,1437,0,0,0,,Neville, I'm really sorry about this.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:26.39,2:00:28.36,*ENG,1438,0,0,0,,Petrificus Totalus.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:36.20,2:00:38.60,*ENG,1439,0,0,0,,You're a little scary sometimes,
Dialogue: 0,2:00:38.70,2:00:40.10,*ENG,1440,0,0,0,,you know that?
Dialogue: 0,2:00:40.21,2:00:43.30,*ENG,1441,0,0,0,,Brilliant, but scary.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:44.64,2:00:45.84,*ENG,1442,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:46.85,2:00:50.54,*ENG,1443,0,0,0,,- Sorry. - It's for your own good, you know.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:56.42,2:00:58.39,*ENG,1444,0,0,0,,You stood on my foot!
Dialogue: 0,2:00:58.49,2:00:59.72,*ENG,1445,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:04.30,2:01:06.03,*ENG,1446,0,0,0,,Alohomora.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:17.94,2:01:20.88,*ENG,1447,0,0,0,,Wait a minute. He's...
Dialogue: 0,2:01:22.15,2:01:23.71,*ENG,1448,0,0,0,,...snoring.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:25.99,2:01:27.79,*ENG,1449,0,0,0,,Snape's already been here.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:28.32,2:01:30.28,*ENG,1450,0,0,0,,He's put a spell on the harp.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:32.96,2:01:37.06,*ENG,1451,0,0,0,,It's got horrible breath.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:39.60,2:01:40.86,*ENG,1452,0,0,0,,We have to move its paw.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:40.97,2:01:41.83,*ENG,1453,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,2:01:41.93,2:01:42.99,*ENG,1454,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,2:01:45.17,2:01:46.80,*ENG,1455,0,0,0,,Okay. Push.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:12.53,2:02:13.86,*ENG,1456,0,0,0,,I'll go first.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:13.97,2:02:16.09,*ENG,1457,0,0,0,,Don't follow until I give you a sign.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:16.40,2:02:20.53,*ENG,1458,0,0,0,,If something bad happens, get yourselves out.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:22.14,2:02:26.30,*ENG,1459,0,0,0,,Does it seem a bit quiet to you?
Dialogue: 0,2:02:26.45,2:02:28.28,*ENG,1460,0,0,0,,The harp.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:29.11,2:02:30.78,*ENG,1461,0,0,0,,It's stopped playing.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:42.86,2:02:43.73,*ENG,1462,0,0,0,,Jump!
Dialogue: 0,2:02:43.96,2:02:45.33,*ENG,1463,0,0,0,,Jump!
Dialogue: 0,2:02:56.84,2:02:59.83,*ENG,1464,0,0,0,,Lucky this plant thing's here, really.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:15.19,2:03:16.79,*ENG,1465,0,0,0,,Stop moving, both of you.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:16.90,2:03:18.26,*ENG,1466,0,0,0,,This is Devil's Snare.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:18.36,2:03:19.66,*ENG,1467,0,0,0,,You have to relax.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:19.77,2:03:22.17,*ENG,1468,0,0,0,,If you don't, it will only kill you faster.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:22.27,2:03:23.60,*ENG,1469,0,0,0,,Kill us faster?
Dialogue: 0,2:03:23.70,2:03:26.17,*ENG,1470,0,0,0,,Oh, now I can relax!
Dialogue: 0,2:03:29.48,2:03:31.14,*ENG,1471,0,0,0,,Hermione!
Dialogue: 0,2:03:31.31,2:03:32.74,*ENG,1472,0,0,0,,Now what are we gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,2:03:32.85,2:03:34.57,*ENG,1473,0,0,0,,Just relax!
Dialogue: 0,2:03:35.35,2:03:37.08,*ENG,1474,0,0,0,,Hermione, where are you?
Dialogue: 0,2:03:37.18,2:03:38.77,*ENG,1475,0,0,0,,Do what I say!
Dialogue: 0,2:03:38.88,2:03:40.25,*ENG,1476,0,0,0,,Trust me.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:43.56,2:03:44.72,*ENG,1477,0,0,0,,Ah! Harry!
Dialogue: 0,2:03:45.26,2:03:46.59,*ENG,1478,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,2:03:47.03,2:03:47.82,*ENG,1479,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,2:03:47.93,2:03:50.15,*ENG,1480,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:50.50,2:03:52.09,*ENG,1481,0,0,0,,He's not relaxing, is he?
Dialogue: 0,2:03:52.20,2:03:53.63,*ENG,1482,0,0,0,,Apparently not.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:53.73,2:03:55.67,*ENG,1483,0,0,0,,- We've gotta do something. - What?
Dialogue: 0,2:03:55.77,2:03:58.79,*ENG,1484,0,0,0,,I remember reading something in Herbology.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:00.44,2:04:01.91,*ENG,1485,0,0,0,,Devil's Snare, Devil's Snare.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:02.01,2:04:04.17,*ENG,1486,0,0,0,,It's deadly fun...
Dialogue: 0,2:04:04.28,2:04:05.77,*ENG,1487,0,0,0,,...but will sulk in the sun!
Dialogue: 0,2:04:05.88,2:04:08.57,*ENG,1488,0,0,0,,That's it! It hates sunlight.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:08.95,2:04:10.68,*ENG,1489,0,0,0,,Lumus Solem.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:19.12,2:04:20.06,*ENG,1490,0,0,0,,Ron, you okay?
Dialogue: 0,2:04:20.16,2:04:21.35,*ENG,1491,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:24.30,2:04:26.36,*ENG,1492,0,0,0,,Lucky we didn't panic.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:27.50,2:04:30.63,*ENG,1493,0,0,0,,Lucky Hermione pays attention in Herbology.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:32.77,2:04:34.24,*ENG,1494,0,0,0,,What is that?
Dialogue: 0,2:04:34.34,2:04:35.77,*ENG,1495,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:36.68,2:04:37.87,*ENG,1496,0,0,0,,Sounds like wings.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:51.39,2:04:52.45,*ENG,1497,0,0,0,,Curious.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:52.56,2:04:54.82,*ENG,1498,0,0,0,,I've never seen birds like these.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:55.03,2:04:58.69,*ENG,1499,0,0,0,,They're not birds. They're keys.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:58.80,2:05:01.20,*ENG,1500,0,0,0,,And I'll bet one of them fits that door.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:05.67,2:05:07.83,*ENG,1501,0,0,0,,What's this all about?
Dialogue: 0,2:05:07.94,2:05:09.67,*ENG,1502,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:16.45,2:05:17.85,*ENG,1503,0,0,0,,Strange.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:18.72,2:05:20.55,*ENG,1504,0,0,0,,Alohomora!
Dialogue: 0,2:05:23.86,2:05:26.29,*ENG,1505,0,0,0,,Well, it was worth a try.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:26.49,2:05:27.92,*ENG,1506,0,0,0,,What will we do?
Dialogue: 0,2:05:28.03,2:05:29.82,*ENG,1507,0,0,0,,There must be a thousand keys.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:29.93,2:05:32.16,*ENG,1508,0,0,0,,We want a big, old-fashioned one.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:32.26,2:05:33.66,*ENG,1509,0,0,0,,Probably rusty.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:33.77,2:05:37.43,*ENG,1510,0,0,0,,I see it! The one with the broken wing.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:40.91,2:05:42.70,*ENG,1511,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,2:05:44.38,2:05:45.90,*ENG,1512,0,0,0,,It's too simple.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:46.01,2:05:47.67,*ENG,1513,0,0,0,,Go on!
Dialogue: 0,2:05:47.78,2:05:49.91,*ENG,1514,0,0,0,,If Snape could catch it on that old broomstick,
Dialogue: 0,2:05:50.01,2:05:50.85,*ENG,1515,0,0,0,,you can.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:50.95,2:05:53.65,*ENG,1516,0,0,0,,You're the youngest Seeker in a century.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:11.34,2:06:13.36,*ENG,1517,0,0,0,,This complicates things a bit.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:35.59,2:06:36.96,*ENG,1518,0,0,0,,Catch the key!
Dialogue: 0,2:06:41.87,2:06:42.99,*ENG,1519,0,0,0,,Hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,2:07:16.23,2:07:18.13,*ENG,1520,0,0,0,,I don't like this.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:19.34,2:07:21.20,*ENG,1521,0,0,0,,I don't like this at all.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:21.31,2:07:22.71,*ENG,1522,0,0,0,,Where are we?
Dialogue: 0,2:07:23.01,2:07:24.60,*ENG,1523,0,0,0,,A graveyard.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:24.71,2:07:26.74,*ENG,1524,0,0,0,,This is no graveyard.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:34.85,2:07:36.82,*ENG,1525,0,0,0,,It's a chessboard.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:49.74,2:07:51.26,*ENG,1526,0,0,0,,There's the door.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:03.92,2:08:05.47,*ENG,1527,0,0,0,,Now what do we do?
Dialogue: 0,2:08:05.58,2:08:06.95,*ENG,1528,0,0,0,,It's obvious, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,2:08:07.05,2:08:09.11,*ENG,1529,0,0,0,,We've got to play our way across the room.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:10.36,2:08:11.38,*ENG,1530,0,0,0,,Harry,
Dialogue: 0,2:08:11.49,2:08:14.36,*ENG,1531,0,0,0,,you take the empty bishop's square.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:14.46,2:08:18.09,*ENG,1532,0,0,0,,Hermione, you'll be the queen-side castle.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:18.83,2:08:20.66,*ENG,1533,0,0,0,,As for me,
Dialogue: 0,2:08:20.77,2:08:22.39,*ENG,1534,0,0,0,,I'll be a knight.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:29.98,2:08:31.64,*ENG,1535,0,0,0,,What happens now?
Dialogue: 0,2:08:32.61,2:08:35.60,*ENG,1536,0,0,0,,Well, white moves first.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:35.81,2:08:37.84,*ENG,1537,0,0,0,,And then...
Dialogue: 0,2:08:39.38,2:08:41.22,*ENG,1538,0,0,0,,...we play.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:51.23,2:08:52.72,*ENG,1539,0,0,0,,Ron,
Dialogue: 0,2:08:52.83,2:08:55.96,*ENG,1540,0,0,0,,you don't suppose this is going to be like...
Dialogue: 0,2:08:56.07,2:08:59.59,*ENG,1541,0,0,0,,...real wizard's chess, do you?
Dialogue: 0,2:09:00.44,2:09:03.10,*ENG,1542,0,0,0,,You there, D-5.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:18.09,2:09:19.75,*ENG,1543,0,0,0,,Yes, Hermione.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:19.86,2:09:22.42,*ENG,1544,0,0,0,,I think this is gonna be
Dialogue: 0,2:09:22.53,2:09:24.79,*ENG,1545,0,0,0,,exactly like wizard's chess.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:30.67,2:09:33.33,*ENG,1546,0,0,0,,Castle to E-4!
Dialogue: 0,2:09:36.91,2:09:39.04,*ENG,1547,0,0,0,,Pawn to C-3!
Dialogue: 0,2:10:24.09,2:10:25.59,*ENG,1548,0,0,0,,Wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:25.59,2:10:28.18,*ENG,1549,0,0,0,,You understand right, Harry.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:28.29,2:10:30.73,*ENG,1550,0,0,0,,Once I make my move,
Dialogue: 0,2:10:30.83,2:10:33.39,*ENG,1551,0,0,0,,the queen will take me.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:33.50,2:10:35.80,*ENG,1552,0,0,0,,Then you're free to check the king.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:35.90,2:10:37.77,*ENG,1553,0,0,0,,No. Ron, no!
Dialogue: 0,2:10:37.87,2:10:39.27,*ENG,1554,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,2:10:39.37,2:10:40.93,*ENG,1555,0,0,0,,He's going to sacrifice himself.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:41.04,2:10:44.01,*ENG,1556,0,0,0,,No, there must be another way!
Dialogue: 0,2:10:44.11,2:10:47.60,*ENG,1557,0,0,0,,Do you wanna stop Snape from getting that Stone or not?
Dialogue: 0,2:10:48.18,2:10:52.18,*ENG,1558,0,0,0,,Harry, it's you that has to go on.I know it.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:52.25,2:10:55.45,*ENG,1559,0,0,0,,Not me. Not Hermione. You.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:05.43,2:11:08.23,*ENG,1560,0,0,0,,Knight to H-3.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:29.22,2:11:30.98,*ENG,1561,0,0,0,,Check.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:00.29,2:12:01.78,*ENG,1562,0,0,0,,Ron!
Dialogue: 0,2:12:02.32,2:12:04.29,*ENG,1563,0,0,0,,No, don't move!
Dialogue: 0,2:12:04.39,2:12:07.19,*ENG,1564,0,0,0,,Don't forget, we're still playing.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:23.27,2:12:24.80,*ENG,1565,0,0,0,,Checkmate.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:44.50,2:12:45.72,*ENG,1566,0,0,0,,Take care of Ron.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:45.83,2:12:47.06,*ENG,1567,0,0,0,,Then go to the owlery.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:47.17,2:12:49.03,*ENG,1568,0,0,0,,Send a message to Dumbledore.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:49.20,2:12:51.03,*ENG,1569,0,0,0,,Ron's right.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:51.20,2:12:52.50,*ENG,1570,0,0,0,,I have to go on.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:53.54,2:12:55.47,*ENG,1571,0,0,0,,You'll be okay, Harry.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:55.87,2:12:57.54,*ENG,1572,0,0,0,,You're a great wizard.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:57.64,2:12:59.17,*ENG,1573,0,0,0,,You really are.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:59.84,2:13:01.37,*ENG,1574,0,0,0,,Not as good as you.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:03.11,2:13:05.98,*ENG,1575,0,0,0,,Me? Books and cleverness.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:06.08,2:13:08.81,*ENG,1576,0,0,0,,There are more important things.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:09.09,2:13:12.25,*ENG,1577,0,0,0,,Friendship and bravery.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:12.36,2:13:14.85,*ENG,1578,0,0,0,,And, Harry, just be careful.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:52.70,2:13:54.13,*ENG,1579,0,0,0,,You?
Dialogue: 0,2:13:55.67,2:13:57.76,*ENG,1580,0,0,0,,No, it can't be.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:57.87,2:13:59.30,*ENG,1581,0,0,0,,Snape, he was the...
Dialogue: 0,2:13:59.40,2:14:01.70,*ENG,1582,0,0,0,,Yes, he does seem the type, doesn't he?
Dialogue: 0,2:14:02.71,2:14:04.80,*ENG,1583,0,0,0,,Next to him, who would suspect...
Dialogue: 0,2:14:04.91,2:14:09.40,*ENG,1584,0,0,0,,...poor, stuttering Professor Quirrell?
Dialogue: 0,2:14:09.51,2:14:13.75,*ENG,1585,0,0,0,,But that day, during the Quidditch match,
Dialogue: 0,2:14:13.85,2:14:15.18,*ENG,1586,0,0,0,,Snape tried to kill me.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:15.29,2:14:16.88,*ENG,1587,0,0,0,,No, dear boy.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:16.99,2:14:18.89,*ENG,1588,0,0,0,,I tried to kill you!
Dialogue: 0,2:14:18.99,2:14:23.72,*ENG,1589,0,0,0,,If Snape's cloak hadn't caught fire and broken my eye contact...
Dialogue: 0,2:14:23.86,2:14:25.69,*ENG,1590,0,0,0,,...I would have succeeded.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:25.80,2:14:29.10,*ENG,1591,0,0,0,,Even with Snape muttering his countercurse.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:29.20,2:14:31.36,*ENG,1592,0,0,0,,Snape was trying to save me?
Dialogue: 0,2:14:31.47,2:14:33.84,*ENG,1593,0,0,0,,I knew you were a danger to me,
Dialogue: 0,2:14:33.94,2:14:36.41,*ENG,1594,0,0,0,,especially after Halloween.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:36.71,2:14:39.01,*ENG,1595,0,0,0,,Then you let the troll in!
Dialogue: 0,2:14:39.11,2:14:41.20,*ENG,1596,0,0,0,,Very good, Potter, yes.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:41.51,2:14:44.91,*ENG,1597,0,0,0,,Snape, unfortunately, wasn't fooled.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:45.02,2:14:46.95,*ENG,1598,0,0,0,,While everyone ran about,
Dialogue: 0,2:14:47.05,2:14:49.45,*ENG,1599,0,0,0,,he went to the third floor to head me off.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:50.82,2:14:54.88,*ENG,1600,0,0,0,,He, of course, never trusted me again.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:55.33,2:14:57.73,*ENG,1601,0,0,0,,He rarely left me alone.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:57.90,2:15:00.16,*ENG,1602,0,0,0,,But he doesn't understand.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:00.77,2:15:04.06,*ENG,1603,0,0,0,,I'm never alone. Never.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:05.04,2:15:06.30,*ENG,1604,0,0,0,,Now,
Dialogue: 0,2:15:06.40,2:15:08.90,*ENG,1605,0,0,0,,what does this mirror do?
Dialogue: 0,2:15:10.68,2:15:13.30,*ENG,1606,0,0,0,,I see what I desire.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:13.41,2:15:16.40,*ENG,1607,0,0,0,,I see myself holding the Stone.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:16.51,2:15:18.21,*ENG,1608,0,0,0,,But how do I get it?
Dialogue: 0,2:15:18.32,2:15:20.41,*ENG,1609,0,0,0,,Use the boy.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:20.99,2:15:23.18,*ENG,1610,0,0,0,,Come here, Potter!
Dialogue: 0,2:15:23.29,2:15:24.72,*ENG,1611,0,0,0,,Now!
Dialogue: 0,2:15:36.97,2:15:38.49,*ENG,1612,0,0,0,,Tell me,
Dialogue: 0,2:15:38.60,2:15:40.47,*ENG,1613,0,0,0,,what do you see?
Dialogue: 0,2:16:06.10,2:16:08.03,*ENG,1614,0,0,0,,What is it? What do you see?
Dialogue: 0,2:16:08.17,2:16:11.62,*ENG,1615,0,0,0,,I'm shaking hands with Dumbledore.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:11.74,2:16:14.14,*ENG,1616,0,0,0,,I've won the house cup.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:14.24,2:16:16.14,*ENG,1617,0,0,0,,He lies.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:16.24,2:16:17.97,*ENG,1618,0,0,0,,Tell the truth!
Dialogue: 0,2:16:18.08,2:16:20.07,*ENG,1619,0,0,0,,What do you see?
Dialogue: 0,2:16:20.18,2:16:22.65,*ENG,1620,0,0,0,,Let me speak to him.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:22.75,2:16:24.54,*ENG,1621,0,0,0,,Master, you are not strong enough.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:24.65,2:16:29.05,*ENG,1622,0,0,0,,I have strength enough for this.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:46.94,2:16:49.93,*ENG,1623,0,0,0,,Harry Potter...
Dialogue: 0,2:16:50.04,2:16:52.57,*ENG,1624,0,0,0,,...we meet again.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:52.68,2:16:54.14,*ENG,1625,0,0,0,,Voldemort.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:54.25,2:16:55.77,*ENG,1626,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:55.88,2:16:58.47,*ENG,1627,0,0,0,,You see what I've become?
Dialogue: 0,2:16:58.58,2:17:02.08,*ENG,1628,0,0,0,,See what I must do to survive?
Dialogue: 0,2:17:02.29,2:17:04.72,*ENG,1629,0,0,0,,Live off another.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:04.82,2:17:06.98,*ENG,1630,0,0,0,,A mere parasite.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:07.09,2:17:10.79,*ENG,1631,0,0,0,,Unicorn blood can sustain me...
Dialogue: 0,2:17:10.90,2:17:14.26,*ENG,1632,0,0,0,,...but it cannot give me a body of my own.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:14.40,2:17:17.83,*ENG,1633,0,0,0,,But there is something that can.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:17.84,2:17:20.26,*ENG,1634,0,0,0,,Something that, conveniently enough,
Dialogue: 0,2:17:20.27,2:17:23.50,*ENG,1635,0,0,0,,lies in your pocket.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:24.01,2:17:25.70,*ENG,1636,0,0,0,,Stop him!
Dialogue: 0,2:17:30.85,2:17:32.28,*ENG,1637,0,0,0,,Don't be a fool.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:32.65,2:17:41.28,*ENG,1638,0,0,0,,Why suffer an horrific death...when you can join me and live?
Dialogue: 0,2:17:41.39,2:17:42.69,*ENG,1639,0,0,0,,Never!
Dialogue: 0,2:17:44.23,2:17:46.22,*ENG,1640,0,0,0,,Bravery.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:46.53,2:17:49.63,*ENG,1641,0,0,0,,Your parents had it too
Dialogue: 0,2:17:49.80,2:17:51.27,*ENG,1642,0,0,0,,Tell me,
Dialogue: 0,2:17:51.67,2:17:53.10,*ENG,1643,0,0,0,,Harry...
Dialogue: 0,2:17:53.40,2:17:57.27,*ENG,1644,0,0,0,,...would you like to see your mother and father again?
Dialogue: 0,2:17:57.41,2:17:58.92,*ENG,1645,0,0,0,,Together...
Dialogue: 0,2:17:58.98,2:18:02.74,*ENG,1646,0,0,0,,...we can bring them back.
Dialogue: 0,2:18:02.88,2:18:07.61,*ENG,1647,0,0,0,,All I ask is for something in return.
Dialogue: 0,2:18:14.16,2:18:17.15,*ENG,1648,0,0,0,,That's it, Harry.
Dialogue: 0,2:18:17.20,2:18:22.20,*ENG,1649,0,0,0,,There is no good and evil.
Dialogue: 0,2:18:22.43,2:18:25.10,*ENG,1650,0,0,0,,There is only power...
Dialogue: 0,2:18:25.10,2:18:30.14,*ENG,1651,0,0,0,,...and those too weak to seek it.
Dialogue: 0,2:18:30.48,2:18:35.03,*ENG,1652,0,0,0,,Together, we'll do extraordinary things.
Dialogue: 0,2:18:35.91,2:18:39.41,*ENG,1653,0,0,0,,Just give me the Stone!
Dialogue: 0,2:18:40.79,2:18:42.12,*ENG,1654,0,0,0,,You liar!
Dialogue: 0,2:18:42.22,2:18:43.78,*ENG,1655,0,0,0,,Kill him!
Dialogue: 0,2:19:07.78,2:19:09.41,*ENG,1656,0,0,0,,What is this magic?
Dialogue: 0,2:19:09.51,2:19:12.45,*ENG,1657,0,0,0,,Fool, get the Stone!
Dialogue: 0,2:20:47.45,2:20:48.81,*ENG,1658,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,2:20:58.32,2:21:00.22,*ENG,1659,0,0,0,,Good afternoon, Harry.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:00.99,2:21:05.39,*ENG,1660,0,0,0,,Tokens from your admirers?
Dialogue: 0,2:21:06.10,2:21:07.56,*ENG,1661,0,0,0,,Admirers?
Dialogue: 0,2:21:07.70,2:21:11.69,*ENG,1662,0,0,0,,What happened in the dungeons between you and Professor
Dialogue: 0,2:21:11.80,2:21:13.74,*ENG,1663,0,0,0,,Quirrell is a secret.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:13.84,2:21:18.54,*ENG,1664,0,0,0,,So, naturally, the whole school knows.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:20.88,2:21:23.97,*ENG,1665,0,0,0,,I see that your friend Ronald has saved you the trouble...
Dialogue: 0,2:21:23.98,2:21:27.85,*ENG,1666,0,0,0,,...of opening your Chocolate Frogs.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:27.95,2:21:29.94,*ENG,1667,0,0,0,,Ron was here? Is he all right?
Dialogue: 0,2:21:30.05,2:21:31.04,*ENG,1668,0,0,0,,What about Hermione?
Dialogue: 0,2:21:31.16,2:21:32.95,*ENG,1669,0,0,0,,Fine.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:33.16,2:21:35.56,*ENG,1670,0,0,0,,They're both just fine.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:36.29,2:21:37.78,*ENG,1671,0,0,0,,What happened to the Stone?
Dialogue: 0,2:21:37.90,2:21:39.69,*ENG,1672,0,0,0,,Relax, dear boy.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:39.80,2:21:42.20,*ENG,1673,0,0,0,,The Stone has been destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:43.03,2:21:45.94,*ENG,1674,0,0,0,,My friend Nicholas and I have had a little chat...
Dialogue: 0,2:21:46.04,2:21:51.07,*ENG,1675,0,0,0,,...and agreed it was best all around.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:51.81,2:21:55.35,*ENG,1676,0,0,0,,But then, Flamel, he'll die, won't he?
Dialogue: 0,2:21:56.42,2:22:00.18,*ENG,1677,0,0,0,,He has enough Elixir to
Dialogue: 0,2:22:00.19,2:22:02.55,*ENG,1678,0,0,0,,set his affairs in order.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:02.72,2:22:03.88,*ENG,1679,0,0,0,,But yes,
Dialogue: 0,2:22:04.09,2:22:06.02,*ENG,1680,0,0,0,,he will die.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:06.72,2:22:08.92,*ENG,1681,0,0,0,,How is it I got the Stone, sir?
Dialogue: 0,2:22:09.03,2:22:11.85,*ENG,1682,0,0,0,,One minute I was staring in the mirror and...
Dialogue: 0,2:22:12.10,2:22:15.09,*ENG,1683,0,0,0,,You see, only a person...
Dialogue: 0,2:22:15.20,2:22:18.43,*ENG,1684,0,0,0,,...who wanted to find the Stone, find it...
Dialogue: 0,2:22:18.54,2:22:21.30,*ENG,1685,0,0,0,,...but not use it,
Dialogue: 0,2:22:21.31,2:22:24.83,*ENG,1686,0,0,0,,would be able to get it.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:25.91,2:22:29.90,*ENG,1687,0,0,0,,That is one of my more brilliant ideas.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:30.01,2:22:31.35,*ENG,1688,0,0,0,,And between you and me,
Dialogue: 0,2:22:31.35,2:22:34.61,*ENG,1689,0,0,0,,that is saying something.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:36.09,2:22:39.25,*ENG,1690,0,0,0,,Does that mean, with the Stone gone,
Dialogue: 0,2:22:39.36,2:22:41.45,*ENG,1691,0,0,0,,that Voldemort can never come back?
Dialogue: 0,2:22:41.56,2:22:44.36,*ENG,1692,0,0,0,,I'm afraid...
Dialogue: 0,2:22:45.26,2:22:47.76,*ENG,1693,0,0,0,,...there are ways in which he can return.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:49.24,2:22:51.33,*ENG,1694,0,0,0,,do you know why...
Dialogue: 0,2:22:51.64,2:22:56.37,*ENG,1695,0,0,0,,...Professor Quirrell couldn't bear to have you touch him?
Dialogue: 0,2:22:57.04,2:22:59.37,*ENG,1696,0,0,0,,It was because of your mother.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:59.48,2:23:02.17,*ENG,1697,0,0,0,,She sacrificed herself for you.
Dialogue: 0,2:23:02.28,2:23:05.61,*ENG,1698,0,0,0,,And that kind of act leaves a mark.
Dialogue: 0,2:23:05.72,2:23:09.62,*ENG,1699,0,0,0,,No, this kind of mark cannot be seen.
Dialogue: 0,2:23:09.72,2:23:12.75,*ENG,1700,0,0,0,,It lives in your very skin.
Dialogue: 0,2:23:12.86,2:23:14.88,*ENG,1701,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,2:23:15.49,2:23:19.26,*ENG,1702,0,0,0,,Love, Harry. Love.
Dialogue: 0,2:23:26.34,2:23:31.60,*ENG,1703,0,0,0,,Bertie Bott's Every Flavor Beans.
Dialogue: 0,2:23:31.98,2:23:33.81,*ENG,1704,0,0,0,,I was most unfortunate in my youth
Dialogue: 0,2:23:33.81,2:23:35.61,*ENG,1705,0,0,0,,to come across a vomit-flavored one.
Dialogue: 0,2:23:35.81,2:23:39.88,*ENG,1706,0,0,0,,And since then, I've lost my king for them.
Dialogue: 0,2:23:39.98,2:23:43.52,*ENG,1707,0,0,0,,But I think I could be safe...
Dialogue: 0,2:23:43.52,2:23:45.38,*ENG,1708,0,0,0,,...with a nice toffee.
Dialogue: 0,2:23:48.93,2:23:51.92,*ENG,1709,0,0,0,,Alas!
Dialogue: 0,2:23:52.16,2:23:53.60,*ENG,1710,0,0,0,,Earwax.
Dialogue: 0,2:24:09.58,2:24:10.98,*ENG,1711,0,0,0,,All right there, Ron?
Dialogue: 0,2:24:11.08,2:24:13.28,*ENG,1712,0,0,0,,All right. You?
Dialogue: 0,2:24:13.82,2:24:15.18,*ENG,1713,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,2:24:15.69,2:24:16.78,*ENG,1714,0,0,0,,Hermione?
Dialogue: 0,2:24:16.89,2:24:18.55,*ENG,1715,0,0,0,,Never better.
Dialogue: 0,2:24:22.06,2:24:24.93,*ENG,1716,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,2:24:34.91,2:24:37.60,*ENG,1717,0,0,0,,Another year gone.
Dialogue: 0,2:24:38.21,2:24:40.23,*ENG,1718,0,0,0,,And now, as I understand it,
Dialogue: 0,2:24:40.34,2:24:42.61,*ENG,1719,0,0,0,,the house cup needs awarding.
Dialogue: 0,2:24:42.71,2:24:45.74,*ENG,1720,0,0,0,,And the points stand thus:
Dialogue: 0,2:24:45.88,2:24:47.37,*ENG,1721,0,0,0,,In fourth place,
Dialogue: 0,2:24:47.49,2:24:50.85,*ENG,1722,0,0,0,,Gryffindor with 312 points.
Dialogue: 0,2:24:53.52,2:24:55.36,*ENG,1723,0,0,0,,Third place,
Dialogue: 0,2:24:55.46,2:24:59.86,*ENG,1724,0,0,0,,Hufflepuff with 352 points.
Dialogue: 0,2:25:04.30,2:25:06.39,*ENG,1725,0,0,0,,In second place...
Dialogue: 0,2:25:06.50,2:25:11.37,*ENG,1726,0,0,0,,...Ravenclaw with 426 points.
Dialogue: 0,2:25:16.15,2:25:18.98,*ENG,1727,0,0,0,,And in first place...
Dialogue: 0,2:25:19.08,2:25:21.81,*ENG,1728,0,0,0,,...with 472 points,
Dialogue: 0,2:25:21.92,2:25:23.75,*ENG,1729,0,0,0,,Slytherin house.
Dialogue: 0,2:25:29.96,2:25:31.62,*ENG,1730,0,0,0,,Nice one, mate.
Dialogue: 0,2:25:36.00,2:25:38.49,*ENG,1731,0,0,0,,Yes, well done, Slytherin.
Dialogue: 0,2:25:38.50,2:25:39.53,*ENG,1732,0,0,0,,Well done.
Dialogue: 0,2:25:39.64,2:25:40.40,*ENG,1733,0,0,0,,However,
Dialogue: 0,2:25:40.50,2:25:44.60,*ENG,1734,0,0,0,,recent events must be taken into account.
Dialogue: 0,2:25:44.78,2:25:49.01,*ENG,1735,0,0,0,,And I have a few last-minute points to award.
Dialogue: 0,2:25:50.48,2:25:53.58,*ENG,1736,0,0,0,,To Miss Hermione Granger,
Dialogue: 0,2:25:53.68,2:25:56.12,*ENG,1737,0,0,0,,for the cool use of intellect...
Dialogue: 0,2:25:56.22,2:25:59.52,*ENG,1738,0,0,0,,...while others were in grave peril...
Dialogue: 0,2:25:59.66,2:26:01.25,*ENG,1739,0,0,0,,...50 points.
Dialogue: 0,2:26:02.89,2:26:04.12,*ENG,1740,0,0,0,,Good job.
Dialogue: 0,2:26:11.90,2:26:15.93,*ENG,1741,0,0,0,,Second, to Mr. Ronald Weasley,
Dialogue: 0,2:26:16.04,2:26:18.37,*ENG,1742,0,0,0,,for the best-played game of chess...
Dialogue: 0,2:26:18.48,2:26:22.85,*ENG,1743,0,0,0,,...that Hogwarts has seen these many years,
Dialogue: 0,2:26:22.95,2:26:24.47,*ENG,1744,0,0,0,,50 points.
Dialogue: 0,2:26:28.42,2:26:30.85,*ENG,1745,0,0,0,,And third...
Dialogue: 0,2:26:30.96,2:26:33.92,*ENG,1746,0,0,0,,...to Mr. Harry Potter...
Dialogue: 0,2:26:34.02,2:26:38.76,*ENG,1747,0,0,0,,...for pure nerve and outstanding courage...
Dialogue: 0,2:26:38.86,2:26:42.30,*ENG,1748,0,0,0,,...I award Gryffindor house
Dialogue: 0,2:26:42.40,2:26:44.16,*ENG,1749,0,0,0,,60 points.
Dialogue: 0,2:26:52.14,2:26:54.13,*ENG,1750,0,0,0,,We're tied with Slytherin!
Dialogue: 0,2:26:54.25,2:26:55.87,*ENG,1751,0,0,0,,Finally,
Dialogue: 0,2:26:55.98,2:26:58.04,*ENG,1752,0,0,0,,it takes a great deal of bravery to stand up to
Dialogue: 0,2:26:58.15,2:27:00.38,*ENG,1753,0,0,0,,your enemies...
Dialogue: 0,2:27:00.48,2:27:03.98,*ENG,1754,0,0,0,,...but a great deal more to stand up to your friends.
Dialogue: 0,2:27:04.42,2:27:07.58,*ENG,1755,0,0,0,,I award 10 points...
Dialogue: 0,2:27:07.69,2:27:10.29,*ENG,1756,0,0,0,,...to Neville Longbottom.
Dialogue: 0,2:27:24.21,2:27:26.90,*ENG,1757,0,0,0,,Assuming that my calculations are correct...
Dialogue: 0,2:27:27.01,2:27:31.41,*ENG,1758,0,0,0,,...I believe that a change of decoration is in order.
Dialogue: 0,2:27:37.39,2:27:41.29,*ENG,1759,0,0,0,,Gryffindor wins the house cup.
Dialogue: 0,2:27:42.83,2:27:44.12,*ENG,1760,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,2:27:44.23,2:27:45.13,*ENG,1761,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,2:27:56.81,2:27:59.28,*ENG,1762,0,0,0,,We win!
Dialogue: 0,2:27:59.38,2:28:01.67,*ENG,1763,0,0,0,,Hey, come on!
Dialogue: 0,2:28:10.55,2:28:12.82,*ENG,1764,0,0,0,,We win!
Dialogue: 0,2:28:18.93,2:28:21.52,*ENG,1765,0,0,0,,Come on, now. Hurry up, you'll be late.
Dialogue: 0,2:28:22.03,2:28:24.23,*ENG,1766,0,0,0,,Train's leaving. Go on.
Dialogue: 0,2:28:24.34,2:28:25.53,*ENG,1767,0,0,0,,Come on, hurry up.
Dialogue: 0,2:28:32.01,2:28:33.41,*ENG,1768,0,0,0,,Come on, Harry.
Dialogue: 0,2:28:33.51,2:28:34.48,*ENG,1769,0,0,0,,One minute.
Dialogue: 0,2:28:41.72,2:28:44.62,*ENG,1770,0,0,0,,Thought you were leaving without saying goodbye, did you?
Dialogue: 0,2:28:48.83,2:28:50.45,*ENG,1771,0,0,0,,This is for you.
Dialogue: 0,2:29:07.24,2:29:08.58,*ENG,1772,0,0,0,,Thanks, Hagrid.
Dialogue: 0,2:29:15.19,2:29:18.09,*ENG,1773,0,0,0,,Go on. On with you. On with you now.
Dialogue: 0,2:29:18.19,2:29:19.85,*ENG,1774,0,0,0,,Oh, listen, Harry.
Dialogue: 0,2:29:20.06,2:29:21.45,*ENG,1775,0,0,0,,If that dolt of a cousin of yours,
Dialogue: 0,2:29:21.46,2:29:23.82,*ENG,1776,0,0,0,,Dudley, gives you any grief...
Dialogue: 0,2:29:24.73,2:29:27.53,*ENG,1777,0,0,0,,...you could always threaten him...
Dialogue: 0,2:29:27.63,2:29:30.62,*ENG,1778,0,0,0,,...with a nice pair of ears to go with his tail.
Dialogue: 0,2:29:30.73,2:29:33.36,*ENG,1779,0,0,0,,But we're not allowed to do magic
Dialogue: 0,2:29:33.47,2:29:35.96,*ENG,1780,0,0,0,,away from Hogwarts. You know that.
Dialogue: 0,2:29:36.07,2:29:37.60,*ENG,1781,0,0,0,,I do.
Dialogue: 0,2:29:37.74,2:29:40.57,*ENG,1782,0,0,0,,But your cousin don't, do he?
Dialogue: 0,2:29:41.98,2:29:43.35,*ENG,1783,0,0,0,,Go.
Dialogue: 0,2:29:46.49,2:29:49.25,*ENG,1784,0,0,0,,Feels strange to be going home, doesn't it?
Dialogue: 0,2:29:49.69,2:29:53.32,*ENG,1785,0,0,0,,I'm not going home. Not really.
Dialogue: 0,2:30:41.67,2:30:44.90,*ENG,1786,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,2:30:45.88,2:30:48.94,*ENG,1787,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,2:30:50.11,2:30:53.24,*ENG,1788,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,2:31:43.43,2:31:45.77,*ENG,1789,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,2:31:46.80,2:31:49.03,*ENG,1790,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,2:31:50.07,2:31:52.44,*ENG,1791,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,2:31:53.44,2:31:56.07,*ENG,1792,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,2:31:57.18,2:31:59.51,*ENG,1793,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,2:32:00.52,2:32:02.71,*ENG,1794,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,2:32:03.82,2:32:06.19,*ENG,1795,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.98,0:00:22.28,*CHS,1,0,0,0,,(水蜡树街)
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.81,0:01:24.44,*CHS,2,0,0,0,,我早该料到你也会来
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.95,0:01:27.11,*CHS,3,0,0,0,,麦格教授
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.09,0:01:40.08,*CHS,4,0,0,0,,邓布利多教授
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.73,0:01:46.86,*CHS,5,0,0,0,,那些传言是真的.阿不思？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.04,0:01:48.97,*CHS,6,0,0,0,,恐怕是真的.教授
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.50,0:01:52.20,*CHS,7,0,0,0,,有好消息也有坏消息
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.51,0:01:53.84,*CHS,8,0,0,0,,那孩子呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.01,0:01:55.53,*CHS,9,0,0,0,,海格会带来的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.88,0:02:00.24,*CHS,10,0,0,0,,把这么重要的事托付给海格办这是不是明智？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.35,0:02:04.55,*CHS,11,0,0,0,,哎.教授.我能把性命托付给海格
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.21,0:02:26.83,*CHS,12,0,0,0,,邓布利多教授
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.01,0:02:28.14,*CHS,13,0,0,0,,麦格教授
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.21,0:02:30.64,*CHS,14,0,0,0,,没遇到什么麻烦吧.海格？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.78,0:02:32.01,*CHS,15,0,0,0,,没有.先生
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.51,0:02:36.21,*CHS,16,0,0,0,,我们飞过布里斯托的时候小傢伙就睡着了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.82,0:02:39.31,*CHS,17,0,0,0,,可别吵醒他
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.06,0:02:42.35,*CHS,18,0,0,0,,给你
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.23,0:02:53.26,*CHS,19,0,0,0,,阿不思.把孩子交给这家人你真觉得安全吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.30,0:02:54.83,*CHS,20,0,0,0,,我观察了他们一整天
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.94,0:02:58.43,*CHS,21,0,0,0,,没见过比他们更糟糕的麻瓜啦
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.81,0:03:03.01,*CHS,22,0,0,0,,- 他们真是… - 是这孩子唯一的亲人
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.18,0:03:04.91,*CHS,23,0,0,0,,这孩子会出名
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.01,0:03:08.21,*CHS,24,0,0,0,,我们世界里的孩子都会知道他的名字
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.32,0:03:09.48,*CHS,25,0,0,0,,说得正是
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.12,0:03:13.61,*CHS,26,0,0,0,,他成长时候得让他远离那些事
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.86,0:03:19.16,*CHS,27,0,0,0,,直到他懂事以后
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.64,0:03:33.44,*CHS,28,0,0,0,,好了.好了.海格
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.54,0:03:36.17,*CHS,29,0,0,0,,这毕竟不是真正的告别
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.15,0:03:48.62,*CHS,30,0,0,0,,(德思礼夫妇敬启 萨里郡小惠金区女贞路四号)
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.96,0:03:50.22,*CHS,31,0,0,0,,祝福你
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.99,0:03:53.48,*CHS,32,0,0,0,,哈利·波特
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.37,0:04:04.70,*CHS,33,0,0,0,,《哈利波特与魔法石》
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.35,0:04:13.78,*CHS,34,0,0,0,,起床！快起床！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.92,0:04:17.91,*CHS,35,0,0,0,,快！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.07,0:04:35.26,*CHS,36,0,0,0,,醒醒.表弟！要去动物园啦
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.38,0:04:50.01,*CHS,37,0,0,0,,喔.你来了.我们的小寿星
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.12,0:04:52.08,*CHS,38,0,0,0,,生日快乐.儿子
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.96,0:04:57.42,*CHS,39,0,0,0,,你给我乖乖地做早饭.别再把东西烤糊了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.63,0:04:58.49,*CHS,40,0,0,0,,好.佩妮阿姨
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.59,0:05:02.26,*CHS,41,0,0,0,,我希望今天样样事情都顺顺当当的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.40,0:05:05.53,*CHS,42,0,0,0,,我们的小达力今天过生日
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.63,0:05:06.57,*CHS,43,0,0,0,,快点！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.00,0:05:08.26,*CHS,44,0,0,0,,拿咖啡来.小子
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.37,0:05:09.36,*CHS,45,0,0,0,,是.弗农姨丈
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.27,0:05:13.64,*CHS,46,0,0,0,,瞧这些礼物多棒.宝贝儿？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.91,0:05:18.21,*CHS,47,0,0,0,,一共多少件？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.31,0:05:20.25,*CHS,48,0,0,0,,三十六件.我亲自数过
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.35,0:05:24.22,*CHS,49,0,0,0,,只有三十六件？就在去年我还有三十七件呐
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.32,0:05:26.85,*CHS,50,0,0,0,,对..对..可是今年有些礼物要比去年大
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.95,0:05:28.18,*CHS,51,0,0,0,,我不管它们有有多大！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.29,0:05:31.36,*CHS,52,0,0,0,,好了.好了.那么这样吧我们一会儿出去
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.46,0:05:34.95,*CHS,53,0,0,0,,再给你买两个新礼物怎么样.心肝？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.67,0:05:39.69,*CHS,54,0,0,0,,我们一会儿就能到,今天这天气去动物园真是美极了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.80,0:05:42.19,*CHS,55,0,0,0,,我想一定棒.看着吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.04,0:05:48.17,*CHS,56,0,0,0,,我现在警告你.小子
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.31,0:05:51.90,*CHS,57,0,0,0,,要是耍什么花招.哪怕就一次
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.01,0:05:55.61,*CHS,58,0,0,0,,我就罚你一星期不准吃饭
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.72,0:05:56.68,*CHS,59,0,0,0,,上车
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.02,0:06:00.95,*CHS,60,0,0,0,,（爬虫类馆）
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.76,0:06:06.23,*CHS,61,0,0,0,,快叫它动
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.70,0:06:10.82,*CHS,62,0,0,0,,动！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.57,0:06:13.23,*CHS,63,0,0,0,,- 动！ - 它在睡觉
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.30,0:06:15.83,*CHS,64,0,0,0,,真没劲
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.37,0:06:22.71,*CHS,65,0,0,0,,真对不起.他从没尝过那种滋味
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.81,0:06:25.14,*CHS,66,0,0,0,,一天一天地躺在那儿
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.28,0:06:28.51,*CHS,67,0,0,0,,面对凑过来看你的那些丑八怪
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.79,0:06:33.55,*CHS,68,0,0,0,,你能听见我的话？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.99,0:06:38.39,*CHS,69,0,0,0,,只是我…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.49,0:06:40.93,*CHS,70,0,0,0,,我从来没跟蛇说过话
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.46,0:06:43.02,*CHS,71,0,0,0,,你是…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.13,0:06:46.46,*CHS,72,0,0,0,,我是说.你经常跟人说话？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.20,0:06:50.03,*CHS,73,0,0,0,,你是从缅甸来的？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.34,0:06:53.50,*CHS,74,0,0,0,,那儿不错？你想家吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.81,0:06:56.57,*CHS,75,0,0,0,,（园内孵育样本）
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.08,0:06:58.48,*CHS,76,0,0,0,,懂了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.61,0:07:02.07,*CHS,77,0,0,0,,我们一样.我也从没见过父母
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.18,0:07:03.65,*CHS,78,0,0,0,,妈妈！爸爸！快来！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.75,0:07:06.08,*CHS,79,0,0,0,,瞧这蛇.这太神了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.01,0:07:31.44,*CHS,80,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.31,0:07:33.51,*CHS,81,0,0,0,,别客气
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.19,0:07:38.71,*CHS,82,0,0,0,,蛇！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.60,0:07:59.04,*CHS,83,0,0,0,,妈妈.妈妈.快来救我
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.14,0:08:01.73,*CHS,84,0,0,0,,宝贝儿子.你是怎 么进去的？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.84,0:08:04.87,*CHS,85,0,0,0,,我的天哪.你是怎么进去的？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.05,0:08:07.54,*CHS,86,0,0,0,,里面有蛇？里面有蛇？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.72,0:08:13.28,*CHS,87,0,0,0,,没事.亲爱的.没事的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.39,0:08:15.92,*CHS,88,0,0,0,,快把你的衣服脱下来.又冷又湿的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.49,0:08:19.82,*CHS,89,0,0,0,,是怎么回事？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.93,0:08:21.69,*CHS,90,0,0,0,,我发誓我不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.83,0:08:24.26,*CHS,91,0,0,0,,刚才玻璃还在.可一下就没了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.36,0:08:25.35,*CHS,92,0,0,0,,就像魔法
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.04,0:08:32.97,*CHS,93,0,0,0,,这世上根本就没有什么魔法
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.97,0:08:53.13,*CHS,94,0,0,0,,噢.发现了吗？快看看他.我简直不能相信
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.37,0:08:55.81,*CHS,95,0,0,0,,只有我们才配上SMELTlNG（中学）
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.00,0:09:00.39,*CHS,96,0,0,0,,儿子.这是我一生最骄傲的一刻！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.41,0:09:02.51,*CHS,97,0,0,0,,我也得穿这身校服吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.97,0:09:07.61,*CHS,98,0,0,0,,你？去SMELTlNG中学？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.39,0:09:15.61,*CHS,99,0,0,0,,别犯傻了！你只能去你所属的学校
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.73,0:09:19.25,*CHS,100,0,0,0,,这就是你要穿的衣服.快染好了！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.91,0:09:24.58,*CHS,101,0,0,0,,但那是德利的旧校服.穿起来和大象皮差不多…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.60,0:09:29.97,*CHS,102,0,0,0,,你穿再合适不过了！去拿邮件！去！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.93,0:09:46.99,*CHS,103,0,0,0,,(女贞路四号 楼梯下的碗橱 哈利·波特先生收)
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.88,0:10:03.68,*CHS,104,0,0,0,,喔.玛姬病了.因为吃了坏油螺
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.78,0:10:05.48,*CHS,105,0,0,0,,爸.瞧！哈利收到一封信
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.58,0:10:06.91,*CHS,106,0,0,0,,还给我！是我的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.02,0:10:10.18,*CHS,107,0,0,0,,你的？谁会给你写信？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.75,0:10:45.64,*CHS,108,0,0,0,,这信箱里今后再也不会有信了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.20,0:11:00.17,*CHS,109,0,0,0,,我爱你
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.67,0:11:06.07,*CHS,110,0,0,0,,滚.滚开
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.83,0:12:05.96,*CHS,111,0,0,0,,好日子.星期天
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.24,0:12:09.64,*CHS,112,0,0,0,,一星期中最好的一天
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.74,0:12:11.21,*CHS,113,0,0,0,,为什么.达力？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.34,0:12:14.00,*CHS,114,0,0,0,,因为星期天没有邮差？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.11,0:12:15.44,*CHS,115,0,0,0,,说得对.哈利
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.81,0:12:18.48,*CHS,116,0,0,0,,星期天没邮差.哈哈
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.02,0:12:25.35,*CHS,117,0,0,0,,今天没有那些该死的信！没有信！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.46,0:12:29.98,*CHS,118,0,0,0,,今天连一封该死的信都没有.没有
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.64,0:12:42.73,*CHS,119,0,0,0,,一封都没有.没有一封可恶的.该死的…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.02,0:12:56.82,*CHS,120,0,0,0,,嘿.快走开
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.39,0:13:04.52,*CHS,121,0,0,0,,停！快停！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.63,0:13:06.93,*CHS,122,0,0,0,,妈妈.告诉我 这是怎么一回事？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.87,0:13:12.20,*CHS,123,0,0,0,,快给我
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.60,0:13:15.67,*CHS,124,0,0,0,,快把信给我
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.74,0:13:19.11,*CHS,125,0,0,0,,快住手！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.21,0:13:26.65,*CHS,126,0,0,0,,这些信是我的.快放开我！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.12,0:13:31.08,*CHS,127,0,0,0,,快走吧.我们快走
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.16,0:13:35.69,*CHS,128,0,0,0,,搬得远远的.让他们找不到我们
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.79,0:13:37.95,*CHS,129,0,0,0,,爸爸是不是发疯了？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.95,0:14:06.32,*CHS,130,0,0,0,,（哈利 生日快乐）
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.76,0:14:15.39,*CHS,131,0,0,0,,许个愿.哈利
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.28,0:14:33.31,*CHS,132,0,0,0,,是谁呀？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.36,0:14:48.29,*CHS,133,0,0,0,,真是对不起啦
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.81,0:14:57.87,*CHS,134,0,0,0,,我要你马上离开.先生
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.98,0:14:59.64,*CHS,135,0,0,0,,你私闯民宅
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.11,0:15:06.14,*CHS,136,0,0,0,,闭嘴.德思礼.你这个老无赖
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.36,0:15:13.12,*CHS,137,0,0,0,,上次见到你.你还是个小宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.22,0:15:14.48,*CHS,138,0,0,0,,哈利…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.63,0:15:16.59,*CHS,139,0,0,0,,可你比我想象要大一圈
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.69,0:15:18.09,*CHS,140,0,0,0,,尤其是当中这块
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.86,0:15:21.70,*CHS,141,0,0,0,,我不是.我不是哈利
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.47,0:15:26.06,*CHS,142,0,0,0,,我.我是
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.67,0:15:28.70,*CHS,143,0,0,0,,你不是就没人是啦
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.14,0:15:30.57,*CHS,144,0,0,0,,我有东西给你
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.67,0:15:33.27,*CHS,145,0,0,0,,恐怕被我的屁股压坏了一点 不过…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.38,0:15:35.78,*CHS,146,0,0,0,,我想味还是一样鲜美
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.48,0:15:41.52,*CHS,147,0,0,0,,我自己做的.字也是我写的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.69,0:15:46.92,*CHS,148,0,0,0,,（祝哈利生日快乐）
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.03,0:15:48.92,*CHS,149,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.03,0:15:52.72,*CHS,150,0,0,0,,小伙子可不是天天过十一岁生日的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.38,0:16:11.35,*CHS,151,0,0,0,,对不起.请问…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.45,0:16:12.61,*CHS,152,0,0,0,,你是谁？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.72,0:16:16.45,*CHS,153,0,0,0,,我叫鲁伯·海格 霍格沃茨的钥匙保管员…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.55,0:16:17.78,*CHS,154,0,0,0,,场地看守人
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.89,0:16:20.15,*CHS,155,0,0,0,,当然霍格沃茨的事你都知道
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.32,0:16:22.09,*CHS,156,0,0,0,,对不起.不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.19,0:16:26.26,*CHS,157,0,0,0,,不知道？你就没想过你爸爸妈妈是在哪儿学的？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.13,0:16:28.72,*CHS,158,0,0,0,,学什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.90,0:16:30.66,*CHS,159,0,0,0,,你是魔法师.哈利
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.50,0:16:33.83,*CHS,160,0,0,0,,我…我是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.94,0:16:38.14,*CHS,161,0,0,0,,魔法师.而且可以成为最最棒的只要开导开导
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.24,0:16:39.90,*CHS,162,0,0,0,,不
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.01,0:16:41.17,*CHS,163,0,0,0,,你一定是弄错了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.28,0:16:44.61,*CHS,164,0,0,0,,我…,不可能是魔法师
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.02,0:16:47.21,*CHS,165,0,0,0,,我只是…只是…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.32,0:16:50.05,*CHS,166,0,0,0,,哈利.只是哈利
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.59,0:16:53.08,*CHS,167,0,0,0,,好吧.只是哈利
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.19,0:16:54.95,*CHS,168,0,0,0,,你激动的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.06,0:16:58.46,*CHS,169,0,0,0,,有没有做过连你自己都没法解释的事？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.11,0:17:17.51,*CHS,170,0,0,0,,亲爱的波特先生
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.61,0:17:19.21,*CHS,171,0,0,0,,我们很高兴地通知你
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.32,0:17:22.81,*CHS,172,0,0,0,,你已经被我们霍格沃茨魔法学校录取了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.92,0:17:25.25,*CHS,173,0,0,0,,告诉你吧.他不会去的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.36,0:17:26.09,*CHS,174,0,0,0,,我们发过誓
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.15,0:17:27.98,*CHS,175,0,0,0,,不要让他跟那些垃圾沾边
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.09,0:17:29.58,*CHS,176,0,0,0,,你们知道？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.99,0:17:32.39,*CHS,177,0,0,0,,你们早知道.可就是不告诉我？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.50,0:17:33.96,*CHS,178,0,0,0,,当然知道
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.06,0:17:35.90,*CHS,179,0,0,0,,怎么可能不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.00,0:17:39.66,*CHS,180,0,0,0,,我那妹妹居然有那种本事
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.87,0:17:45.47,*CHS,181,0,0,0,,在她收到信的那一天我的父母是多么的自豪
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.94,0:17:49.78,*CHS,182,0,0,0,,我们家出了个魔法师.太妙了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.25,0:17:53.51,*CHS,183,0,0,0,,只有我知道她是什么货色.她…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.62,0:17:55.95,*CHS,184,0,0,0,,是一个…怪胎
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.15,0:17:59.15,*CHS,185,0,0,0,,后来他和波特一起生下了你
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.19,0:18:01.42,*CHS,186,0,0,0,,我料到你们会一个样…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.42,0:18:05.06,*CHS,187,0,0,0,,你跟他一样怪.跟他一样不正常
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.23,0:18:08.36,*CHS,188,0,0,0,,后来你妈让她自己给炸死了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.47,0:18:10.19,*CHS,189,0,0,0,,我们只能把你收下
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.30,0:18:14.53,*CHS,190,0,0,0,,给炸死？ 你们不是说我的父母是车祸死的吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.64,0:18:16.33,*CHS,191,0,0,0,,车祸死的？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.74,0:18:18.33,*CHS,192,0,0,0,,车祸能让莉莉和和詹姆斯送命？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.44,0:18:20.21,*CHS,193,0,0,0,,总得编点什么呀
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.31,0:18:23.34,*CHS,194,0,0,0,,简直是侮辱他们.天大的耻辱
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.45,0:18:24.97,*CHS,195,0,0,0,,他不会去的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.08,0:18:29.52,*CHS,196,0,0,0,,喔…难道像你这样一个麻瓜能阻止得了他吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.65,0:18:30.75,*CHS,197,0,0,0,,麻瓜？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.85,0:18:32.08,*CHS,198,0,0,0,,不懂魔法的人
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.19,0:18:34.65,*CHS,199,0,0,0,,这孩子自打一出生就注册了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.86,0:18:38.26,*CHS,200,0,0,0,,他要去的是世界上最好的魔法学校
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.36,0:18:43.19,*CHS,201,0,0,0,,而且现在的校长是霍格沃茨魔法学校历史上最棒的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.30,0:18:45.00,*CHS,202,0,0,0,,阿不思邓布利多
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.10,0:18:49.63,*CHS,203,0,0,0,,我可不会出钱让一个老疯子老傻瓜教这小子变戏法
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.87,0:18:57.57,*CHS,204,0,0,0,,不许…在我面前侮辱阿不思邓布利多.绝对不允许
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.03,0:19:15.02,*CHS,205,0,0,0,,他们对我的小宝贝做了什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.13,0:19:19.80,*CHS,206,0,0,0,,这事你最好别告诉霍格沃茨的人
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.14,0:19:22.63,*CHS,207,0,0,0,,因为他们不允许我施魔法
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.74,0:19:23.76,*CHS,208,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.04,0:19:28.71,*CHS,209,0,0,0,,噢！时间不早了.我们得走了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.15,0:19:37.75,*CHS,210,0,0,0,,当然.除非你宁愿留下
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.99,0:19:56.65,*CHS,211,0,0,0,,（魔法学校）一年级新生需要准备…三件素色巫衣…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.85,0:19:57.65,*CHS,212,0,0,0,,一根魔杖？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.07,0:20:00.65,*CHS,213,0,0,0,,一件尤为关键的装备.哈利
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.15,0:20:03.65,*CHS,214,0,0,0,,一双龙皮手套…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.65,0:20:06.97,*CHS,215,0,0,0,,海格.是取自真龙身上吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.37,0:20:08.97,*CHS,216,0,0,0,,这个嘛.他们肯定指的不是企鹅.你说呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.56,0:20:13.97,*CHS,217,0,0,0,,噢.我要有一条龙该多好…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.07,0:20:15.07,*CHS,218,0,0,0,,你想要一条龙！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.27,0:20:20.37,*CHS,219,0,0,0,,（龙）比雷电还快.比雷电还快！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.37,0:20:30.70,*CHS,220,0,0,0,,所有来校学生都必须配备…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.81,0:20:33.87,*CHS,221,0,0,0,,一只标准尺寸的二号锡镴大锅
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.98,0:20:35.57,*CHS,222,0,0,0,,愿意的话.还可以自带…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.68,0:20:39.28,*CHS,223,0,0,0,,一只猫头鹰.一只猫.或是一只蟾蜍
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.08,0:20:42.45,*CHS,224,0,0,0,,在伦敦能找到吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.55,0:20:44.38,*CHS,225,0,0,0,,总能找到的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.80,0:21:00.63,*CHS,226,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.94,0:21:04.37,*CHS,227,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.01,0:21:11.07,*CHS,228,0,0,0,,啊.海格.还照老样子？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.18,0:21:11.98,*CHS,229,0,0,0,,不.谢谢.汤姆
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.08,0:21:14.34,*CHS,230,0,0,0,,我在为霍格沃茨办公事
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.22,0:21:18.41,*CHS,231,0,0,0,,我在帮小哈利买他的学习用品呐
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.55,0:21:20.02,*CHS,232,0,0,0,,我的天啦
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.22,0:21:22.05,*CHS,233,0,0,0,,他是哈利·波特！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.40,0:21:28.09,*CHS,234,0,0,0,,波特先生.欢迎回来
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.20,0:21:29.69,*CHS,235,0,0,0,,欢迎回来
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.10,0:21:31.62,*CHS,236,0,0,0,,我是科多利
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.73,0:21:34.79,*CHS,237,0,0,0,,真不敢相信我终于见到你了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.90,0:21:37.90,*CHS,238,0,0,0,,哈利…波特
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.07,0:21:40.06,*CHS,239,0,0,0,,见到你非常兴奋
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.18,0:21:42.91,*CHS,240,0,0,0,,你好哇.教授.刚才没看见你
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.01,0:21:48.21,*CHS,241,0,0,0,,哈利.这位是奇洛教授在霍格沃茨.他将教你黑魔法防御术
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.38,0:21:50.18,*CHS,242,0,0,0,,喔.我很荣幸
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.95,0:21:53.92,*CHS,243,0,0,0,,奇妙…恐怖的学科
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.02,0:21:58.52,*CHS,244,0,0,0,,嗯…你你并不需要它.啊？波特
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.90,0:22:04.36,*CHS,245,0,0,0,,好吧.得走啦.我们回头见
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.47,0:22:05.56,*CHS,246,0,0,0,,再见
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.04,0:22:10.30,*CHS,247,0,0,0,,瞧.哈利
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.41,0:22:12.64,*CHS,248,0,0,0,,- 你很出名 - 我为什么出名.海格？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.74,0:22:16.04,*CHS,249,0,0,0,,那里的那些人怎么会知道我是谁？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.14,0:22:19.44,*CHS,250,0,0,0,,也许由我来告诉你不太合适.哈利
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.93,0:22:39.92,*CHS,251,0,0,0,,欢迎.哈利.欢迎来对角巷
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.02,0:22:59.32,*CHS,252,0,0,0,,在这儿买鹅毛笔和墨水
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.79,0:23:02.92,*CHS,253,0,0,0,,哪儿有你使魔法用的各种小玩意
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.18,0:23:29.05,*CHS,254,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.15,0:23:30.52,*CHS,255,0,0,0,,这是世界最著名扫帚
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.62,0:23:34.75,*CHS,256,0,0,0,,哇.快看啦！那是新型的光轮2000
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.16,0:23:37.65,*CHS,257,0,0,0,,那可是最快的型号啦
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.50,0:23:41.43,*CHS,258,0,0,0,,(光轮2000)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.46,0:23:45.40,*CHS,259,0,0,0,,可是.海格.这些我怎么买得起呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.50,0:23:46.93,*CHS,260,0,0,0,,我从来都没钱
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.07,0:23:48.54,*CHS,261,0,0,0,,喔.你的钱在那儿.哈利
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.64,0:23:50.40,*CHS,262,0,0,0,,古灵阁魔法师银行
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.51,0:23:52.91,*CHS,263,0,0,0,,没有哪儿比那更安全了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.01,0:23:54.70,*CHS,264,0,0,0,,除了霍格沃茨
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.16,0:24:10.05,*CHS,265,0,0,0,,海格
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.33,0:24:12.79,*CHS,266,0,0,0,,这.这到底是怎么回事？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.89,0:24:14.79,*CHS,267,0,0,0,,他们是小妖精
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.93,0:24:18.42,*CHS,268,0,0,0,,他们虽然很聪明.但却并不是最友好的
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.53,0:24:20.13,*CHS,269,0,0,0,,最好跟我近些
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.31,0:24:27.54,*CHS,270,0,0,0,,哈利·波特先生想取一些钱
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.45,0:24:36.24,*CHS,271,0,0,0,,喔…知道了 那么哈利·波特先生带钥匙来了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.39,0:24:38.91,*CHS,272,0,0,0,,喔.等一下.我放哪儿啦？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.66,0:24:44.73,*CHS,273,0,0,0,,哦.鬼家伙在这儿
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.39,0:24:47.79,*CHS,274,0,0,0,,另外.还有一件事情
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.66,0:24:51.83,*CHS,275,0,0,0,,邓布利多教授交给我的
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.57,0:24:56.73,*CHS,276,0,0,0,,（最高机密）
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.84,0:25:01.61,*CHS,277,0,0,0,,这有关金库里藏着的那件东西
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.38,0:25:04.47,*CHS,278,0,0,0,,那好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.49,0:25:12.82,*CHS,279,0,0,0,,第六百八十七号金库
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.29,0:25:16.59,*CHS,280,0,0,0,,把灯拿来
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.17,0:25:27.23,*CHS,281,0,0,0,,钥匙拿来
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.96,0:25:53.99,*CHS,282,0,0,0,,没想过你父母会给你留下什么吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.96,0:25:58.30,*CHS,283,0,0,0,,第七百十三号金库
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.40,0:25:59.77,*CHS,284,0,0,0,,那里有什么.海格？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.87,0:26:01.33,*CHS,285,0,0,0,,不能告诉你
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.44,0:26:04.30,*CHS,286,0,0,0,,哈利.事关霍格沃茨
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.31,0:26:06.23,*CHS,287,0,0,0,,- 是绝密 - 往后站
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.14,0:26:36.66,*CHS,288,0,0,0,,别向任何人提这事.哈利
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.28,0:26:49.24,*CHS,289,0,0,0,,我还需要…一根魔杖
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.32,0:26:51.95,*CHS,290,0,0,0,,要魔杖？那就去奥利凡德
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.05,0:26:53.21,*CHS,291,0,0,0,,那家店最好
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.86,0:26:55.76,*CHS,292,0,0,0,,你先去那等着
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.86,0:26:58.35,*CHS,293,0,0,0,,我还有件事要办.就来
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.78,0:27:18.04,*CHS,294,0,0,0,,哈罗？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.42,0:27:22.44,*CHS,295,0,0,0,,哈罗？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.82,0:27:29.59,*CHS,296,0,0,0,,我一直在想几时能见到你
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.69,0:27:30.99,*CHS,297,0,0,0,,波特先生
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.90,0:27:41.27,*CHS,298,0,0,0,,当年你父亲和母亲也在这儿
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.37,0:27:46.47,*CHS,299,0,0,0,,买他们的第一根魔杖就好象是昨天发生的事
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.88,0:27:55.85,*CHS,300,0,0,0,,给你这一根
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.76,0:28:06.59,*CHS,301,0,0,0,,挥一下试试
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.74,0:28:15.50,*CHS,302,0,0,0,,这个好像不行
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.88,0:28:25.51,*CHS,303,0,0,0,,也许是…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.65,0:28:29.08,*CHS,304,0,0,0,,这根
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.86,0:28:39.73,*CHS,305,0,0,0,,不.不.绝对不是这根
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.56,0:28:41.86,*CHS,306,0,0,0,,没关系
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.77,0:28:51.03,*CHS,307,0,0,0,,这根像了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.63,0:29:21.60,*CHS,308,0,0,0,,真邪乎
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.17,0:29:24.30,*CHS,309,0,0,0,,真是太邪乎了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.37,0:29:29.07,*CHS,310,0,0,0,,对不起.可…你说什么邪乎？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.01,0:29:32.81,*CHS,311,0,0,0,,我卖出的每一根魔杖我都记得
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.55,0:29:39.20,*CHS,312,0,0,0,,碰巧的是…有两根魔杖用的羽毛出自同一只凤凰
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.22,0:29:41.71,*CHS,313,0,0,0,,一根就是你手中的
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.82,0:29:44.85,*CHS,314,0,0,0,,另一根像它兄弟…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.96,0:29:49.49,*CHS,315,0,0,0,,邪乎的是…命里注定这根魔杖为你所用
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.56,0:29:54.19,*CHS,316,0,0,0,,而它的兄弟给你留下了这道疤
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.81,0:29:59.54,*CHS,317,0,0,0,,谁.谁拥有那根魔杖？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.64,0:30:03.91,*CHS,318,0,0,0,,我们从不提他的名字
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.01,0:30:07.54,*CHS,319,0,0,0,,是魔杖选择魔法师.波特先生
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.68,0:30:10.62,*CHS,320,0,0,0,,有些事就是弄不明白
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.95,0:30:14.79,*CHS,321,0,0,0,,可是有一点很清楚…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.89,0:30:18.12,*CHS,322,0,0,0,,那就是你一定能干出一番大事
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.79,0:30:23.39,*CHS,323,0,0,0,,毕竟那个…我们不能提名字的神秘人
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.43,0:30:26.03,*CHS,324,0,0,0,,干的也是大事
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.13,0:30:29.97,*CHS,325,0,0,0,,很可怕.可的确…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.34,0:30:33.21,*CHS,326,0,0,0,,都是大事
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.58,0:30:39.48,*CHS,327,0,0,0,,哈利.哈利
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.01,0:30:41.61,*CHS,328,0,0,0,,生日快乐
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.32,0:30:52.72,*CHS,329,0,0,0,,你没事吧？在想什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.39,0:30:56.56,*CHS,330,0,0,0,,他杀了我的父母.对吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.66,0:30:58.46,*CHS,331,0,0,0,,给我留下疤的那个人
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.73,0:31:01.07,*CHS,332,0,0,0,,你知道真相
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.67,0:31:03.16,*CHS,333,0,0,0,,你一定知道
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.71,0:31:11.50,*CHS,334,0,0,0,,首先.有一点你一定要明白.因为这很重要
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.68,0:31:14.61,*CHS,335,0,0,0,,魔法师不一定都是好人
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.68,0:31:16.21,*CHS,336,0,0,0,,其中有些变坏了
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.22,0:31:17.08,*CHS,337,0,0,0,,几年前
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.10,0:31:19.52,*CHS,338,0,0,0,,有个魔法师简直坏到了极点
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.52,0:31:22.21,*CHS,339,0,0,0,,他的名字叫…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.42,0:31:24.00,*CHS,340,0,0,0,,叫佛…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.09,0:31:25.78,*CHS,341,0,0,0,,你把名字写下来？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.89,0:31:29.35,*CHS,342,0,0,0,,不行.我拼不出…好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.86,0:31:31.20,*CHS,343,0,0,0,,佛地魔
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.30,0:31:32.79,*CHS,344,0,0,0,,佛地魔？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.44,0:31:38.63,*CHS,345,0,0,0,,那时候真太黑暗了
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.88,0:31:44.14,*CHS,346,0,0,0,,当时佛地魔开始网罗他的党羽
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.25,0:31:46.91,*CHS,347,0,0,0,,让他们加入黑势力
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.15,0:31:53.24,*CHS,348,0,0,0,,谁要跟他对抗就难逃一死
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.39,0:31:56.35,*CHS,349,0,0,0,,你的父母跟他抗上了
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.86,0:32:01.39,*CHS,350,0,0,0,,他要杀谁.谁就没法活
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.53,0:32:06.76,*CHS,351,0,0,0,,没人能逃得了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.40,0:32:08.89,*CHS,352,0,0,0,,除了你
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.41,0:32:16.28,*CHS,353,0,0,0,,我？佛地魔想要杀…我？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.38,0:32:20.84,*CHS,354,0,0,0,,是的.你额头上的疤可非同寻常.哈利
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.95,0:32:24.28,*CHS,355,0,0,0,,只有接触到魔咒才会留下那样的疤痕
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.39,0:32:26.28,*CHS,356,0,0,0,,一种邪恶的魔咒
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.62,0:32:31.22,*CHS,357,0,0,0,,那么佛…他后来呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.39,0:32:34.66,*CHS,358,0,0,0,,喔.有人说他死了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.13,0:32:37.60,*CHS,359,0,0,0,,我看是一派胡言
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.70,0:32:41.53,*CHS,360,0,0,0,,我想.他还活在这世上
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.64,0:32:44.13,*CHS,361,0,0,0,,精疲力尽.无法作恶
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.24,0:32:46.43,*CHS,362,0,0,0,,可有一点是肯定的
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.54,0:32:49.60,*CHS,363,0,0,0,,那天晚上你一定挫了他的锐气
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.64,0:32:51.30,*CHS,364,0,0,0,,所以你这么出名
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.31,0:32:54.74,*CHS,365,0,0,0,,所以大家都知道你的名字
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.85,0:32:58.08,*CHS,366,0,0,0,,你就是那…大难不死的男孩
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.86,0:33:09.35,*CHS,367,0,0,0,,看什么.看？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.43,0:33:14.23,*CHS,368,0,0,0,,我的天.时间到了？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.34,0:33:15.93,*CHS,369,0,0,0,,对不起.哈利.我得走了
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.04,0:33:18.63,*CHS,370,0,0,0,,邓布利多想要他的…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.74,0:33:20.47,*CHS,371,0,0,0,,他等着见我
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.58,0:33:23.41,*CHS,372,0,0,0,,好了.火车十分钟以后开
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.51,0:33:24.74,*CHS,373,0,0,0,,你的票
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.85,0:33:27.87,*CHS,374,0,0,0,,拿好了.哈利.这非常重要.拿好你的票
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.72,0:33:31.84,*CHS,375,0,0,0,,（九又四分之三站台）
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.95,0:33:34.35,*CHS,376,0,0,0,,九又四分之三站台？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.46,0:33:37.08,*CHS,377,0,0,0,,可是.海格.这一定是弄错了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.19,0:33:39.28,*CHS,378,0,0,0,,上面写着九又四分之三站台
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.39,0:33:41.62,*CHS,379,0,0,0,,没有这种站台.对吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.44,0:33:57.04,*CHS,380,0,0,0,,别挡在门口
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.25,0:34:02.24,*CHS,381,0,0,0,,抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.52,0:34:06.92,*CHS,382,0,0,0,,对不起.对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.52,0:34:09.05,*CHS,383,0,0,0,,穿过左边的通道.女士
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.16,0:34:12.95,*CHS,384,0,0,0,,对不起.先生请问去九又四分之三站台怎么走？
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.03,0:34:15.32,*CHS,385,0,0,0,,九又四分之三站台？你开玩笑吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.66,0:34:19.36,*CHS,386,0,0,0,,年年都是这样.这到处都是麻瓜 快点
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.67,0:34:21.76,*CHS,387,0,0,0,,- 麻瓜？ - 九又四分之三站台这边走
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.78,0:34:30.94,*CHS,388,0,0,0,,好了.珀西.你先走
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.86,0:34:43.35,*CHS,389,0,0,0,,弗雷德.你跟上
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.52,0:34:44.82,*CHS,390,0,0,0,,他不是弗雷德.我是
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.93,0:34:47.26,*CHS,391,0,0,0,,我说得了吧.你还自称是妈妈呢
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.36,0:34:49.49,*CHS,392,0,0,0,,喔.真对不起.乔治
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.30,0:34:55.27,*CHS,393,0,0,0,,闹着玩的.我是弗雷德
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.54,0:35:02.98,*CHS,394,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.21,0:35:08.04,*CHS,395,0,0,0,,请…请告诉我…怎样去…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.32,0:35:10.22,*CHS,396,0,0,0,,怎…怎么去站台.是吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.32,0:35:11.81,*CHS,397,0,0,0,,好的.别担心.宝贝儿
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.92,0:35:14.44,*CHS,398,0,0,0,,我们家罗恩其实也是第一次去霍格沃茨
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.56,0:35:20.99,*CHS,399,0,0,0,,你按我说的做九和十的标牌之间的中字朝着它直接走过去
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.06,0:35:22.75,*CHS,400,0,0,0,,要是紧张.就一路小跑
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.86,0:35:23.99,*CHS,401,0,0,0,,祝你好运
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.73,0:36:01.10,*CHS,402,0,0,0,,（霍格沃茨特快车）
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.86,0:36:23.35,*CHS,403,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.46,0:36:26.29,*CHS,404,0,0,0,,我能坐吗？别处都坐满了
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.39,0:36:27.69,*CHS,405,0,0,0,,尽管坐吧
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.57,0:36:32.90,*CHS,406,0,0,0,,我叫罗恩
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.00,0:36:34.09,*CHS,407,0,0,0,,罗恩·韦斯莱
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.20,0:36:35.90,*CHS,408,0,0,0,,我叫哈利.哈利·波特
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.21,0:36:40.37,*CHS,409,0,0,0,,那么…那是真的？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.48,0:36:43.91,*CHS,410,0,0,0,,我是说.你真有那…那…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.01,0:36:45.48,*CHS,411,0,0,0,,那什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.08,0:36:47.14,*CHS,412,0,0,0,,疤痕？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.95,0:36:51.28,*CHS,413,0,0,0,,喔.绝了！
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.66,0:36:56.55,*CHS,414,0,0,0,,要不要来点什么.孩子们？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.56,0:36:59.45,*CHS,415,0,0,0,,不.谢谢.我带了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.76,0:37:05.32,*CHS,416,0,0,0,,我们全要了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.94,0:37:18.78,*CHS,417,0,0,0,,上面写着比比多味豆？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.88,0:37:21.11,*CHS,418,0,0,0,,它有各种口味
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.95,0:37:25.51,*CHS,419,0,0,0,,有巧克力、薄荷味的.另外还有…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.62,0:37:28.85,*CHS,420,0,0,0,,菠菜味、牛肚味、猪肝味
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.69,0:37:33.06,*CHS,421,0,0,0,,乔治他还吃到过鼻涕味
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.53,0:37:40.19,*CHS,422,0,0,0,,不会是真的青蛙吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.30,0:37:41.53,*CHS,423,0,0,0,,那得施魔法
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.64,0:37:43.93,*CHS,424,0,0,0,,买它其实就是要画片
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.04,0:37:46.37,*CHS,425,0,0,0,,每包都有大魔法师的画片
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.47,0:37:48.41,*CHS,426,0,0,0,,我已经收集了五百多张了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.08,0:37:52.48,*CHS,427,0,0,0,,它跑了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.38,0:37:57.11,*CHS,428,0,0,0,,喔.真是倒霉
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.22,0:37:59.65,*CHS,429,0,0,0,,它们本来只能跳一次的
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.92,0:38:02.45,*CHS,430,0,0,0,,是邓布利多
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.56,0:38:05.36,*CHS,431,0,0,0,,我已经有六张了
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.70,0:38:08.86,*CHS,432,0,0,0,,呃…他不见了
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.96,0:38:12.59,*CHS,433,0,0,0,,他总不见得整天都待在那儿吧.对吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.50,0:38:15.16,*CHS,434,0,0,0,,这是我的斑斑鼠
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.27,0:38:16.70,*CHS,435,0,0,0,,他很可怜吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.80,0:38:18.03,*CHS,436,0,0,0,,有一点
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.14,0:38:21.73,*CHS,437,0,0,0,,弗雷德教我的咒语能把它变黄.想看吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.84,0:38:22.83,*CHS,438,0,0,0,,想
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.65,0:38:32.59,*CHS,439,0,0,0,,谁见过一只蛤蟆？
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.69,0:38:34.42,*CHS,440,0,0,0,,有个叫纳威的丢了一只
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.52,0:38:35.78,*CHS,441,0,0,0,,没有
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.89,0:38:37.76,*CHS,442,0,0,0,,喔.你在施魔法？
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.86,0:38:39.26,*CHS,443,0,0,0,,那瞧瞧吧
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.26,0:38:45.70,*CHS,444,0,0,0,,阳光.雏菊.黄油飘香
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.80,0:38:48.50,*CHS,445,0,0,0,,快快把这笨贼鼠变黄
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.64,0:38:54.37,*CHS,446,0,0,0,,你肯定那真的是咒语吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.48,0:38:57.04,*CHS,447,0,0,0,,看来这咒语好像…不太灵？
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.45,0:39:00.77,*CHS,448,0,0,0,,当然 我自己也试过几个简单的咒语
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.82,0:39:02.41,*CHS,449,0,0,0,,都挺灵验的
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.12,0:39:08.52,*CHS,450,0,0,0,,比如说…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.39,0:39:11.35,*CHS,451,0,0,0,,欧卡拉斯雷培洛
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.66,0:39:15.39,*CHS,452,0,0,0,,很快就修好了
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.50,0:39:22.27,*CHS,453,0,0,0,,真是不得了.你是哈利·波特！
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.37,0:39:23.84,*CHS,454,0,0,0,,我叫赫敏·格兰杰
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.94,0:39:26.34,*CHS,455,0,0,0,,那么.你是…？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.44,0:39:28.57,*CHS,456,0,0,0,,我叫罗恩·韦斯莱
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.68,0:39:29.77,*CHS,457,0,0,0,,幸会
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.08,0:39:32.14,*CHS,458,0,0,0,,你们俩最好换上袍子
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.25,0:39:34.11,*CHS,459,0,0,0,,我想我们就快到了
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.22,0:39:42.99,*CHS,460,0,0,0,,对了.你鼻子上有块脏东西.你知道吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.09,0:39:44.35,*CHS,461,0,0,0,,就在这
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.27,0:39:59.33,*CHS,462,0,0,0,,我们到了.一年的的
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.44,0:40:00.96,*CHS,463,0,0,0,,请到这边.快
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.34,0:40:03.78,*CHS,464,0,0,0,,一年级的同学.别害羞
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.11,0:40:06.51,*CHS,465,0,0,0,,快点.跟上.快
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.52,0:40:14.65,*CHS,466,0,0,0,,哈罗.哈利
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.76,0:40:15.92,*CHS,467,0,0,0,,嘿.海格
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.63,0:40:20.29,*CHS,468,0,0,0,,好了.到这边上船.快点
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.39,0:40:20.83,*CHS,469,0,0,0,,跟我来
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.67,0:41:39.80,*CHS,470,0,0,0,,欢迎来霍格沃茨
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.97,0:41:44.41,*CHS,471,0,0,0,,好了.再过一会儿.你们会穿过这些门和你们的同学在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.45,0:41:46.04,*CHS,472,0,0,0,,不过在入座以前
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.15,0:41:49.17,*CHS,473,0,0,0,,必须进行分类确定进哪个学院
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.52,0:41:52.71,*CHS,474,0,0,0,,有格兰芬多.赫奇帕奇
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.82,0:41:56.92,*CHS,475,0,0,0,,拉文克劳.和斯莱特林学院
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.79,0:42:00.06,*CHS,476,0,0,0,,在校期间
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.16,0:42:02.99,*CHS,477,0,0,0,,学院就好比你们的家
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.36,0:42:06.33,*CHS,478,0,0,0,,表现好能为学院加分
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.83,0:42:10.26,*CHS,479,0,0,0,,那个学院有人违反校规就得扣分
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.47,0:42:14.87,*CHS,480,0,0,0,,到了年终的时候哪个学院的得分最高就能赢得学院杯
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.21,0:42:18.34,*CHS,481,0,0,0,,吹宝
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.42,0:42:28.45,*CHS,482,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:42:28.69,0:42:32.42,*CHS,483,0,0,0,,再过一会儿分院仪式就要开始了
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.13,0:42:35.65,*CHS,484,0,0,0,,看来刚才
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.03,0:42:38.02,*CHS,485,0,0,0,,他们说的都是真的
Dialogue: 0,0:42:38.13,0:42:40.86,*CHS,486,0,0,0,,哈利·波特来霍格沃茨
Dialogue: 0,0:42:41.10,0:42:42.73,*CHS,487,0,0,0,,哈利·波特
Dialogue: 0,0:42:43.10,0:42:48.44,*CHS,488,0,0,0,,这是克拉布.这是高尔.我叫马尔福
Dialogue: 0,0:42:48.48,0:42:50.50,*CHS,489,0,0,0,,德拉科·马尔福
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.65,0:42:54.44,*CHS,490,0,0,0,,觉得我名字好笑吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.55,0:42:56.38,*CHS,491,0,0,0,,我不用问你叫什么
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.48,0:42:59.68,*CHS,492,0,0,0,,红头发.家里传下来的旧袍子
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.79,0:43:02.09,*CHS,493,0,0,0,,你一定是韦斯莱家的
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.32,0:43:07.52,*CHS,494,0,0,0,,你会发现有些魔法师家族就是高人一等.波特
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.53,0:43:10.96,*CHS,495,0,0,0,,你可别跟不三不四的人交往
Dialogue: 0,0:43:11.43,0:43:13.42,*CHS,496,0,0,0,,我可以帮你
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.80,0:43:19.00,*CHS,497,0,0,0,,我想我自己能分出好坏.谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:43:25.45,0:43:28.24,*CHS,498,0,0,0,,都准备好了.跟我来
Dialogue: 0,0:43:46.30,0:43:48.20,*CHS,499,0,0,0,,你瞧着这天空
Dialogue: 0,0:43:48.30,0:43:50.46,*CHS,500,0,0,0,,是天花板被施了魔法变成的
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.94,0:43:54.40,*CHS,501,0,0,0,,我在《霍格沃茨校史》中读到过
Dialogue: 0,0:44:07.29,0:44:08.85,*CHS,502,0,0,0,,请大家在这儿等着
Dialogue: 0,0:44:11.46,0:44:14.22,*CHS,503,0,0,0,,在仪式开始之前
Dialogue: 0,0:44:14.33,0:44:17.63,*CHS,504,0,0,0,,邓布利多教授要跟大家说几句话
Dialogue: 0,0:44:17.97,0:44:20.20,*CHS,505,0,0,0,,我有几件开学注意事项
Dialogue: 0,0:44:20.30,0:44:22.53,*CHS,506,0,0,0,,要宣布一下
Dialogue: 0,0:44:23.00,0:44:25.30,*CHS,507,0,0,0,,一年级新生注意
Dialogue: 0,0:44:25.54,0:44:30.74,*CHS,508,0,0,0,,本校严格禁止任何学生进入黑暗黑森林.那是禁令
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.78,0:44:37.41,*CHS,509,0,0,0,,另外.我们的管理员费尔奇先生要我提醒你们
Dialogue: 0,0:44:37.59,0:44:42.28,*CHS,510,0,0,0,,三楼走廊.右侧的走廊.也是禁地
Dialogue: 0,0:44:42.39,0:44:46.83,*CHS,511,0,0,0,,如果你们不想死得很惨.就千万不要去
Dialogue: 0,0:44:48.00,0:44:49.39,*CHS,512,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:44:51.73,0:44:54.10,*CHS,513,0,0,0,,叫到名字的同学
Dialogue: 0,0:44:54.20,0:44:56.00,*CHS,514,0,0,0,,就走到前面来
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.10,0:44:59.07,*CHS,515,0,0,0,,我会把分院帽戴在你的头上
Dialogue: 0,0:44:59.87,0:45:02.03,*CHS,516,0,0,0,,然后确定你要去的学院
Dialogue: 0,0:45:03.21,0:45:05.20,*CHS,517,0,0,0,,赫敏·格兰杰
Dialogue: 0,0:45:08.15,0:45:09.41,*CHS,518,0,0,0,,喔.不
Dialogue: 0,0:45:09.52,0:45:10.88,*CHS,519,0,0,0,,好险.别紧张
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.25,0:45:13.69,*CHS,520,0,0,0,,她脑子有病.怪怪的
Dialogue: 0,0:45:18.96,0:45:21.59,*CHS,521,0,0,0,,对了
Dialogue: 0,0:45:21.70,0:45:24.03,*CHS,522,0,0,0,,嗯.没错
Dialogue: 0,0:45:24.13,0:45:25.56,*CHS,523,0,0,0,,好呐
Dialogue: 0,0:45:25.67,0:45:27.29,*CHS,524,0,0,0,,格兰芬多
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.34,0:45:38.31,*CHS,525,0,0,0,,德拉科·马尔福
Dialogue: 0,0:45:43.85,0:45:45.32,*CHS,526,0,0,0,,斯莱特林
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.99,0:45:50.09,*CHS,527,0,0,0,,那些坏魔法师都是斯莱特林学院的
Dialogue: 0,0:45:50.19,0:45:51.52,*CHS,528,0,0,0,,苏珊·博恩斯
Dialogue: 0,0:46:01.00,0:46:03.37,*CHS,529,0,0,0,,哈利.怎么啦？
Dialogue: 0,0:46:03.50,0:46:06.63,*CHS,530,0,0,0,,没什么.没什么.我没事
Dialogue: 0,0:46:06.74,0:46:08.21,*CHS,531,0,0,0,,让我想想
Dialogue: 0,0:46:08.31,0:46:09.67,*CHS,532,0,0,0,,我知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:46:09.88,0:46:11.28,*CHS,533,0,0,0,,赫奇帕奇
Dialogue: 0,0:46:13.91,0:46:16.04,*CHS,534,0,0,0,,罗恩·韦斯莱
Dialogue: 0,0:46:29.60,0:46:32.57,*CHS,535,0,0,0,,哈！又是一个韦斯莱
Dialogue: 0,0:46:32.67,0:46:36.19,*CHS,536,0,0,0,,我知道应该把你分在哪儿
Dialogue: 0,0:46:36.30,0:46:38.33,*CHS,537,0,0,0,,格兰芬多
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.75,0:46:46.27,*CHS,538,0,0,0,,哈利·波特
Dialogue: 0,0:47:04.33,0:47:08.29,*CHS,539,0,0,0,,嗯.不好办啦.这可真是太难办啦
Dialogue: 0,0:47:08.40,0:47:12.50,*CHS,540,0,0,0,,看得出你很有勇气.而且心眼也不坏
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.61,0:47:15.23,*CHS,541,0,0,0,,才华横溢.呃.没错
Dialogue: 0,0:47:15.34,0:47:19.14,*CHS,542,0,0,0,,还极其渴望证明你自己
Dialogue: 0,0:47:19.25,0:47:21.98,*CHS,543,0,0,0,,可把你分在哪儿呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:47:22.08,0:47:24.64,*CHS,544,0,0,0,,不去斯莱特林.不去斯莱特林
Dialogue: 0,0:47:24.75,0:47:27.19,*CHS,545,0,0,0,,不去斯莱特林？
Dialogue: 0,0:47:27.29,0:47:30.48,*CHS,546,0,0,0,,你肯定吗？你能出人头地
Dialogue: 0,0:47:30.59,0:47:33.72,*CHS,547,0,0,0,,智慧都在你的小脑瓜里
Dialogue: 0,0:47:33.83,0:47:37.42,*CHS,548,0,0,0,,斯莱特林能帮你干成一番大事业
Dialogue: 0,0:47:37.53,0:47:39.23,*CHS,549,0,0,0,,这一点是毫无疑问的
Dialogue: 0,0:47:39.33,0:47:44.13,*CHS,550,0,0,0,,不去？好吧.既然你铁了心
Dialogue: 0,0:47:44.24,0:47:46.07,*CHS,551,0,0,0,,那就去…
Dialogue: 0,0:47:46.17,0:47:48.20,*CHS,552,0,0,0,,格兰芬多
Dialogue: 0,0:47:50.41,0:47:54.01,*CHS,553,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:56.32,0:47:59.88,*CHS,554,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:13.77,0:48:15.60,*CHS,555,0,0,0,,请大家注意啦
Dialogue: 0,0:48:18.51,0:48:21.70,*CHS,556,0,0,0,,现在宴会开始
Dialogue: 0,0:48:38.26,0:48:39.69,*CHS,557,0,0,0,,我是一半一半
Dialogue: 0,0:48:39.86,0:48:42.89,*CHS,558,0,0,0,,我爸是麻瓜.我妈是魔法师
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.26,0:48:45.96,*CHS,559,0,0,0,,我爸发现真相后吓得够呛
Dialogue: 0,0:48:47.94,0:48:51.96,*CHS,560,0,0,0,,珀西.你瞧跟奇洛教授说话的老师是谁？
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.04,0:48:53.44,*CHS,561,0,0,0,,喔.那是斯内普教授
Dialogue: 0,0:48:53.54,0:48:55.06,*CHS,562,0,0,0,,斯莱特林的院长
Dialogue: 0,0:48:55.31,0:48:56.28,*CHS,563,0,0,0,,他教什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:48:56.38,0:48:57.40,*CHS,564,0,0,0,,魔药学
Dialogue: 0,0:48:57.51,0:48:59.60,*CHS,565,0,0,0,,他对黑魔法最感兴趣
Dialogue: 0,0:48:59.71,0:49:02.15,*CHS,566,0,0,0,,奇洛被他仰慕好几年了
Dialogue: 0,0:49:07.55,0:49:12.75,*CHS,567,0,0,0,,哈喽.你们好.欢迎来格兰芬多
Dialogue: 0,0:49:23.57,0:49:25.33,*CHS,568,0,0,0,,看.那是血腥男爵
Dialogue: 0,0:49:30.84,0:49:31.74,*CHS,569,0,0,0,,尼古拉斯爵士
Dialogue: 0,0:49:31.85,0:49:33.24,*CHS,570,0,0,0,,暑期愉快吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:49:33.71,0:49:38.41,*CHS,571,0,0,0,,真无聊.我申请加入无头狩猎俱乐部又被拒绝了
Dialogue: 0,0:49:42.19,0:49:43.55,*CHS,572,0,0,0,,原来是你
Dialogue: 0,0:49:43.66,0:49:45.25,*CHS,573,0,0,0,,差点没头的尼克
Dialogue: 0,0:49:45.36,0:49:48.19,*CHS,574,0,0,0,,我更喜欢别人叫我尼古拉斯爵士
Dialogue: 0,0:49:48.30,0:49:49.79,*CHS,575,0,0,0,,差点没头？
Dialogue: 0,0:49:49.90,0:49:52.02,*CHS,576,0,0,0,,你怎么会是差点没头？
Dialogue: 0,0:49:52.13,0:49:53.46,*CHS,577,0,0,0,,像这样
Dialogue: 0,0:50:04.11,0:50:06.27,*CHS,578,0,0,0,,格兰芬多的同学跟我来
Dialogue: 0,0:50:06.28,0:50:07.31,*CHS,579,0,0,0,,跟上.谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:50:08.25,0:50:09.77,*CHS,580,0,0,0,,拉文克劳同学跟上
Dialogue: 0,0:50:10.68,0:50:11.91,*CHS,581,0,0,0,,这边
Dialogue: 0,0:50:12.65,0:50:15.55,*CHS,582,0,0,0,,这是通往宿舍最直的一条路
Dialogue: 0,0:50:15.66,0:50:19.68,*CHS,583,0,0,0,,嗯.不过得注意看楼梯.它们随时会变
Dialogue: 0,0:50:28.60,0:50:32.16,*CHS,584,0,0,0,,请大家跟上.跟着我
Dialogue: 0,0:50:32.31,0:50:35.21,*CHS,585,0,0,0,,快.都跟上.跟上
Dialogue: 0,0:50:35.68,0:50:37.74,*CHS,586,0,0,0,,西莫.快瞧.那幅画在动
Dialogue: 0,0:50:38.08,0:50:41.24,*CHS,587,0,0,0,,- 快看那幅.哈利 - 我想她是在看你
Dialogue: 0,0:50:41.35,0:50:42.61,*CHS,588,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:44.55,0:50:46.08,*CHS,589,0,0,0,,喔.看.快看！
Dialogue: 0,0:50:46.19,0:50:46.94,*CHS,590,0,0,0,,那女的是谁？
Dialogue: 0,0:50:46.95,0:50:48.75,*CHS,591,0,0,0,,欢迎来霍格沃茨
Dialogue: 0,0:50:49.82,0:50:51.69,*CHS,592,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:04.60,0:51:06.40,*CHS,593,0,0,0,,通行口令？
Dialogue: 0,0:51:06.74,0:51:08.94,*CHS,594,0,0,0,,通行口令龙渣
Dialogue: 0,0:51:17.45,0:51:18.55,*CHS,595,0,0,0,,大家跟我来
Dialogue: 0,0:51:18.59,0:51:21.65,*CHS,596,0,0,0,,跟上.快点.都跟上
Dialogue: 0,0:51:24.02,0:51:25.49,*CHS,597,0,0,0,,在这儿集合
Dialogue: 0,0:51:28.10,0:51:30.79,*CHS,598,0,0,0,,欢迎来格兰芬多公共休息室
Dialogue: 0,0:51:31.63,0:51:34.10,*CHS,599,0,0,0,,男生的宿舍在楼上靠左边
Dialogue: 0,0:51:34.20,0:51:36.14,*CHS,600,0,0,0,,女生的在右边
Dialogue: 0,0:51:36.24,0:51:39.36,*CHS,601,0,0,0,,你们的行李物品已经送上去了
Dialogue: 0,0:52:46.74,0:52:49.07,*CHS,602,0,0,0,,唷.总算到了
Dialogue: 0,0:52:49.41,0:52:52.71,*CHS,603,0,0,0,,要是麦格在.她的脸色准能吓死人
Dialogue: 0,0:52:57.18,0:52:59.15,*CHS,604,0,0,0,,这手实在是太高明啦
Dialogue: 0,0:52:59.25,0:53:01.95,*CHS,605,0,0,0,,谢谢你的评价.韦斯莱先生
Dialogue: 0,0:53:02.12,0:53:06.76,*CHS,606,0,0,0,,也许我该把波特先生和你变成一只怀表.那你们两个…
Dialogue: 0,0:53:06.86,0:53:08.73,*CHS,607,0,0,0,,至少有一个能遵守时间
Dialogue: 0,0:53:08.83,0:53:10.13,*CHS,608,0,0,0,,我们迷路了
Dialogue: 0,0:53:10.23,0:53:12.13,*CHS,609,0,0,0,,那就变成地图？
Dialogue: 0,0:53:12.60,0:53:15.09,*CHS,610,0,0,0,,上自己的座位总不要地图了吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:53:24.18,0:53:29.47,*CHS,611,0,0,0,,在我的课堂上可不许胡乱挥舞魔杖.没事乱念咒语
Dialogue: 0,0:53:30.02,0:53:31.48,*CHS,612,0,0,0,,其实呢…
Dialogue: 0,0:53:31.62,0:53:33.78,*CHS,613,0,0,0,,我想你们不会有很多人懂得…
Dialogue: 0,0:53:33.79,0:53:37.22,*CHS,614,0,0,0,,欣赏制魔药学深奥的科学和精密的工艺
Dialogue: 0,0:53:37.32,0:53:41.66,*CHS,615,0,0,0,,然而对那些少数的、优等生…
Dialogue: 0,0:53:41.76,0:53:45.92,*CHS,616,0,0,0,,那些真正有那意向的人
Dialogue: 0,0:53:48.70,0:53:52.54,*CHS,617,0,0,0,,我可以教你们如何对心灵施魔法
Dialogue: 0,0:53:52.64,0:53:55.34,*CHS,618,0,0,0,,如何使感官入圈套
Dialogue: 0,0:53:55.44,0:53:59.50,*CHS,619,0,0,0,,我会教你们铸造名气.酿造辉煌
Dialogue: 0,0:53:59.61,0:54:03.71,*CHS,620,0,0,0,,甚至能教你们如何造出长生不老药
Dialogue: 0,0:54:08.39,0:54:10.36,*CHS,621,0,0,0,,话说回来…
Dialogue: 0,0:54:10.46,0:54:15.53,*CHS,622,0,0,0,,也许你们有些人来霍格沃茨的时候已经具备了超凡的能力
Dialogue: 0,0:54:15.70,0:54:18.26,*CHS,623,0,0,0,,并且有足够的自信
Dialogue: 0,0:54:18.37,0:54:21.60,*CHS,624,0,0,0,,认为可以不专心听我讲课
Dialogue: 0,0:54:28.34,0:54:30.40,*CHS,625,0,0,0,,波特先生
Dialogue: 0,0:54:32.15,0:54:36.64,*CHS,626,0,0,0,,我们的一代名人
Dialogue: 0,0:54:38.22,0:54:43.18,*CHS,627,0,0,0,,告诉我.如果我把水仙球根粉末 加入苦艾茎液中会怎样？
Dialogue: 0,0:54:47.16,0:54:48.56,*CHS,628,0,0,0,,不知道？
Dialogue: 0,0:54:48.83,0:54:49.80,*CHS,629,0,0,0,,那我问你别的
Dialogue: 0,0:54:49.90,0:54:53.56,*CHS,630,0,0,0,,波特先生.如果我要牛黄知道上哪儿找？
Dialogue: 0,0:54:55.40,0:54:57.37,*CHS,631,0,0,0,,不知道.老师
Dialogue: 0,0:54:57.47,0:55:00.60,*CHS,632,0,0,0,,舟形乌头和狼毒乌头有什么区别？
Dialogue: 0,0:55:03.74,0:55:05.23,*CHS,633,0,0,0,,不知道.老师
Dialogue: 0,0:55:07.21,0:55:09.01,*CHS,634,0,0,0,,可惜
Dialogue: 0,0:55:10.22,0:55:15.05,*CHS,635,0,0,0,,很显然.光有名气是不够的
Dialogue: 0,0:55:15.16,0:55:17.39,*CHS,636,0,0,0,,对吗.波特先生？
Dialogue: 0,0:56:46.36,0:56:48.52,*CHS,637,0,0,0,,兔眼幽幽.素琴幽幽
Dialogue: 0,0:56:48.63,0:56:51.15,*CHS,638,0,0,0,,把这清水变为酒
Dialogue: 0,0:56:53.07,0:56:55.23,*CHS,639,0,0,0,,兔眼幽幽.素琴幽幽
Dialogue: 0,0:56:55.34,0:56:57.60,*CHS,640,0,0,0,,西莫到底想把那杯水怎么样？
Dialogue: 0,0:56:57.70,0:56:59.19,*CHS,641,0,0,0,,变成酒
Dialogue: 0,0:56:59.31,0:57:02.97,*CHS,642,0,0,0,,昨天倒是变成淡茶来 后来…
Dialogue: 0,0:57:07.98,0:57:11.01,*CHS,643,0,0,0,,啊…邮件来了
Dialogue: 0,0:57:43.52,0:57:45.14,*CHS,644,0,0,0,,我借来看一下？
Dialogue: 0,0:57:45.72,0:57:46.65,*CHS,645,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:57:48.86,0:57:52.72,*CHS,646,0,0,0,,嘿.瞧.纳威收到个记忆球
Dialogue: 0,0:57:52.89,0:57:54.38,*CHS,647,0,0,0,,我在书上读到过
Dialogue: 0,0:57:54.50,0:57:58.17,*CHS,648,0,0,0,,当烟变成红色就说明你忘了一件事情
Dialogue: 0,0:57:58.70,0:58:00.13,*CHS,649,0,0,0,,唯一的问题是…
Dialogue: 0,0:58:00.23,0:58:02.33,*CHS,650,0,0,0,,我记不起忘了什么啦
Dialogue: 0,0:58:03.64,0:58:05.80,*CHS,651,0,0,0,,有人闯入古灵阁
Dialogue: 0,0:58:05.91,0:58:07.17,*CHS,652,0,0,0,,听这
Dialogue: 0,0:58:07.27,0:58:10.64,*CHS,653,0,0,0,,相信是黑魔法师或者别的魔法师所为
Dialogue: 0,0:58:10.74,0:58:15.37,*CHS,654,0,0,0,,古灵阁妖精证实有人闯入但一再强调没有失窃
Dialogue: 0,0:58:15.42,0:58:17.58,*CHS,655,0,0,0,,事发现场.713号金库
Dialogue: 0,0:58:17.68,0:58:21.31,*CHS,656,0,0,0,,其实已于当天早些时候 被提取一空
Dialogue: 0,0:58:21.86,0:58:23.02,*CHS,657,0,0,0,,奇怪
Dialogue: 0,0:58:23.12,0:58:25.39,*CHS,658,0,0,0,,那是海格和我去的金库
Dialogue: 0,0:58:34.94,0:58:36.27,*CHS,659,0,0,0,,下午好.同学们
Dialogue: 0,0:58:36.37,0:58:38.84,*CHS,660,0,0,0,,下午好.霍琦夫人
Dialogue: 0,0:58:38.94,0:58:40.84,*CHS,661,0,0,0,,下午好.阿曼达.下午好
Dialogue: 0,0:58:42.94,0:58:45.54,*CHS,662,0,0,0,,现在上第一堂飞行课
Dialogue: 0,0:58:45.68,0:58:47.11,*CHS,663,0,0,0,,你们还等什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:58:47.21,0:58:49.81,*CHS,664,0,0,0,,大家都站到飞天扫帚的左边
Dialogue: 0,0:58:49.92,0:58:51.51,*CHS,665,0,0,0,,好了.动作快
Dialogue: 0,0:58:51.82,0:58:54.29,*CHS,666,0,0,0,,右手放到扫帚的上方.然后说
Dialogue: 0,0:58:54.39,0:58:55.51,*CHS,667,0,0,0,,“起来”
Dialogue: 0,0:58:55.62,0:58:58.99,*CHS,668,0,0,0,,起来
Dialogue: 0,0:59:00.13,0:59:02.06,*CHS,669,0,0,0,,起来
Dialogue: 0,0:59:03.16,0:59:05.53,*CHS,670,0,0,0,,起来.起来！
Dialogue: 0,0:59:05.63,0:59:06.50,*CHS,671,0,0,0,,带点感情
Dialogue: 0,0:59:16.18,0:59:17.80,*CHS,672,0,0,0,,不许取笑.哈利
Dialogue: 0,0:59:18.45,0:59:21.54,*CHS,673,0,0,0,,现在.抓住你们的扫帚…
Dialogue: 0,0:59:21.65,0:59:25.41,*CHS,674,0,0,0,,然后骑上去.紧紧抓住
Dialogue: 0,0:59:25.52,0:59:27.75,*CHS,675,0,0,0,,别滑下来啦
Dialogue: 0,0:59:27.85,0:59:30.48,*CHS,676,0,0,0,,我一吹哨子.你们每个人…
Dialogue: 0,0:59:30.59,0:59:32.89,*CHS,677,0,0,0,,都用力蹬地.腾空
Dialogue: 0,0:59:32.99,0:59:36.96,*CHS,678,0,0,0,,得把那扫帚扶稳了先盘旋一会
Dialogue: 0,0:59:37.06,0:59:39.16,*CHS,679,0,0,0,,然后身体稍稍往前倾斜
Dialogue: 0,0:59:39.27,0:59:40.73,*CHS,680,0,0,0,,回到地面
Dialogue: 0,0:59:41.37,0:59:45.10,*CHS,681,0,0,0,,听我的哨声…三.二…
Dialogue: 0,0:59:46.11,0:59:48.07,*CHS,682,0,0,0,,隆巴顿.你在干嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:59:48.18,0:59:49.77,*CHS,683,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:49.88,0:59:51.57,*CHS,684,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:53.15,0:59:55.84,*CHS,685,0,0,0,,隆巴顿先生 下去.下去！
Dialogue: 0,0:59:55.95,0:59:57.58,*CHS,686,0,0,0,,纳威！
Dialogue: 0,0:59:58.95,1:00:00.68,*CHS,687,0,0,0,,救命！救命啊！
Dialogue: 0,1:00:01.19,1:00:02.71,*CHS,688,0,0,0,,快给我下来.听见吗
Dialogue: 0,1:00:02.82,1:00:05.19,*CHS,689,0,0,0,,喔.不！
Dialogue: 0,1:00:11.53,1:00:13.32,*CHS,690,0,0,0,,救命啊！
Dialogue: 0,1:00:13.80,1:00:14.89,*CHS,691,0,0,0,,隆巴…
Dialogue: 0,1:00:15.14,1:00:17.04,*CHS,692,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:18.27,1:00:21.76,*CHS,693,0,0,0,,救命啊！
Dialogue: 0,1:00:32.99,1:00:34.65,*CHS,694,0,0,0,,大家都让开
Dialogue: 0,1:00:40.46,1:00:41.69,*CHS,695,0,0,0,,好了.起来吧？
Dialogue: 0,1:00:41.80,1:00:46.03,*CHS,696,0,0,0,,喔.喔.老天.手腕断了
Dialogue: 0,1:00:48.03,1:00:49.70,*CHS,697,0,0,0,,来.起来
Dialogue: 0,1:00:50.30,1:00:52.57,*CHS,698,0,0,0,,现在大家都老老实实地在地上呆着
Dialogue: 0,1:00:52.67,1:00:55.16,*CHS,699,0,0,0,,我送隆巴顿先生去医院
Dialogue: 0,1:00:55.28,1:00:56.40,*CHS,700,0,0,0,,懂了吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:00:56.71,1:00:59.04,*CHS,701,0,0,0,,要是我看见天上有扫帚
Dialogue: 0,1:00:59.15,1:01:03.34,*CHS,702,0,0,0,,那骑扫帚的没等说完魁地奇就给开除了
Dialogue: 0,1:01:04.58,1:01:06.52,*CHS,703,0,0,0,,看见他的脸吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:06.69,1:01:08.92,*CHS,704,0,0,0,,那胖墩要是捏一下这球
Dialogue: 0,1:01:09.02,1:01:10.89,*CHS,705,0,0,0,,就会记得用屁股着地
Dialogue: 0,1:01:10.99,1:01:12.48,*CHS,706,0,0,0,,把球给我.马尔福
Dialogue: 0,1:01:13.96,1:01:17.99,*CHS,707,0,0,0,,不.我要藏起来.让纳威去找
Dialogue: 0,1:01:21.94,1:01:23.37,*CHS,708,0,0,0,,屋顶上怎么样？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:25.71,1:01:28.97,*CHS,709,0,0,0,,怎么啦.波特？是不是够不着啦？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:31.68,1:01:33.65,*CHS,710,0,0,0,,哈利.这绝对不行
Dialogue: 0,1:01:33.75,1:01:35.21,*CHS,711,0,0,0,,霍琦夫人刚才说了
Dialogue: 0,1:01:35.32,1:01:37.98,*CHS,712,0,0,0,,再说你还不知道怎么飞
Dialogue: 0,1:01:39.02,1:01:40.92,*CHS,713,0,0,0,,真是个大白痴
Dialogue: 0,1:01:44.36,1:01:45.59,*CHS,714,0,0,0,,快把他给我
Dialogue: 0,1:01:45.69,1:01:47.49,*CHS,715,0,0,0,,不然我就把打下去
Dialogue: 0,1:01:48.03,1:01:49.39,*CHS,716,0,0,0,,口气倒不小？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:53.10,1:01:54.86,*CHS,717,0,0,0,,那你就瞧着办吧
Dialogue: 0,1:02:28.60,1:02:29.69,*CHS,718,0,0,0,,干得好.哈利
Dialogue: 0,1:02:29.80,1:02:31.29,*CHS,719,0,0,0,,简直绝了.哈利
Dialogue: 0,1:02:32.27,1:02:33.64,*CHS,720,0,0,0,,哈利·波特
Dialogue: 0,1:02:35.31,1:02:36.57,*CHS,721,0,0,0,,跟我来
Dialogue: 0,1:02:49.06,1:02:50.15,*CHS,722,0,0,0,,在这儿等着
Dialogue: 0,1:02:53.03,1:02:54.58,*CHS,723,0,0,0,,奇洛教授.对不起
Dialogue: 0,1:02:54.69,1:02:57.96,*CHS,724,0,0,0,,抱歉.我能跟伍德说几句话吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:02:58.37,1:03:00.70,*CHS,725,0,0,0,,行行行.当然行
Dialogue: 0,1:03:05.77,1:03:08.21,*CHS,726,0,0,0,,波特.这是奥利弗·伍德
Dialogue: 0,1:03:08.41,1:03:12.40,*CHS,727,0,0,0,,伍德.我给你找了一个找球手
Dialogue: 0,1:03:13.91,1:03:14.90,*CHS,728,0,0,0,,听说了吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:03:15.02,1:03:17.54,*CHS,729,0,0,0,,哈利·波特是格兰芬多新的找球手
Dialogue: 0,1:03:17.65,1:03:20.18,*CHS,730,0,0,0,,我早料到他会干得很出色
Dialogue: 0,1:03:20.29,1:03:21.28,*CHS,731,0,0,0,,找球手？
Dialogue: 0,1:03:21.39,1:03:24.32,*CHS,732,0,0,0,,学院队可从没收过一年级新生
Dialogue: 0,1:03:24.42,1:03:28.05,*CHS,733,0,0,0,,你一定是最年轻的球员…是百年最年轻的
Dialogue: 0,1:03:28.16,1:03:29.13,*CHS,734,0,0,0,,麦格教授说的
Dialogue: 0,1:03:29.23,1:03:31.90,*CHS,735,0,0,0,,嘿.棒极了.哈利 伍德跟我们说了
Dialogue: 0,1:03:32.07,1:03:33.93,*CHS,736,0,0,0,,弗雷德和乔治也在队里
Dialogue: 0,1:03:34.03,1:03:34.76,*CHS,737,0,0,0,,是击球手
Dialogue: 0,1:03:34.87,1:03:38.60,*CHS,738,0,0,0,,我们的任务就是…确保你不被打得七歪八斜
Dialogue: 0,1:03:38.71,1:03:40.20,*CHS,739,0,0,0,,但不可能没事的
Dialogue: 0,1:03:40.31,1:03:41.57,*CHS,740,0,0,0,,魁地奇很野蛮
Dialogue: 0,1:03:41.68,1:03:43.97,*CHS,741,0,0,0,,很残酷.可从来没死过人
Dialogue: 0,1:03:44.08,1:03:45.94,*CHS,742,0,0,0,,事后偶尔有人不见了…
Dialogue: 0,1:03:45.95,1:03:48.11,*CHS,743,0,0,0,,可过一、两个月又出现啦
Dialogue: 0,1:03:48.68,1:03:50.27,*CHS,744,0,0,0,,喔.上吧.哈利
Dialogue: 0,1:03:50.38,1:03:54.54,*CHS,745,0,0,0,,魁地奇很带劲是最刺激的 而你是最棒的
Dialogue: 0,1:03:54.62,1:03:56.59,*CHS,746,0,0,0,,可我从没打过魁地奇
Dialogue: 0,1:03:56.69,1:03:57.99,*CHS,747,0,0,0,,要是出了洋相怎么办？
Dialogue: 0,1:03:58.09,1:04:00.32,*CHS,748,0,0,0,,你才不会出洋相呢
Dialogue: 0,1:04:00.43,1:04:02.12,*CHS,749,0,0,0,,有遗传天份
Dialogue: 0,1:04:09.10,1:04:11.17,*CHS,750,0,0,0,,(找球手: 詹姆斯·波特)
Dialogue: 0,1:04:11.27,1:04:14.37,*CHS,751,0,0,0,,你从没说过你爸爸也是找球手
Dialogue: 0,1:04:15.01,1:04:17.48,*CHS,752,0,0,0,,我…我不知道
Dialogue: 0,1:04:23.12,1:04:25.68,*CHS,753,0,0,0,,跟你实说吧.厉害
Dialogue: 0,1:04:25.79,1:04:27.75,*CHS,754,0,0,0,,你的事.赫敏知道的比你还多
Dialogue: 0,1:04:27.85,1:04:29.25,*CHS,755,0,0,0,,都比我多
Dialogue: 0,1:04:31.16,1:04:32.56,*CHS,756,0,0,0,,怎么回事儿？
Dialogue: 0,1:04:33.39,1:04:36.73,*CHS,757,0,0,0,,这只楼梯会变.记得吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:04:42.77,1:04:43.83,*CHS,758,0,0,0,,我们走这边
Dialogue: 0,1:04:43.94,1:04:46.34,*CHS,759,0,0,0,,不然这些楼梯又得变了
Dialogue: 0,1:04:55.18,1:04:58.64,*CHS,760,0,0,0,,你们是不是觉得不该来这儿
Dialogue: 0,1:04:58.75,1:05:00.91,*CHS,761,0,0,0,,我们是不应该来这儿
Dialogue: 0,1:05:01.02,1:05:04.12,*CHS,762,0,0,0,,这是三楼.是禁止来这儿的
Dialogue: 0,1:05:06.23,1:05:07.49,*CHS,763,0,0,0,,我们走
Dialogue: 0,1:05:09.90,1:05:11.16,*CHS,764,0,0,0,,那是费尔奇的猫
Dialogue: 0,1:05:11.26,1:05:12.25,*CHS,765,0,0,0,,快跑！
Dialogue: 0,1:05:17.40,1:05:19.37,*CHS,766,0,0,0,,快！快藏到门后去
Dialogue: 0,1:05:25.05,1:05:25.84,*CHS,767,0,0,0,,门锁上了
Dialogue: 0,1:05:25.95,1:05:27.31,*CHS,768,0,0,0,,完蛋.这下完了
Dialogue: 0,1:05:27.41,1:05:29.04,*CHS,769,0,0,0,,你给我让开
Dialogue: 0,1:05:30.52,1:05:32.08,*CHS,770,0,0,0,,[开门咒] 阿拉霍魔拉
Dialogue: 0,1:05:33.62,1:05:34.55,*CHS,771,0,0,0,,进去
Dialogue: 0,1:05:36.69,1:05:37.78,*CHS,772,0,0,0,,阿拉霍魔拉？
Dialogue: 0,1:05:37.89,1:05:40.52,*CHS,773,0,0,0,,“标准咒语”书第七章里有
Dialogue: 0,1:05:40.63,1:05:43.29,*CHS,774,0,0,0,,有人进来了吗.亲爱的？
Dialogue: 0,1:05:50.60,1:05:51.76,*CHS,775,0,0,0,,走吧
Dialogue: 0,1:05:52.31,1:05:53.27,*CHS,776,0,0,0,,费尔奇走了
Dialogue: 0,1:05:53.37,1:05:54.74,*CHS,777,0,0,0,,也许他以为没人能进来
Dialogue: 0,1:05:54.84,1:05:55.93,*CHS,778,0,0,0,,门是锁着的
Dialogue: 0,1:05:56.04,1:05:57.81,*CHS,779,0,0,0,,锁上是有原因的
Dialogue: 0,1:06:17.06,1:06:19.69,*CHS,780,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:06:24.04,1:06:25.83,*CHS,781,0,0,0,,他们这是搞什么
Dialogue: 0,1:06:25.94,1:06:29.60,*CHS,782,0,0,0,,把那么一个怪物锁在学校里？
Dialogue: 0,1:06:29.84,1:06:33.74,*CHS,783,0,0,0,,你眼睛是用来干嘛的？没看见它站在哪吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:06:33.78,1:06:35.65,*CHS,784,0,0,0,,我又没有看见它的脚
Dialogue: 0,1:06:35.75,1:06:38.08,*CHS,785,0,0,0,,我光顾着看它的那些头啦
Dialogue: 0,1:06:38.18,1:06:41.15,*CHS,786,0,0,0,,也许你没注意.它有三个头
Dialogue: 0,1:06:41.25,1:06:42.78,*CHS,787,0,0,0,,它站在活板门上
Dialogue: 0,1:06:42.89,1:06:45.02,*CHS,788,0,0,0,,说明不是碰巧站在那儿
Dialogue: 0,1:06:45.13,1:06:46.89,*CHS,789,0,0,0,,它在看守东西
Dialogue: 0,1:06:47.53,1:06:48.72,*CHS,790,0,0,0,,看守东西？
Dialogue: 0,1:06:48.83,1:06:49.99,*CHS,791,0,0,0,,这没错
Dialogue: 0,1:06:50.10,1:06:52.93,*CHS,792,0,0,0,,现在.要是你们俩不介意.我要去睡了
Dialogue: 0,1:06:52.93,1:06:55.43,*CHS,793,0,0,0,,不然你们不知道谁又会蹦出什么妙计
Dialogue: 0,1:06:55.54,1:06:56.59,*CHS,794,0,0,0,,去送死
Dialogue: 0,1:06:56.70,1:06:59.04,*CHS,795,0,0,0,,没准会更糟.被开除
Dialogue: 0,1:07:03.24,1:07:06.64,*CHS,796,0,0,0,,哪个更糟.她真应该想清楚再说
Dialogue: 0,1:07:12.15,1:07:14.71,*CHS,797,0,0,0,,魁地奇其实很容易懂
Dialogue: 0,1:07:14.89,1:07:16.48,*CHS,798,0,0,0,,每个队有七个队员
Dialogue: 0,1:07:16.59,1:07:18.68,*CHS,799,0,0,0,,三个追球手.两个击球手
Dialogue: 0,1:07:18.79,1:07:20.49,*CHS,800,0,0,0,,一个守门员
Dialogue: 0,1:07:20.59,1:07:21.65,*CHS,801,0,0,0,,还有个找球手
Dialogue: 0,1:07:27.60,1:07:29.33,*CHS,802,0,0,0,,一共有三种球
Dialogue: 0,1:07:29.54,1:07:31.20,*CHS,803,0,0,0,,这一种叫鬼飞球
Dialogue: 0,1:07:31.70,1:07:34.30,*CHS,804,0,0,0,,追球手负责把鬼飞球
Dialogue: 0,1:07:34.41,1:07:37.10,*CHS,805,0,0,0,,打进三个铁环中的一个
Dialogue: 0,1:07:37.88,1:07:41.04,*CHS,806,0,0,0,,守门员就是我.守住铁环
Dialogue: 0,1:07:41.18,1:07:42.38,*CHS,807,0,0,0,,懂了吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:07:42.48,1:07:43.64,*CHS,808,0,0,0,,咦.是这样
Dialogue: 0,1:07:44.35,1:07:45.87,*CHS,809,0,0,0,,那些是什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:07:49.26,1:07:50.55,*CHS,810,0,0,0,,你拿好这个
Dialogue: 0,1:08:01.67,1:08:03.26,*CHS,811,0,0,0,,小心.它回来了
Dialogue: 0,1:08:10.64,1:08:11.97,*CHS,812,0,0,0,,嗯.不错嘛
Dialogue: 0,1:08:13.31,1:08:14.75,*CHS,813,0,0,0,,你击球也不赖
Dialogue: 0,1:08:31.13,1:08:32.50,*CHS,814,0,0,0,,那到底是什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:08:34.10,1:08:35.43,*CHS,815,0,0,0,,游走球
Dialogue: 0,1:08:35.84,1:08:37.20,*CHS,816,0,0,0,,讨厌的小家伙
Dialogue: 0,1:08:37.97,1:08:41.06,*CHS,817,0,0,0,,可你是…找球手
Dialogue: 0,1:08:45.15,1:08:49.31,*CHS,818,0,0,0,,你唯一要关心的是这个
Dialogue: 0,1:08:49.95,1:08:51.75,*CHS,819,0,0,0,,金色飞贼
Dialogue: 0,1:08:52.99,1:08:54.04,*CHS,820,0,0,0,,我喜欢这球
Dialogue: 0,1:08:54.15,1:08:57.25,*CHS,821,0,0,0,,啊.先别着急.瞧着吧
Dialogue: 0,1:08:57.36,1:09:00.12,*CHS,822,0,0,0,,它飞得贼快.你都没法看清
Dialogue: 0,1:09:00.23,1:09:02.22,*CHS,823,0,0,0,,我该做什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:09:02.33,1:09:05.73,*CHS,824,0,0,0,,抓到它.抢在对方之前
Dialogue: 0,1:09:05.83,1:09:08.43,*CHS,825,0,0,0,,不管哪方.只要抓到它.就是赢家
Dialogue: 0,1:09:08.57,1:09:10.33,*CHS,826,0,0,0,,你一抓到它.波特…
Dialogue: 0,1:09:10.44,1:09:12.03,*CHS,827,0,0,0,,比赛就结束
Dialogue: 0,1:09:21.51,1:09:27.04,*CHS,828,0,0,0,,作为一个魔法师.其基本功之一就是飘浮升空.就是…
Dialogue: 0,1:09:27.15,1:09:30.44,*CHS,829,0,0,0,,拥有能力使物体…飞起来
Dialogue: 0,1:09:30.66,1:09:32.63,*CHS,830,0,0,0,,你们都拿到羽毛了吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:09:32.73,1:09:33.75,*CHS,831,0,0,0,,很好
Dialogue: 0,1:09:33.86,1:09:38.69,*CHS,832,0,0,0,,现在…别忘了我们一直在练的手腕动作
Dialogue: 0,1:09:38.83,1:09:41.49,*CHS,833,0,0,0,,先一挥.再一抖
Dialogue: 0,1:09:41.60,1:09:43.09,*CHS,834,0,0,0,,一起来
Dialogue: 0,1:09:43.24,1:09:46.00,*CHS,835,0,0,0,,先一挥.再一抖
Dialogue: 0,1:09:46.37,1:09:47.24,*CHS,836,0,0,0,,很好
Dialogue: 0,1:09:47.34,1:09:49.47,*CHS,837,0,0,0,,噢.咒语得念清楚
Dialogue: 0,1:09:49.58,1:09:52.20,*CHS,838,0,0,0,,羽加迪姆 勒维奥萨
Dialogue: 0,1:09:52.31,1:09:53.94,*CHS,839,0,0,0,,你们练吧
Dialogue: 0,1:09:54.81,1:09:57.51,*CHS,840,0,0,0,,羽加迪姆 勒维奥萨
Dialogue: 0,1:09:57.62,1:09:59.85,*CHS,841,0,0,0,,羽加迪姆 勒维奥萨
Dialogue: 0,1:09:59.95,1:10:03.01,*CHS,842,0,0,0,,羽加迪姆 勒维奥萨
Dialogue: 0,1:10:03.69,1:10:05.66,*CHS,843,0,0,0,,不.停..停…停…
Dialogue: 0,1:10:05.76,1:10:08.09,*CHS,844,0,0,0,,你要戳瞎别人的眼睛啦
Dialogue: 0,1:10:08.19,1:10:10.49,*CHS,845,0,0,0,,再说.你也念错啦
Dialogue: 0,1:10:10.60,1:10:12.59,*CHS,846,0,0,0,,是勒维“奥”萨
Dialogue: 0,1:10:12.70,1:10:14.63,*CHS,847,0,0,0,,不是勒维奥“萨”
Dialogue: 0,1:10:14.73,1:10:18.10,*CHS,848,0,0,0,,你那么聪明,那你倒是试试看来啊…来啊
Dialogue: 0,1:10:20.27,1:10:22.43,*CHS,849,0,0,0,,羽加迪姆 勒维奥萨
Dialogue: 0,1:10:31.02,1:10:32.99,*CHS,850,0,0,0,,好极了
Dialogue: 0,1:10:33.09,1:10:36.25,*CHS,851,0,0,0,,大家看这儿.格兰杰小姐成功了
Dialogue: 0,1:10:36.36,1:10:37.82,*CHS,852,0,0,0,,真太好了
Dialogue: 0,1:10:38.02,1:10:39.96,*CHS,853,0,0,0,,羽加迪姆 勒维奥萨
Dialogue: 0,1:10:40.06,1:10:41.22,*CHS,854,0,0,0,,干得好
Dialogue: 0,1:10:46.57,1:10:49.80,*CHS,855,0,0,0,,我们这再需要一根羽毛.教授
Dialogue: 0,1:10:56.91,1:10:59.07,*CHS,856,0,0,0,,是勒维“奥”萨
Dialogue: 0,1:10:59.18,1:11:01.37,*CHS,857,0,0,0,,不是勒维奥“萨”
Dialogue: 0,1:11:01.48,1:11:03.47,*CHS,858,0,0,0,,真是个刺头.受不了
Dialogue: 0,1:11:03.58,1:11:05.88,*CHS,859,0,0,0,,怪不得她没什么朋友
Dialogue: 0,1:11:07.62,1:11:09.09,*CHS,860,0,0,0,,我想她听见了
Dialogue: 0,1:11:39.25,1:11:40.62,*CHS,861,0,0,0,,赫敏在哪儿？
Dialogue: 0,1:11:40.72,1:11:44.18,*CHS,862,0,0,0,,帕瓦蒂·佩蒂尔说她在厕所不肯出来
Dialogue: 0,1:11:44.29,1:11:47.59,*CHS,863,0,0,0,,可能一下午都躲在里面.在哭
Dialogue: 0,1:11:52.97,1:11:56.52,*CHS,864,0,0,0,,巨怪！在地下教室
Dialogue: 0,1:11:56.67,1:11:59.54,*CHS,865,0,0,0,,地下教室有巨怪
Dialogue: 0,1:12:02.91,1:12:04.27,*CHS,866,0,0,0,,知道了吗
Dialogue: 0,1:12:12.22,1:12:15.21,*CHS,867,0,0,0,,肃…静！
Dialogue: 0,1:12:16.42,1:12:19.82,*CHS,868,0,0,0,,请大家别慌.都别慌
Dialogue: 0,1:12:21.13,1:12:22.59,*CHS,869,0,0,0,,现在
Dialogue: 0,1:12:22.90,1:12:27.73,*CHS,870,0,0,0,,级长们…把各学院的同学领回各自的宿舍
Dialogue: 0,1:12:27.93,1:12:32.34,*CHS,871,0,0,0,,老师们和我一起去地下教室
Dialogue: 0,1:12:44.08,1:12:45.88,*CHS,872,0,0,0,,格兰芬多的同学.都跟上
Dialogue: 0,1:12:45.99,1:12:47.54,*CHS,873,0,0,0,,保持警惕
Dialogue: 0,1:12:47.65,1:12:49.05,*CHS,874,0,0,0,,山怪怎么会进来的？
Dialogue: 0,1:12:49.16,1:12:50.42,*CHS,875,0,0,0,,山怪很笨
Dialogue: 0,1:12:50.52,1:12:54.19,*CHS,876,0,0,0,,不会自己进来的也许有人在开玩笑
Dialogue: 0,1:12:54.56,1:12:55.39,*CHS,877,0,0,0,,干嘛？
Dialogue: 0,1:12:55.50,1:12:57.66,*CHS,878,0,0,0,,去找赫敏.她还不知道
Dialogue: 0,1:13:10.98,1:13:13.34,*CHS,879,0,0,0,,我想巨怪离开地下教室了
Dialogue: 0,1:13:18.35,1:13:20.22,*CHS,880,0,0,0,,它去女厕所了
Dialogue: 0,1:13:51.25,1:13:52.88,*CHS,881,0,0,0,,赫敏.快跑！
Dialogue: 0,1:13:57.06,1:13:58.46,*CHS,882,0,0,0,,救命！
Dialogue: 0,1:13:59.26,1:14:00.78,*CHS,883,0,0,0,,救命啊！
Dialogue: 0,1:14:03.13,1:14:05.43,*CHS,884,0,0,0,,嘿.大傻瓜！
Dialogue: 0,1:14:17.78,1:14:19.07,*CHS,885,0,0,0,,救命！
Dialogue: 0,1:14:40.67,1:14:42.29,*CHS,886,0,0,0,,快想办法
Dialogue: 0,1:14:44.40,1:14:45.89,*CHS,887,0,0,0,,怎么办？
Dialogue: 0,1:14:46.24,1:14:47.57,*CHS,888,0,0,0,,怎么都行
Dialogue: 0,1:14:49.14,1:14:50.07,*CHS,889,0,0,0,,先一挥.再一抖！
Dialogue: 0,1:14:50.18,1:14:51.73,*CHS,890,0,0,0,,先一挥.再一抖
Dialogue: 0,1:14:51.84,1:14:54.24,*CHS,891,0,0,0,,羽加迪姆 勒维奥萨
Dialogue: 0,1:15:05.02,1:15:06.39,*CHS,892,0,0,0,,酷
Dialogue: 0,1:15:31.48,1:15:33.94,*CHS,893,0,0,0,,他是不是…死了？
Dialogue: 0,1:15:34.25,1:15:37.52,*CHS,894,0,0,0,,我想没有.只是晕过去了
Dialogue: 0,1:15:44.73,1:15:46.25,*CHS,895,0,0,0,,恶心得要命
Dialogue: 0,1:15:48.24,1:15:50.70,*CHS,896,0,0,0,,噢…噢…我的天
Dialogue: 0,1:15:50.80,1:15:53.17,*CHS,897,0,0,0,,你们两最好解释一下
Dialogue: 0,1:15:54.37,1:15:57.07,*CHS,898,0,0,0,,这事都怪我.麦格教授
Dialogue: 0,1:15:59.91,1:16:01.54,*CHS,899,0,0,0,,格兰杰小姐？
Dialogue: 0,1:16:01.88,1:16:03.75,*CHS,900,0,0,0,,是我去找巨怪的
Dialogue: 0,1:16:03.85,1:16:06.71,*CHS,901,0,0,0,,我在书上读到过以为能对付它
Dialogue: 0,1:16:07.32,1:16:09.15,*CHS,902,0,0,0,,可是我错了
Dialogue: 0,1:16:09.46,1:16:12.65,*CHS,903,0,0,0,,如果不是哈利和罗恩来找我
Dialogue: 0,1:16:12.79,1:16:14.85,*CHS,904,0,0,0,,我也许就死啦
Dialogue: 0,1:16:15.46,1:16:16.72,*CHS,905,0,0,0,,就算是这样…
Dialogue: 0,1:16:16.73,1:16:19.23,*CHS,906,0,0,0,,这么做可真是愚蠢极了
Dialogue: 0,1:16:19.53,1:16:21.93,*CHS,907,0,0,0,,本以为你做事比别人更有头脑
Dialogue: 0,1:16:21.94,1:16:25.23,*CHS,908,0,0,0,,可你却让我极为失望.格兰杰小姐
Dialogue: 0,1:16:26.04,1:16:29.13,*CHS,909,0,0,0,,格兰芬多将被扣去五分
Dialogue: 0,1:16:29.28,1:16:32.24,*CHS,910,0,0,0,,因为你做事严重缺乏判断
Dialogue: 0,1:16:33.18,1:16:35.34,*CHS,911,0,0,0,,至于你们两位先生…
Dialogue: 0,1:16:35.45,1:16:38.71,*CHS,912,0,0,0,,我希望你们知道自己有多幸运
Dialogue: 0,1:16:39.09,1:16:42.42,*CHS,913,0,0,0,,一年级新生能勇斗山中巨怪
Dialogue: 0,1:16:42.49,1:16:45.42,*CHS,914,0,0,0,,还保住性命.这事可不多见
Dialogue: 0,1:16:45.59,1:16:48.56,*CHS,915,0,0,0,,加五分…
Dialogue: 0,1:16:49.43,1:16:52.36,*CHS,916,0,0,0,,你们两每人加五分
Dialogue: 0,1:16:54.17,1:16:56.96,*CHS,917,0,0,0,,只因为你们太走运
Dialogue: 0,1:17:01.84,1:17:04.04,*CHS,918,0,0,0,,你们快走吧
Dialogue: 0,1:17:04.14,1:17:05.51,*CHS,919,0,0,0,,它可…它可没死
Dialogue: 0,1:17:15.39,1:17:17.82,*CHS,920,0,0,0,,没想到惹出这样的麻烦吧？
Dialogue: 0,1:17:18.00,1:17:20.51,*CHS,921,0,0,0,,提醒你！我们确实救了她的命！
Dialogue: 0,1:17:20.52,1:17:24.12,*CHS,922,0,0,0,,提醒你！不是你惹恼了她.她根本就不需要你去救！
Dialogue: 0,1:17:24.96,1:17:27.36,*CHS,923,0,0,0,,朋友是用来干啥的？
Dialogue: 0,1:17:31.12,1:17:33.35,*CHS,924,0,0,0,,吃点吐司吧.快吃
Dialogue: 0,1:17:33.92,1:17:35.08,*CHS,925,0,0,0,,罗恩说得对
Dialogue: 0,1:17:35.19,1:17:37.22,*CHS,926,0,0,0,,待会儿你得大干一场啊
Dialogue: 0,1:17:37.43,1:17:38.95,*CHS,927,0,0,0,,可我不饿
Dialogue: 0,1:17:40.26,1:17:42.05,*CHS,928,0,0,0,,祝你今天好运.波特
Dialogue: 0,1:17:43.47,1:17:45.43,*CHS,929,0,0,0,,既然你连巨怪都能对付得了
Dialogue: 0,1:17:45.43,1:17:48.50,*CHS,930,0,0,0,,那么小小的魁地奇就是小菜一碟啦
Dialogue: 0,1:17:49.37,1:17:52.90,*CHS,931,0,0,0,,即使对手是…斯莱特林
Dialogue: 0,1:18:00.25,1:18:02.05,*CHS,932,0,0,0,,难怪他会流血
Dialogue: 0,1:18:02.72,1:18:04.08,*CHS,933,0,0,0,,流血？
Dialogue: 0,1:18:04.19,1:18:07.31,*CHS,934,0,0,0,,听着.我猜想.昨晚斯内普…
Dialogue: 0,1:18:07.42,1:18:08.95,*CHS,935,0,0,0,,把巨怪放进来做牵制
Dialogue: 0,1:18:09.06,1:18:11.05,*CHS,936,0,0,0,,那样他就能设法通过三头犬
Dialogue: 0,1:18:11.16,1:18:12.96,*CHS,937,0,0,0,,可结果他却被咬伤
Dialogue: 0,1:18:13.06,1:18:14.12,*CHS,938,0,0,0,,所以他瘸了腿
Dialogue: 0,1:18:14.23,1:18:17.03,*CHS,939,0,0,0,,他干嘛要通过三头犬呢？
Dialogue: 0,1:18:17.13,1:18:19.06,*CHS,940,0,0,0,,那天.海格从古灵阁金库里
Dialogue: 0,1:18:19.07,1:18:20.46,*CHS,941,0,0,0,,取出一件东西
Dialogue: 0,1:18:20.57,1:18:23.54,*CHS,942,0,0,0,,他说事关霍格沃茨.是绝密
Dialogue: 0,1:18:23.87,1:18:25.36,*CHS,943,0,0,0,,那你是说…
Dialogue: 0,1:18:25.47,1:18:27.17,*CHS,944,0,0,0,,那狗在看守那东西
Dialogue: 0,1:18:27.28,1:18:29.01,*CHS,945,0,0,0,,斯内普想得到它
Dialogue: 0,1:18:43.03,1:18:44.93,*CHS,946,0,0,0,,一大早就来邮件
Dialogue: 0,1:18:45.03,1:18:47.36,*CHS,947,0,0,0,,我…从没邮件
Dialogue: 0,1:18:47.63,1:18:49.19,*CHS,948,0,0,0,,先打开再说
Dialogue: 0,1:18:59.37,1:19:01.17,*CHS,949,0,0,0,,是一把扫帚
Dialogue: 0,1:19:01.28,1:19:03.74,*CHS,950,0,0,0,,它可不是普通的扫帚.哈利
Dialogue: 0,1:19:03.85,1:19:05.94,*CHS,951,0,0,0,,它可是光轮2000
Dialogue: 0,1:19:07.32,1:19:09.01,*CHS,952,0,0,0,,是谁…
Dialogue: 0,1:19:30.57,1:19:31.80,*CHS,953,0,0,0,,怕吗.哈利？
Dialogue: 0,1:19:32.17,1:19:33.37,*CHS,954,0,0,0,,有点
Dialogue: 0,1:19:33.48,1:19:34.74,*CHS,955,0,0,0,,没关系
Dialogue: 0,1:19:34.88,1:19:36.94,*CHS,956,0,0,0,,我第一次出场也这样
Dialogue: 0,1:19:37.15,1:19:38.17,*CHS,957,0,0,0,,后来呢？
Dialogue: 0,1:19:38.28,1:19:40.77,*CHS,958,0,0,0,,记不清啦
Dialogue: 0,1:19:41.02,1:19:43.68,*CHS,959,0,0,0,,一上场就被游走球打昏
Dialogue: 0,1:19:43.79,1:19:45.95,*CHS,960,0,0,0,,在医院躺了一星期
Dialogue: 0,1:20:08.91,1:20:10.54,*CHS,961,0,0,0,,哈罗.这是霍格沃茨本季
Dialogue: 0,1:20:10.65,1:20:12.31,*CHS,962,0,0,0,,首场魁地奇比赛
Dialogue: 0,1:20:12.41,1:20:15.98,*CHS,963,0,0,0,,今天的比赛是斯莱特林队对战格兰芬多队
Dialogue: 0,1:20:21.99,1:20:23.98,*CHS,964,0,0,0,,格兰芬多！
Dialogue: 0,1:20:26.50,1:20:29.95,*CHS,965,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:20:47.58,1:20:49.48,*CHS,966,0,0,0,,双方队员已经各就各位
Dialogue: 0,1:20:49.59,1:20:53.28,*CHS,967,0,0,0,,现在霍琦夫人正步入赛场.比赛即将开始
Dialogue: 0,1:20:54.12,1:20:57.32,*CHS,968,0,0,0,,我希望双方能赛出水平
Dialogue: 0,1:20:58.09,1:21:00.06,*CHS,969,0,0,0,,赛出风格
Dialogue: 0,1:21:05.97,1:21:08.70,*CHS,970,0,0,0,,游走球升空.接着是金色飞贼
Dialogue: 0,1:21:08.80,1:21:11.57,*CHS,971,0,0,0,,记住.金色飞贼的分值为150分
Dialogue: 0,1:21:11.71,1:21:14.68,*CHS,972,0,0,0,,哪一方得到金色飞贼.比赛就结束
Dialogue: 0,1:21:21.72,1:21:23.38,*CHS,973,0,0,0,,鬼飞球被抛出
Dialogue: 0,1:21:23.72,1:21:25.12,*CHS,974,0,0,0,,比赛开始！
Dialogue: 0,1:21:44.37,1:21:46.20,*CHS,975,0,0,0,,安吉利娜·约翰逊得分
Dialogue: 0,1:21:46.31,1:21:48.07,*CHS,976,0,0,0,,格兰芬多赢得10分
Dialogue: 0,1:21:51.71,1:21:52.87,*CHS,977,0,0,0,,好球！
Dialogue: 0,1:21:54.52,1:21:55.74,*CHS,978,0,0,0,,漂亮！
Dialogue: 0,1:22:00.22,1:22:02.21,*CHS,979,0,0,0,,现在.斯莱特林队抢到鬼飞球
Dialogue: 0,1:22:02.32,1:22:04.55,*CHS,980,0,0,0,,德里安传给队长弗林特
Dialogue: 0,1:22:36.93,1:22:37.79,*CHS,981,0,0,0,,好！
Dialogue: 0,1:22:37.89,1:22:40.23,*CHS,982,0,0,0,,现在格兰芬多队又得10分
Dialogue: 0,1:22:42.80,1:22:44.20,*CHS,983,0,0,0,,噢.太棒了…
Dialogue: 0,1:22:54.61,1:22:55.60,*CHS,984,0,0,0,,给我
Dialogue: 0,1:23:27.78,1:23:29.24,*CHS,985,0,0,0,,去那边
Dialogue: 0,1:24:16.43,1:24:18.36,*CHS,986,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:24:19.76,1:24:21.89,*CHS,987,0,0,0,,哈利的扫帚怎么会这样？
Dialogue: 0,1:24:32.11,1:24:34.34,*CHS,988,0,0,0,,斯内普.他在念咒语
Dialogue: 0,1:24:34.44,1:24:36.60,*CHS,989,0,0,0,,他在念咒语？我们怎么办？
Dialogue: 0,1:24:36.71,1:24:37.74,*CHS,990,0,0,0,,瞧我的
Dialogue: 0,1:24:42.22,1:24:43.34,*CHS,991,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:25:00.77,1:25:02.10,*CHS,992,0,0,0,,快点啊.赫敏
Dialogue: 0,1:25:16.25,1:25:18.81,*CHS,993,0,0,0,,拉卡隆依佛摩瑞
Dialogue: 0,1:25:27.13,1:25:28.29,*CHS,994,0,0,0,,火
Dialogue: 0,1:25:28.40,1:25:29.69,*CHS,995,0,0,0,,你着火了
Dialogue: 0,1:25:47.98,1:25:50.35,*CHS,996,0,0,0,,加油…
Dialogue: 0,1:26:42.14,1:26:43.54,*CHS,997,0,0,0,,看来他要吐了
Dialogue: 0,1:26:46.71,1:26:47.70,*CHS,998,0,0,0,,他抓到了飞贼
Dialogue: 0,1:26:47.81,1:26:51.31,*CHS,999,0,0,0,,哈利·波特抓到了金色飞贼 获得150分
Dialogue: 0,1:26:51.48,1:26:53.11,*CHS,1000,0,0,0,,格兰芬多获胜！
Dialogue: 0,1:26:57.05,1:26:58.21,*CHS,1001,0,0,0,,不会吧
Dialogue: 0,1:27:02.12,1:27:03.45,*CHS,1002,0,0,0,,耶！
Dialogue: 0,1:27:29.02,1:27:31.38,*CHS,1003,0,0,0,,格兰芬多！格兰芬多！
Dialogue: 0,1:27:31.49,1:27:35.22,*CHS,1004,0,0,0,,格兰芬多！格兰芬多！
Dialogue: 0,1:27:36.59,1:27:37.45,*CHS,1005,0,0,0,,尽胡扯
Dialogue: 0,1:27:37.56,1:27:39.82,*CHS,1006,0,0,0,,斯内普干嘛给哈利的扫帚念咒？
Dialogue: 0,1:27:40.23,1:27:41.39,*CHS,1007,0,0,0,,谁知道？
Dialogue: 0,1:27:42.20,1:27:45.33,*CHS,1008,0,0,0,,万圣节前夜…他干嘛要通过三头犬？
Dialogue: 0,1:27:45.50,1:27:46.90,*CHS,1009,0,0,0,,谁跟你说过毛毛？
Dialogue: 0,1:27:47.00,1:27:47.87,*CHS,1010,0,0,0,,毛毛？
Dialogue: 0,1:27:47.97,1:27:49.77,*CHS,1011,0,0,0,,那怪物还有名字？
Dialogue: 0,1:27:49.87,1:27:51.81,*CHS,1012,0,0,0,,当然有名字.他是我的
Dialogue: 0,1:27:51.91,1:27:55.07,*CHS,1013,0,0,0,,是我去年在酒馆向一个爱尔兰人买的
Dialogue: 0,1:27:55.08,1:27:57.27,*CHS,1014,0,0,0,,后来借给邓布利多去看守…
Dialogue: 0,1:27:57.38,1:27:59.57,*CHS,1015,0,0,0,,不能说.别再问了
Dialogue: 0,1:27:59.68,1:28:02.21,*CHS,1016,0,0,0,,别再问任何问题.这可是最高机密
Dialogue: 0,1:28:03.62,1:28:06.71,*CHS,1017,0,0,0,,不管是什么东西.反正斯内普想要偷
Dialogue: 0,1:28:06.82,1:28:08.29,*CHS,1018,0,0,0,,别胡说八道
Dialogue: 0,1:28:08.39,1:28:10.55,*CHS,1019,0,0,0,,斯内普教授是霍格沃茨的老师
Dialogue: 0,1:28:10.66,1:28:12.49,*CHS,1020,0,0,0,,不管他是不是老师
Dialogue: 0,1:28:12.59,1:28:13.96,*CHS,1021,0,0,0,,他就是在念咒
Dialogue: 0,1:28:14.06,1:28:16.22,*CHS,1022,0,0,0,,我知道.我在书上读过
Dialogue: 0,1:28:16.33,1:28:17.73,*CHS,1023,0,0,0,,念咒时紧盯目标
Dialogue: 0,1:28:17.83,1:28:19.89,*CHS,1024,0,0,0,,斯内普眼睛连眨都不眨
Dialogue: 0,1:28:20.00,1:28:21.40,*CHS,1025,0,0,0,,千真万确
Dialogue: 0,1:28:22.57,1:28:25.60,*CHS,1026,0,0,0,,你们都听着.给我听好
Dialogue: 0,1:28:25.71,1:28:28.68,*CHS,1027,0,0,0,,你们在管那些不应该管的事
Dialogue: 0,1:28:28.91,1:28:30.47,*CHS,1028,0,0,0,,那很危险
Dialogue: 0,1:28:30.58,1:28:32.01,*CHS,1029,0,0,0,,那条狗看守的东西…
Dialogue: 0,1:28:32.11,1:28:35.74,*CHS,1030,0,0,0,,仅限于邓布利多教授和尼可·勒梅
Dialogue: 0,1:28:35.85,1:28:37.72,*CHS,1031,0,0,0,,尼可·勒梅？(著名炼金术士.最后一块魔法石拥有者)
Dialogue: 0,1:28:38.35,1:28:39.79,*CHS,1032,0,0,0,,我…不该说的
Dialogue: 0,1:28:39.89,1:28:43.35,*CHS,1033,0,0,0,,我…真不该说漏嘴的,我真不该说
Dialogue: 0,1:28:43.36,1:28:44.52,*CHS,1034,0,0,0,,尼可·勒梅
Dialogue: 0,1:28:45.49,1:28:47.39,*CHS,1035,0,0,0,,谁是尼可·勒梅？
Dialogue: 0,1:28:47.56,1:28:49.03,*CHS,1036,0,0,0,,不知道
Dialogue: 0,1:29:08.52,1:29:09.78,*CHS,1037,0,0,0,,圣诞快乐
Dialogue: 0,1:29:09.88,1:29:11.32,*CHS,1038,0,0,0,,圣诞快乐
Dialogue: 0,1:29:11.42,1:29:14.15,*CHS,1039,0,0,0,,敲响霍格沃茨的钟
Dialogue: 0,1:29:34.11,1:29:36.48,*CHS,1040,0,0,0,,马走到一五
Dialogue: 0,1:29:44.99,1:29:46.98,*CHS,1041,0,0,0,,后走到一五
Dialogue: 0,1:29:52.73,1:29:54.59,*CHS,1042,0,0,0,,这简直太野蛮啦
Dialogue: 0,1:29:54.70,1:29:56.79,*CHS,1043,0,0,0,,这是魔法师棋
Dialogue: 0,1:29:57.37,1:29:58.46,*CHS,1044,0,0,0,,行李收拾好了？
Dialogue: 0,1:29:58.57,1:30:00.06,*CHS,1045,0,0,0,,你可还没收拾
Dialogue: 0,1:30:00.17,1:30:02.00,*CHS,1046,0,0,0,,改变计划了.我爸爸妈妈…
Dialogue: 0,1:30:02.10,1:30:05.27,*CHS,1047,0,0,0,,决定去罗马尼亚.去看我哥哥查理
Dialogue: 0,1:30:05.64,1:30:07.20,*CHS,1048,0,0,0,,他在那儿研究龙
Dialogue: 0,1:30:07.31,1:30:09.74,*CHS,1049,0,0,0,,很好.你可以帮哈利了
Dialogue: 0,1:30:09.84,1:30:13.54,*CHS,1050,0,0,0,,他要去图书馆看看 找有关尼可·勒梅的资料
Dialogue: 0,1:30:13.65,1:30:16.24,*CHS,1051,0,0,0,,我们已经找过一百遍了
Dialogue: 0,1:30:17.59,1:30:19.92,*CHS,1052,0,0,0,,可从没去禁区找过
Dialogue: 0,1:30:20.42,1:30:21.68,*CHS,1053,0,0,0,,圣诞快乐
Dialogue: 0,1:30:24.93,1:30:27.79,*CHS,1054,0,0,0,,看来跟着我们连她也学坏了
Dialogue: 0,1:30:30.40,1:30:31.96,*CHS,1055,0,0,0,,哈利.快醒醒！
Dialogue: 0,1:30:32.17,1:30:33.96,*CHS,1056,0,0,0,,快.哈利.醒醒！
Dialogue: 0,1:30:44.68,1:30:45.81,*CHS,1057,0,0,0,,圣诞快乐.哈利
Dialogue: 0,1:30:45.91,1:30:47.35,*CHS,1058,0,0,0,,圣诞快乐.罗恩
Dialogue: 0,1:30:48.18,1:30:49.98,*CHS,1059,0,0,0,,你穿着新毛衣？
Dialogue: 0,1:30:50.19,1:30:53.15,*CHS,1060,0,0,0,,噢…是我妈织的
Dialogue: 0,1:30:53.32,1:30:54.85,*CHS,1061,0,0,0,,好像你也有一件
Dialogue: 0,1:30:54.96,1:30:57.22,*CHS,1062,0,0,0,,我…我有礼物？
Dialogue: 0,1:30:57.33,1:30:58.49,*CHS,1063,0,0,0,,对
Dialogue: 0,1:31:04.73,1:31:07.00,*CHS,1064,0,0,0,,在这儿呢
Dialogue: 0,1:31:19.05,1:31:22.24,*CHS,1065,0,0,0,,你父亲临死前把这留下交给我
Dialogue: 0,1:31:22.35,1:31:24.91,*CHS,1066,0,0,0,,现在该把它该还给你了
Dialogue: 0,1:31:25.02,1:31:26.51,*CHS,1067,0,0,0,,好好使用
Dialogue: 0,1:31:43.54,1:31:44.87,*CHS,1068,0,0,0,,是什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:31:45.11,1:31:47.34,*CHS,1069,0,0,0,,像是一件斗篷
Dialogue: 0,1:31:47.44,1:31:49.50,*CHS,1070,0,0,0,,好哇.那就穿上试试
Dialogue: 0,1:31:56.25,1:31:57.41,*CHS,1071,0,0,0,,身体不见了
Dialogue: 0,1:31:57.45,1:32:01.45,*CHS,1072,0,0,0,,我知道这是什么.这是一件隐形斗篷
Dialogue: 0,1:32:01.56,1:32:02.92,*CHS,1073,0,0,0,,我隐形了啦？
Dialogue: 0,1:32:03.76,1:32:05.42,*CHS,1074,0,0,0,,这真稀罕
Dialogue: 0,1:32:07.16,1:32:08.63,*CHS,1075,0,0,0,,是谁送给你的？
Dialogue: 0,1:32:08.73,1:32:10.13,*CHS,1076,0,0,0,,没有署名
Dialogue: 0,1:32:10.37,1:32:12.09,*CHS,1077,0,0,0,,只是写了…
Dialogue: 0,1:32:12.27,1:32:13.13,*CHS,1078,0,0,0,,好好使用
Dialogue: 0,1:32:25.48,1:32:27.31,*CHS,1079,0,0,0,,（禁书区）
Dialogue: 0,1:32:41.70,1:32:43.99,*CHS,1080,0,0,0,,“著名的食火者”
Dialogue: 0,1:32:44.10,1:32:47.07,*CHS,1081,0,0,0,,“十五世纪的恶魔”.勒梅…
Dialogue: 0,1:32:47.64,1:32:49.30,*CHS,1082,0,0,0,,尼可·勒梅
Dialogue: 0,1:32:49.40,1:32:50.63,*CHS,1083,0,0,0,,你在那儿？
Dialogue: 0,1:32:51.04,1:32:52.27,*CHS,1084,0,0,0,,你在那儿？
Dialogue: 0,1:33:12.33,1:33:13.56,*CHS,1085,0,0,0,,谁在哪儿？
Dialogue: 0,1:33:20.47,1:33:21.96,*CHS,1086,0,0,0,,我知道你在里面
Dialogue: 0,1:33:23.17,1:33:24.87,*CHS,1087,0,0,0,,你躲不了
Dialogue: 0,1:33:33.45,1:33:34.64,*CHS,1088,0,0,0,,是谁呀？
Dialogue: 0,1:33:34.95,1:33:36.28,*CHS,1089,0,0,0,,快给我出来
Dialogue: 0,1:34:24.00,1:34:26.46,*CHS,1090,0,0,0,,斯内普.我…
Dialogue: 0,1:34:26.57,1:34:30.13,*CHS,1091,0,0,0,,你可别把我当成你的敌人.奇洛
Dialogue: 0,1:34:30.51,1:34:32.44,*CHS,1092,0,0,0,,你干嘛找我
Dialogue: 0,1:34:32.54,1:34:34.30,*CHS,1093,0,0,0,,你心里很清楚
Dialogue: 0,1:34:52.53,1:34:55.36,*CHS,1094,0,0,0,,我们改天再聊
Dialogue: 0,1:34:55.70,1:35:00.50,*CHS,1095,0,0,0,,等你有空决定好了该忠于谁我们再聊聊
Dialogue: 0,1:35:00.80,1:35:02.50,*CHS,1096,0,0,0,,喔.两位教授
Dialogue: 0,1:35:02.60,1:35:06.44,*CHS,1097,0,0,0,,瞧这个.我在禁区发现的
Dialogue: 0,1:35:06.54,1:35:08.13,*CHS,1098,0,0,0,,还热着呢
Dialogue: 0,1:35:08.24,1:35:10.87,*CHS,1099,0,0,0,,一定有个学生溜下了床
Dialogue: 0,1:36:43.67,1:36:45.16,*CHS,1100,0,0,0,,妈妈？
Dialogue: 0,1:36:48.78,1:36:50.11,*CHS,1101,0,0,0,,爸爸？
Dialogue: 0,1:37:25.35,1:37:27.51,*CHS,1102,0,0,0,,罗恩.快过去看看.一定要去看
Dialogue: 0,1:37:27.62,1:37:29.01,*CHS,1103,0,0,0,,罗恩
Dialogue: 0,1:37:32.19,1:37:35.31,*CHS,1104,0,0,0,,罗恩.行了.快点起床吧
Dialogue: 0,1:37:35.42,1:37:36.25,*CHS,1105,0,0,0,,干嘛？
Dialogue: 0,1:37:36.36,1:37:38.99,*CHS,1106,0,0,0,,你一定要跟我去看看.快跟我去
Dialogue: 0,1:37:45.63,1:37:47.16,*CHS,1107,0,0,0,,快点.快
Dialogue: 0,1:37:47.27,1:37:48.70,*CHS,1108,0,0,0,,快来看.是我的父母
Dialogue: 0,1:37:51.37,1:37:53.43,*CHS,1109,0,0,0,,只有我们两个
Dialogue: 0,1:37:53.54,1:37:56.64,*CHS,1110,0,0,0,,换个角度.站到这儿来
Dialogue: 0,1:37:57.08,1:37:59.27,*CHS,1111,0,0,0,,好了.看见他们了吧？
Dialogue: 0,1:37:59.38,1:38:03.51,*CHS,1112,0,0,0,,那是我.我成了男学生会主席
Dialogue: 0,1:38:03.62,1:38:05.88,*CHS,1113,0,0,0,,我抱着魁地奇杯
Dialogue: 0,1:38:05.99,1:38:10.98,*CHS,1114,0,0,0,,真是天大的美事儿.我还成了魁地奇队长
Dialogue: 0,1:38:11.33,1:38:13.66,*CHS,1115,0,0,0,,我真神气
Dialogue: 0,1:38:14.53,1:38:18.43,*CHS,1116,0,0,0,,哈利.这镜子 能显示未来的事？
Dialogue: 0,1:38:18.53,1:38:20.36,*CHS,1117,0,0,0,,怎么可能？
Dialogue: 0,1:38:20.50,1:38:22.59,*CHS,1118,0,0,0,,我的父母都死了
Dialogue: 0,1:38:37.39,1:38:38.96,*CHS,1119,0,0,0,,喜欢你的那份吗.罗恩？
Dialogue: 0,1:38:43.63,1:38:44.63,*CHS,1120,0,0,0,,罗恩
Dialogue: 0,1:38:44.88,1:38:45.97,*CHS,1121,0,0,0,,我马上回来
Dialogue: 0,1:38:57.69,1:38:59.67,*CHS,1122,0,0,0,,我们下棋吧
Dialogue: 0,1:38:59.97,1:39:00.50,*CHS,1123,0,0,0,,不
Dialogue: 0,1:39:00.69,1:39:02.30,*CHS,1124,0,0,0,,我们去海格那里？
Dialogue: 0,1:39:02.45,1:39:03.85,*CHS,1125,0,0,0,,不
Dialogue: 0,1:39:05.15,1:39:07.15,*CHS,1126,0,0,0,,哈利.我知道你在想什么…
Dialogue: 0,1:39:07.20,1:39:11.65,*CHS,1127,0,0,0,,别去了.那个镜子有问题!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:40.16,1:39:42.99,*CHS,1128,0,0,0,,你又来了.哈利？
Dialogue: 0,1:39:44.33,1:39:47.03,*CHS,1129,0,0,0,,依我看.你跟许多人一样
Dialogue: 0,1:39:47.14,1:39:51.59,*CHS,1130,0,0,0,,发现了厄里斯魔镜带来的无穷乐趣
Dialogue: 0,1:39:52.57,1:39:57.77,*CHS,1131,0,0,0,,我深信.你现在已经知道了它的魔力啦
Dialogue: 0,1:39:58.95,1:40:00.60,*CHS,1132,0,0,0,,我给你个提示
Dialogue: 0,1:40:01.08,1:40:03.45,*CHS,1133,0,0,0,,世界上最幸福的人
Dialogue: 0,1:40:03.55,1:40:07.30,*CHS,1134,0,0,0,,在照镜子时看见的就是他自己
Dialogue: 0,1:40:07.31,1:40:09.64,*CHS,1135,0,0,0,,自己本身的模样
Dialogue: 0,1:40:09.82,1:40:13.16,*CHS,1136,0,0,0,,它能让我们看到想要的东西？
Dialogue: 0,1:40:13.26,1:40:14.82,*CHS,1137,0,0,0,,无论是什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:40:14.93,1:40:16.40,*CHS,1138,0,0,0,,对
Dialogue: 0,1:40:16.50,1:40:18.12,*CHS,1139,0,0,0,,又不对
Dialogue: 0,1:40:18.57,1:40:21.33,*CHS,1140,0,0,0,,它让我们看到的只是…
Dialogue: 0,1:40:21.44,1:40:26.84,*CHS,1141,0,0,0,,藏在我们内心深处的最迫切最强烈的欲望
Dialogue: 0,1:40:27.48,1:40:31.58,*CHS,1142,0,0,0,,而你.哈利.从没见过你父母
Dialogue: 0,1:40:31.71,1:40:35.54,*CHS,1143,0,0,0,,所以你就看见他们站在你身旁
Dialogue: 0,1:40:35.95,1:40:38.24,*CHS,1144,0,0,0,,可你记住.哈利
Dialogue: 0,1:40:39.19,1:40:47.12,*CHS,1145,0,0,0,,这面镜子…没法给我们知识和真理
Dialogue: 0,1:40:48.26,1:40:51.66,*CHS,1146,0,0,0,,人们在它面前虚度时光
Dialogue: 0,1:40:51.77,1:40:53.79,*CHS,1147,0,0,0,,甚至发疯
Dialogue: 0,1:40:55.34,1:40:59.36,*CHS,1148,0,0,0,,所以呢.明天就把这镜子搬走
Dialogue: 0,1:40:59.71,1:41:02.30,*CHS,1149,0,0,0,,我必须奉劝你…
Dialogue: 0,1:41:02.41,1:41:06.51,*CHS,1150,0,0,0,,以后别再煞费苦心地去找它了
Dialogue: 0,1:41:07.18,1:41:10.91,*CHS,1151,0,0,0,,如果沉迷于梦想而忘记了生活
Dialogue: 0,1:41:11.05,1:41:14.08,*CHS,1152,0,0,0,,对你并没有好处
Dialogue: 0,1:42:09.90,1:42:11.10,*CHS,1153,0,0,0,,你好.海德薇
Dialogue: 0,1:42:13.60,1:42:17.50,*CHS,1154,0,0,0,,看看你.安排好你的课程（复习）.别老指望别人！
Dialogue: 0,1:42:17.80,1:42:19.90,*CHS,1155,0,0,0,,我们来做做即将到来的测验吧
Dialogue: 0,1:42:20.10,1:42:23.30,*CHS,1156,0,0,0,,我准备好了.可以问任何问题
Dialogue: 0,1:42:23.60,1:42:27.50,*CHS,1157,0,0,0,,是吗？遗忘魔药里最基础的三种剂量是什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:42:27.80,1:42:29.10,*CHS,1158,0,0,0,,过
Dialogue: 0,1:42:29.15,1:42:32.20,*CHS,1159,0,0,0,,如果期末考试砸锅了怎么办？
Dialogue: 0,1:42:32.28,1:42:33.30,*CHS,1160,0,0,0,,- 抄你的呗 - 你不会
Dialogue: 0,1:42:33.30,1:42:40.30,*CHS,1161,0,0,0,,况且根据考试规定.我们会被给予一支特殊的鹅毛笔.带反作弊魔咒的！
Dialogue: 0,1:42:40.39,1:42:45.50,*CHS,1162,0,0,0,,太让人气愤了.他们竟然不相信我们！ 邓布利多的游戏卡
Dialogue: 0,1:42:50.60,1:42:51.90,*CHS,1163,0,0,0,,锁腿咒？
Dialogue: 0,1:42:52.20,1:42:54.10,*CHS,1164,0,0,0,,马尔福（干的）
Dialogue: 0,1:42:59.50,1:43:02.90,*CHS,1165,0,0,0,,你必须在别人面前站起来.纳威！
Dialogue: 0,1:43:03.10,1:43:06.30,*CHS,1166,0,0,0,,噢.我根本站不住…太难受了！
Dialogue: 0,1:43:07.10,1:43:08.90,*CHS,1167,0,0,0,,让我来给你解咒
Dialogue: 0,1:43:09.00,1:43:12.98,*CHS,1168,0,0,0,,不.那正是我需要的.让你来决定我正出血的膝盖怎么样.不公平！
Dialogue: 0,1:43:13.99,1:43:17.60,*CHS,1169,0,0,0,,我还不稀得给你解咒呢！以你的处境来说.隆巴！
Dialogue: 0,1:43:17.64,1:43:20.32,*CHS,1170,0,0,0,,况且.如果有人稍稍注意到的话
Dialogue: 0,1:43:20.33,1:43:24.92,*CHS,1171,0,0,0,,我的眉毛已经完全长好了！
Dialogue: 0,1:43:28.60,1:43:29.60,*CHS,1172,0,0,0,,我找到他了！
Dialogue: 0,1:43:30.10,1:43:36.30,*CHS,1173,0,0,0,,邓布利多因以下几点而闻名天下…在1945年打败了黑巫师格林德沃；
Dialogue: 0,1:43:36.50,1:43:42.60,*CHS,1174,0,0,0,,发现了龙血的十二种用途.与同伴尼可勒梅一起为练金术作出了贡献
Dialogue: 0,1:43:42.69,1:43:46.58,*CHS,1175,0,0,0,,我曾经读到过这个名字 在那天的火车上
Dialogue: 0,1:43:46.61,1:43:47.60,*CHS,1176,0,0,0,,跟我来！
Dialogue: 0,1:43:53.10,1:43:56.80,*CHS,1177,0,0,0,,嗨.等一等.你们去哪儿？
Dialogue: 0,1:43:57.50,1:44:00.00,*CHS,1178,0,0,0,,先给我解咒好不好？
Dialogue: 0,1:44:02.88,1:44:05.07,*CHS,1179,0,0,0,,是我害你们找错了地方
Dialogue: 0,1:44:05.18,1:44:07.81,*CHS,1180,0,0,0,,我的脑子怎么会这么笨呢？
Dialogue: 0,1:44:08.42,1:44:11.78,*CHS,1181,0,0,0,,几星期前我借这本书读着消遣
Dialogue: 0,1:44:11.89,1:44:14.18,*CHS,1182,0,0,0,,这还叫消遣？
Dialogue: 0,1:44:18.89,1:44:21.05,*CHS,1183,0,0,0,,在这.这就对了
Dialogue: 0,1:44:21.16,1:44:25.53,*CHS,1184,0,0,0,,尼可·勒梅是唯一人所共知的…魔法石制造者
Dialogue: 0,1:44:25.63,1:44:27.12,*CHS,1185,0,0,0,,什么石？
Dialogue: 0,1:44:27.23,1:44:29.93,*CHS,1186,0,0,0,,难道你们俩不看书吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:44:30.37,1:44:33.07,*CHS,1187,0,0,0,,魔法石是一种神奇的物质
Dialogue: 0,1:44:33.17,1:44:35.20,*CHS,1188,0,0,0,,有惊人的魔力
Dialogue: 0,1:44:35.31,1:44:37.74,*CHS,1189,0,0,0,,它能把任何金属变成黄金
Dialogue: 0,1:44:37.84,1:44:39.97,*CHS,1190,0,0,0,,还能制造长生不老药
Dialogue: 0,1:44:40.08,1:44:42.01,*CHS,1191,0,0,0,,喝过的人能永生
Dialogue: 0,1:44:42.12,1:44:43.10,*CHS,1192,0,0,0,,能永生？
Dialogue: 0,1:44:43.22,1:44:44.27,*CHS,1193,0,0,0,,死不了.你懂吗
Dialogue: 0,1:44:44.38,1:44:46.32,*CHS,1194,0,0,0,,这意思我懂
Dialogue: 0,1:44:47.35,1:44:49.98,*CHS,1195,0,0,0,,在目前仅存一块魔法石
Dialogue: 0,1:44:50.09,1:44:52.29,*CHS,1196,0,0,0,,属著名的炼金术士
Dialogue: 0,1:44:52.39,1:44:54.02,*CHS,1197,0,0,0,,尼可·勒梅所有
Dialogue: 0,1:44:54.13,1:44:58.53,*CHS,1198,0,0,0,,去年他庆祝并度过了他的665岁生日
Dialogue: 0,1:44:59.13,1:45:01.53,*CHS,1199,0,0,0,,那就是毛毛看守的东西
Dialogue: 0,1:45:01.63,1:45:05.47,*CHS,1200,0,0,0,,也就是仅存下来的那块魔法石
Dialogue: 0,1:45:23.99,1:45:25.62,*CHS,1201,0,0,0,,对不起.别怪我失理
Dialogue: 0,1:45:25.73,1:45:27.22,*CHS,1202,0,0,0,,今天我没空跟你们玩
Dialogue: 0,1:45:27.23,1:45:29.39,*CHS,1203,0,0,0,,我们知道魔法石了
Dialogue: 0,1:45:34.70,1:45:36.13,*CHS,1204,0,0,0,,斯内普想偷那魔法石
Dialogue: 0,1:45:37.40,1:45:39.63,*CHS,1205,0,0,0,,你们到底在哪儿怀疑他？
Dialogue: 0,1:45:39.84,1:45:41.57,*CHS,1206,0,0,0,,我们知道他要魔法石
Dialogue: 0,1:45:41.67,1:45:43.04,*CHS,1207,0,0,0,,可不知道为什么
Dialogue: 0,1:45:43.14,1:45:46.04,*CHS,1208,0,0,0,,斯内普是保护魔法石的老师之一
Dialogue: 0,1:45:46.21,1:45:48.27,*CHS,1209,0,0,0,,他可不会偷的 什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:45:48.38,1:45:49.81,*CHS,1210,0,0,0,,你没听见？
Dialogue: 0,1:45:49.92,1:45:52.71,*CHS,1211,0,0,0,,好了.行啦.我今天有事要忙
Dialogue: 0,1:45:53.12,1:45:55.11,*CHS,1212,0,0,0,,他也在保护魔法石？
Dialogue: 0,1:45:55.22,1:45:58.88,*CHS,1213,0,0,0,,当然啦.还有别的办法来保护它 对吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:45:58.99,1:46:00.69,*CHS,1214,0,0,0,,咒语呀、魔法呀
Dialogue: 0,1:46:00.79,1:46:04.73,*CHS,1215,0,0,0,,没错.我看是多此一举
Dialogue: 0,1:46:05.03,1:46:07.66,*CHS,1216,0,0,0,,谁都过不了毛毛那一关.哼哼
Dialogue: 0,1:46:07.77,1:46:11.53,*CHS,1217,0,0,0,,没人知道办法.除了我和邓布利多
Dialogue: 0,1:46:11.64,1:46:14.51,*CHS,1218,0,0,0,,嗯.我不能告诉他们
Dialogue: 0,1:46:28.42,1:46:31.36,*CHS,1219,0,0,0,,海格.这到底是什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:46:31.46,1:46:33.15,*CHS,1220,0,0,0,,这是条？呃…
Dialogue: 0,1:46:34.33,1:46:36.06,*CHS,1221,0,0,0,,我知道这是什么
Dialogue: 0,1:46:36.70,1:46:39.39,*CHS,1222,0,0,0,,可是海格.你怎么弄来的？
Dialogue: 0,1:46:39.50,1:46:42.96,*CHS,1223,0,0,0,,赢来的.是从陌生人那儿赢来的
Dialogue: 0,1:46:43.07,1:46:46.47,*CHS,1224,0,0,0,,不知怎么.他好像巴不得输给我
Dialogue: 0,1:47:09.46,1:47:12.16,*CHS,1225,0,0,0,,这是一条…
Dialogue: 0,1:47:12.50,1:47:13.90,*CHS,1226,0,0,0,,一条龙吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:47:14.00,1:47:18.37,*CHS,1227,0,0,0,,它不光是一条龙.而且是条挪威脊背龙
Dialogue: 0,1:47:18.47,1:47:21.44,*CHS,1228,0,0,0,,我哥哥在罗马尼亚就是研究龙的
Dialogue: 0,1:47:21.54,1:47:23.17,*CHS,1229,0,0,0,,它很漂亮吧？
Dialogue: 0,1:47:23.28,1:47:25.61,*CHS,1230,0,0,0,,瞧着小家伙.把我当妈妈啦
Dialogue: 0,1:47:27.01,1:47:28.67,*CHS,1231,0,0,0,,哈罗.萝蔔
Dialogue: 0,1:47:29.12,1:47:30.24,*CHS,1232,0,0,0,,它叫萝蔔？
Dialogue: 0,1:47:30.35,1:47:32.88,*CHS,1233,0,0,0,,是呀.它总得有个名字吧
Dialogue: 0,1:47:34.19,1:47:36.31,*CHS,1234,0,0,0,,对不对.萝蔔？
Dialogue: 0,1:47:42.70,1:47:45.79,*CHS,1235,0,0,0,,当然.它还得受点训练
Dialogue: 0,1:47:50.57,1:47:51.94,*CHS,1236,0,0,0,,谁在那儿？
Dialogue: 0,1:47:54.37,1:47:55.84,*CHS,1237,0,0,0,,马尔福
Dialogue: 0,1:47:56.54,1:47:58.64,*CHS,1238,0,0,0,,噢.天哪
Dialogue: 0,1:48:00.48,1:48:02.04,*CHS,1239,0,0,0,,海格一直想养一条龙
Dialogue: 0,1:48:02.28,1:48:04.05,*CHS,1240,0,0,0,,第一次见到他他就说过
Dialogue: 0,1:48:04.75,1:48:06.65,*CHS,1241,0,0,0,,真是荒谬
Dialogue: 0,1:48:07.32,1:48:09.62,*CHS,1242,0,0,0,,更糟的是马尔福知道了
Dialogue: 0,1:48:09.72,1:48:11.75,*CHS,1243,0,0,0,,知道又怎么样.很糟吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:48:11.86,1:48:13.33,*CHS,1244,0,0,0,,糟透了
Dialogue: 0,1:48:14.03,1:48:15.32,*CHS,1245,0,0,0,,晚上好
Dialogue: 0,1:48:19.80,1:48:22.79,*CHS,1246,0,0,0,,绝不…我重复.绝不行
Dialogue: 0,1:48:22.90,1:48:26.60,*CHS,1247,0,0,0,,学生绝不可以夜间在校园擅自走动
Dialogue: 0,1:48:26.74,1:48:29.44,*CHS,1248,0,0,0,,因此对你们的行为要处罚
Dialogue: 0,1:48:29.54,1:48:31.64,*CHS,1249,0,0,0,,将扣你们五十分
Dialogue: 0,1:48:31.74,1:48:33.04,*CHS,1250,0,0,0,,五十分？
Dialogue: 0,1:48:33.15,1:48:34.74,*CHS,1251,0,0,0,,每个人扣五十分
Dialogue: 0,1:48:35.15,1:48:37.62,*CHS,1252,0,0,0,,为确保今后不再犯
Dialogue: 0,1:48:37.72,1:48:40.55,*CHS,1253,0,0,0,,你们四人都得关禁闭
Dialogue: 0,1:48:41.99,1:48:43.32,*CHS,1254,0,0,0,,对不起.教授
Dialogue: 0,1:48:43.42,1:48:44.95,*CHS,1255,0,0,0,,也许我听错了
Dialogue: 0,1:48:45.06,1:48:47.49,*CHS,1256,0,0,0,,你是说我们“四个人”？
Dialogue: 0,1:48:47.59,1:48:49.36,*CHS,1257,0,0,0,,你没有听错.马尔福先生
Dialogue: 0,1:48:49.46,1:48:51.02,*CHS,1258,0,0,0,,尽管你的用意是好的
Dialogue: 0,1:48:51.03,1:48:55.83,*CHS,1259,0,0,0,,可你也违反校规夜间擅自走动
Dialogue: 0,1:48:55.94,1:48:59.43,*CHS,1260,0,0,0,,你得跟你的同学一起关禁闭
Dialogue: 0,1:49:10.12,1:49:13.28,*CHS,1261,0,0,0,,可惜不再用老式的办法处罚啦
Dialogue: 0,1:49:13.89,1:49:15.75,*CHS,1262,0,0,0,,以前关禁闭的时候
Dialogue: 0,1:49:15.86,1:49:18.48,*CHS,1263,0,0,0,,得拴住大拇指吊在地下室里
Dialogue: 0,1:49:18.86,1:49:21.09,*CHS,1264,0,0,0,,真想念那些尖叫声
Dialogue: 0,1:49:23.60,1:49:26.50,*CHS,1265,0,0,0,,今天晚上关禁闭.你们得跟着海格
Dialogue: 0,1:49:27.00,1:49:31.87,*CHS,1266,0,0,0,,他有点小事要办你们得跟他一起去禁林
Dialogue: 0,1:49:35.51,1:49:37.60,*CHS,1267,0,0,0,,一帮捣蛋鬼.海格
Dialogue: 0,1:49:40.11,1:49:41.21,*CHS,1268,0,0,0,,噢.天哪
Dialogue: 0,1:49:41.31,1:49:44.18,*CHS,1269,0,0,0,,你该不会还在为那条龙生气吧？
Dialogue: 0,1:49:47.85,1:49:48.92,*CHS,1270,0,0,0,,萝蔔走了
Dialogue: 0,1:49:49.72,1:49:53.55,*CHS,1271,0,0,0,,邓布利多送它去罗马尼亚过群居生活
Dialogue: 0,1:49:53.66,1:49:55.13,*CHS,1272,0,0,0,,这可是好事呀？
Dialogue: 0,1:49:55.23,1:49:57.03,*CHS,1273,0,0,0,,和它的同类在一起
Dialogue: 0,1:49:57.13,1:49:59.50,*CHS,1274,0,0,0,,可要是它不喜欢罗马尼亚呢？
Dialogue: 0,1:49:59.60,1:50:02.19,*CHS,1275,0,0,0,,要是其他的龙欺负它呢？
Dialogue: 0,1:50:02.37,1:50:04.39,*CHS,1276,0,0,0,,它毕竟还是个小宝宝
Dialogue: 0,1:50:04.50,1:50:08.06,*CHS,1277,0,0,0,,我说行了.你也得振作点 别伤心啦
Dialogue: 0,1:50:08.17,1:50:09.90,*CHS,1278,0,0,0,,一会儿还得去禁林呢
Dialogue: 0,1:50:10.04,1:50:12.48,*CHS,1279,0,0,0,,你得多用点心才行
Dialogue: 0,1:50:12.58,1:50:15.38,*CHS,1280,0,0,0,,去禁林？是在开玩笑吧
Dialogue: 0,1:50:15.48,1:50:17.64,*CHS,1281,0,0,0,,不能去那儿
Dialogue: 0,1:50:18.08,1:50:20.61,*CHS,1282,0,0,0,,那儿禁止学生去
Dialogue: 0,1:50:20.72,1:50:22.75,*CHS,1283,0,0,0,,那儿还有…
Dialogue: 0,1:50:24.06,1:50:25.72,*CHS,1284,0,0,0,,还有狼人
Dialogue: 0,1:50:25.83,1:50:29.09,*CHS,1285,0,0,0,,那林子里有的不光是狼人
Dialogue: 0,1:50:29.23,1:50:31.46,*CHS,1286,0,0,0,,这是肯定的
Dialogue: 0,1:50:33.97,1:50:35.52,*CHS,1287,0,0,0,,晚安啦
Dialogue: 0,1:50:39.07,1:50:40.37,*CHS,1288,0,0,0,,好吧
Dialogue: 0,1:50:40.87,1:50:42.00,*CHS,1289,0,0,0,,我们走
Dialogue: 0,1:51:17.98,1:51:21.14,*CHS,1290,0,0,0,,哇.海格.那是什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:51:21.25,1:51:23.41,*CHS,1291,0,0,0,,就是为这来的
Dialogue: 0,1:51:24.25,1:51:25.15,*CHS,1292,0,0,0,,看见吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:51:25.22,1:51:27.68,*CHS,1293,0,0,0,,这是独角兽的血
Dialogue: 0,1:51:28.29,1:51:31.09,*CHS,1294,0,0,0,,几星期前有一条死了
Dialogue: 0,1:51:31.26,1:51:32.49,*CHS,1295,0,0,0,,现在…
Dialogue: 0,1:51:32.96,1:51:35.86,*CHS,1296,0,0,0,,这头看来伤得也不轻
Dialogue: 0,1:51:44.64,1:51:45.93,*CHS,1297,0,0,0,,所以…
Dialogue: 0,1:51:45.97,1:51:47.41,*CHS,1298,0,0,0,,我们的任务是…
Dialogue: 0,1:51:47.41,1:51:49.47,*CHS,1299,0,0,0,,去找那可怜的家伙
Dialogue: 0,1:51:49.58,1:51:51.63,*CHS,1300,0,0,0,,罗恩、赫敏.你们跟着我
Dialogue: 0,1:51:51.78,1:51:52.83,*CHS,1301,0,0,0,,好吧
Dialogue: 0,1:51:53.01,1:51:55.57,*CHS,1302,0,0,0,,哈利.你跟马尔福走
Dialogue: 0,1:51:57.72,1:51:59.95,*CHS,1303,0,0,0,,行了.可我要牙牙
Dialogue: 0,1:52:00.05,1:52:01.52,*CHS,1304,0,0,0,,好哇
Dialogue: 0,1:52:01.62,1:52:05.02,*CHS,1305,0,0,0,,可我提醒你.它是个胆小鬼
Dialogue: 0,1:52:09.53,1:52:12.09,*CHS,1306,0,0,0,,我爸要是知道了准有好戏看
Dialogue: 0,1:52:12.20,1:52:14.43,*CHS,1307,0,0,0,,喔.咱干佣人的活
Dialogue: 0,1:52:14.67,1:52:16.64,*CHS,1308,0,0,0,,要是我没猜错的话.德拉科
Dialogue: 0,1:52:16.74,1:52:18.36,*CHS,1309,0,0,0,,我看你是害怕了
Dialogue: 0,1:52:18.47,1:52:20.87,*CHS,1310,0,0,0,,才不怕呢.波特
Dialogue: 0,1:52:22.51,1:52:24.27,*CHS,1311,0,0,0,,听见没？
Dialogue: 0,1:52:26.95,1:52:28.14,*CHS,1312,0,0,0,,走吧.牙牙
Dialogue: 0,1:52:28.85,1:52:30.11,*CHS,1313,0,0,0,,谁怕呀！
Dialogue: 0,1:52:55.27,1:52:56.43,*CHS,1314,0,0,0,,是什么.牙牙？
Dialogue: 0,1:53:08.53,1:53:15.49,*CHS,1315,0,0,0,,救命…救命！
Dialogue: 0,1:54:07.81,1:54:11.17,*CHS,1316,0,0,0,,哈利·波特.你必须离开这儿
Dialogue: 0,1:54:11.28,1:54:13.38,*CHS,1317,0,0,0,,这儿很多动物都知道
Dialogue: 0,1:54:13.49,1:54:16.11,*CHS,1318,0,0,0,,这会儿的禁林可不安全
Dialogue: 0,1:54:16.22,1:54:17.75,*CHS,1319,0,0,0,,尤其是对你
Dialogue: 0,1:54:17.86,1:54:20.42,*CHS,1320,0,0,0,,刚才你救了我.可那是什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:54:20.53,1:54:23.12,*CHS,1321,0,0,0,,那是一个怪物
Dialogue: 0,1:54:23.23,1:54:26.13,*CHS,1322,0,0,0,,屠杀独角兽就是犯下重罪
Dialogue: 0,1:54:26.23,1:54:29.40,*CHS,1323,0,0,0,,喝了独角兽的血能延续你的生命
Dialogue: 0,1:54:29.50,1:54:31.87,*CHS,1324,0,0,0,,哪怕你在濒临死亡的时候
Dialogue: 0,1:54:31.97,1:54:34.06,*CHS,1325,0,0,0,,可这代价很惨重
Dialogue: 0,1:54:34.17,1:54:37.17,*CHS,1326,0,0,0,,如果你屠杀这么纯洁的生命
Dialogue: 0,1:54:37.28,1:54:40.14,*CHS,1327,0,0,0,,那么从它的血碰沾上你嘴唇的 那一刻起
Dialogue: 0,1:54:40.25,1:54:42.48,*CHS,1328,0,0,0,,你就半生半死啦
Dialogue: 0,1:54:42.58,1:54:44.28,*CHS,1329,0,0,0,,余生受到诅咒
Dialogue: 0,1:54:44.42,1:54:46.88,*CHS,1330,0,0,0,,这么活着的人是谁？
Dialogue: 0,1:54:46.99,1:54:48.19,*CHS,1331,0,0,0,,难道你想不出？
Dialogue: 0,1:54:49.49,1:54:50.75,*CHS,1332,0,0,0,,那你是说…
Dialogue: 0,1:54:50.86,1:54:53.65,*CHS,1333,0,0,0,,杀了独角兽的那个东西
Dialogue: 0,1:54:53.76,1:54:56.19,*CHS,1334,0,0,0,,也就是喝了它血的
Dialogue: 0,1:54:56.30,1:54:57.82,*CHS,1335,0,0,0,,可怕的佛地魔？
Dialogue: 0,1:54:57.93,1:54:59.50,*CHS,1336,0,0,0,,你知道此时此刻
Dialogue: 0,1:54:59.50,1:55:02.23,*CHS,1337,0,0,0,,学校里藏着什么东西.波特先生？
Dialogue: 0,1:55:03.87,1:55:05.60,*CHS,1338,0,0,0,,藏着魔法石
Dialogue: 0,1:55:06.87,1:55:08.13,*CHS,1339,0,0,0,,哈利！
Dialogue: 0,1:55:09.21,1:55:10.87,*CHS,1340,0,0,0,,你好.费伦泽
Dialogue: 0,1:55:11.28,1:55:14.07,*CHS,1341,0,0,0,,看来你见过小波特了
Dialogue: 0,1:55:14.28,1:55:15.50,*CHS,1342,0,0,0,,没事吧.哈利？
Dialogue: 0,1:55:17.35,1:55:19.11,*CHS,1343,0,0,0,,哈利·波特…
Dialogue: 0,1:55:19.22,1:55:21.31,*CHS,1344,0,0,0,,我就陪到这儿
Dialogue: 0,1:55:22.46,1:55:24.05,*CHS,1345,0,0,0,,你安全了
Dialogue: 0,1:55:24.86,1:55:26.29,*CHS,1346,0,0,0,,祝你好运
Dialogue: 0,1:55:33.73,1:55:36.29,*CHS,1347,0,0,0,,你是说那个神秘人现在就在那儿？
Dialogue: 0,1:55:36.40,1:55:38.27,*CHS,1348,0,0,0,,他就在禁林里吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:55:38.37,1:55:39.30,*CHS,1349,0,0,0,,他很虚弱
Dialogue: 0,1:55:39.41,1:55:41.31,*CHS,1350,0,0,0,,靠独角兽的血活命
Dialogue: 0,1:55:41.41,1:55:42.50,*CHS,1351,0,0,0,,还不明白？
Dialogue: 0,1:55:42.61,1:55:44.08,*CHS,1352,0,0,0,,我们错了
Dialogue: 0,1:55:44.18,1:55:46.58,*CHS,1353,0,0,0,,斯内普不是为他自己
Dialogue: 0,1:55:46.68,1:55:48.70,*CHS,1354,0,0,0,,他偷石头是为了佛地魔
Dialogue: 0,1:55:48.88,1:55:50.14,*CHS,1355,0,0,0,,有长生不老药
Dialogue: 0,1:55:50.25,1:55:51.94,*CHS,1356,0,0,0,,给佛地魔恢复元气
Dialogue: 0,1:55:52.05,1:55:55.51,*CHS,1357,0,0,0,,让他卷土重来
Dialogue: 0,1:55:55.62,1:55:57.21,*CHS,1358,0,0,0,,如果他卷土重来…
Dialogue: 0,1:55:57.32,1:56:01.99,*CHS,1359,0,0,0,,你以为他会不会想…会不会想杀你？
Dialogue: 0,1:56:02.43,1:56:05.69,*CHS,1360,0,0,0,,他没机会.不然今天晚上就能杀我
Dialogue: 0,1:56:06.33,1:56:10.20,*CHS,1361,0,0,0,,可我却在为魔药学期末考担心呢
Dialogue: 0,1:56:10.30,1:56:14.00,*CHS,1362,0,0,0,,都好好想想.有一点我们都忘了
Dialogue: 0,1:56:14.11,1:56:18.10,*CHS,1363,0,0,0,,佛地魔一向都害怕的那个魔法师是谁呢？
Dialogue: 0,1:56:19.61,1:56:21.08,*CHS,1364,0,0,0,,邓布利多
Dialogue: 0,1:56:21.18,1:56:24.71,*CHS,1365,0,0,0,,只要有邓布利多在.哈利.你就安全
Dialogue: 0,1:56:24.92,1:56:26.65,*CHS,1366,0,0,0,,只要有邓布利多在
Dialogue: 0,1:56:26.75,1:56:28.78,*CHS,1367,0,0,0,,佛地魔就不敢动
Dialogue: 0,1:56:34.73,1:56:38.26,*CHS,1368,0,0,0,,以前一直听说霍格沃茨期末考试很可怕
Dialogue: 0,1:56:38.33,1:56:40.56,*CHS,1369,0,0,0,,我倒觉得挺好玩的
Dialogue: 0,1:56:40.67,1:56:42.16,*CHS,1370,0,0,0,,我可没有这种感觉
Dialogue: 0,1:56:42.27,1:56:43.83,*CHS,1371,0,0,0,,怎么啦.哈利？
Dialogue: 0,1:56:44.27,1:56:45.97,*CHS,1372,0,0,0,,我的疤
Dialogue: 0,1:56:46.07,1:56:47.70,*CHS,1373,0,0,0,,像火在烧
Dialogue: 0,1:56:48.21,1:56:49.80,*CHS,1374,0,0,0,,以前也有过
Dialogue: 0,1:56:49.91,1:56:51.04,*CHS,1375,0,0,0,,不像这次
Dialogue: 0,1:56:51.14,1:56:52.58,*CHS,1376,0,0,0,,去找个护士看看
Dialogue: 0,1:56:52.68,1:56:54.15,*CHS,1377,0,0,0,,这是警告
Dialogue: 0,1:56:54.25,1:56:56.41,*CHS,1378,0,0,0,,意味着危险来临
Dialogue: 0,1:57:02.09,1:57:05.72,*CHS,1379,0,0,0,,- 呵…这就对了 - 怎么啦？
Dialogue: 0,1:57:06.29,1:57:07.82,*CHS,1380,0,0,0,,你们不觉得奇怪吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:57:07.93,1:57:10.12,*CHS,1381,0,0,0,,海格当时一心想要一条龙
Dialogue: 0,1:57:10.23,1:57:12.86,*CHS,1382,0,0,0,,这么巧就碰上了有龙的陌生人
Dialogue: 0,1:57:12.97,1:57:16.33,*CHS,1383,0,0,0,,想想看.谁会在兜里揣着龙蛋 到处逛呢？
Dialogue: 0,1:57:16.44,1:57:18.30,*CHS,1384,0,0,0,,为什么以前没想到呢？
Dialogue: 0,1:57:24.34,1:57:26.54,*CHS,1385,0,0,0,,海格.龙蛋是谁给你的？
Dialogue: 0,1:57:26.65,1:57:27.98,*CHS,1386,0,0,0,,那人长什么样？
Dialogue: 0,1:57:28.08,1:57:30.07,*CHS,1387,0,0,0,,不知道.没看清他的脸
Dialogue: 0,1:57:30.18,1:57:30.94,*CHS,1388,0,0,0,,他戴着头帽
Dialogue: 0,1:57:31.05,1:57:34.18,*CHS,1389,0,0,0,,那陌生人.你们一定谈过话吧？
Dialogue: 0,1:57:34.29,1:57:37.95,*CHS,1390,0,0,0,,他想知道我以前照料过哪些动物
Dialogue: 0,1:57:38.06,1:57:40.22,*CHS,1391,0,0,0,,我说连毛毛我都照料过
Dialogue: 0,1:57:40.33,1:57:42.19,*CHS,1392,0,0,0,,一条龙更不成问题啦
Dialogue: 0,1:57:42.29,1:57:44.49,*CHS,1393,0,0,0,,他对毛毛感兴趣吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:57:44.66,1:57:46.93,*CHS,1394,0,0,0,,喔.他当然对毛毛感兴趣
Dialogue: 0,1:57:47.03,1:57:51.36,*CHS,1395,0,0,0,,即使是魔法师也难得有机会见到三头犬的
Dialogue: 0,1:57:51.44,1:57:53.00,*CHS,1396,0,0,0,,当时我跟他说…
Dialogue: 0,1:57:53.11,1:57:55.37,*CHS,1397,0,0,0,,对付野兽的窍门就是
Dialogue: 0,1:57:55.47,1:57:57.14,*CHS,1398,0,0,0,,知道怎么让它安静
Dialogue: 0,1:57:57.24,1:57:58.97,*CHS,1399,0,0,0,,就比如说毛毛吧
Dialogue: 0,1:57:59.08,1:58:01.87,*CHS,1400,0,0,0,,给它来点音乐就睡着了
Dialogue: 0,1:58:04.38,1:58:06.35,*CHS,1401,0,0,0,,噢.不该告诉你们的
Dialogue: 0,1:58:07.19,1:58:09.45,*CHS,1402,0,0,0,,你们去哪儿？你们…
Dialogue: 0,1:58:16.33,1:58:18.09,*CHS,1403,0,0,0,,我们要见邓布利多教授
Dialogue: 0,1:58:18.20,1:58:19.60,*CHS,1404,0,0,0,,这会儿都得见！
Dialogue: 0,1:58:19.70,1:58:21.93,*CHS,1405,0,0,0,,恐怕邓布利多教授不在这儿
Dialogue: 0,1:58:22.07,1:58:27.06,*CHS,1406,0,0,0,,他收到猫头鹰从魔法部送来的急件立刻动身赶往伦敦去了
Dialogue: 0,1:58:27.17,1:58:28.40,*CHS,1407,0,0,0,,他走了？
Dialogue: 0,1:58:28.51,1:58:30.20,*CHS,1408,0,0,0,,这件事很重要
Dialogue: 0,1:58:30.31,1:58:32.78,*CHS,1409,0,0,0,,是有关魔法石的事
Dialogue: 0,1:58:34.15,1:58:37.08,*CHS,1410,0,0,0,,- 你们知道… - 有人想要把它偷走
Dialogue: 0,1:58:38.48,1:58:40.51,*CHS,1411,0,0,0,,我不知道你们会怎么知道魔法石的
Dialogue: 0,1:58:40.62,1:58:43.35,*CHS,1412,0,0,0,,可你们放心.它受严密保护
Dialogue: 0,1:58:43.89,1:58:46.36,*CHS,1413,0,0,0,,现在回你们的宿舍去吧
Dialogue: 0,1:58:46.66,1:58:47.69,*CHS,1414,0,0,0,,别声张
Dialogue: 0,1:58:56.60,1:58:58.57,*CHS,1415,0,0,0,,海格碰到的绝对不是陌生人
Dialogue: 0,1:58:58.67,1:58:59.60,*CHS,1416,0,0,0,,而是斯内普
Dialogue: 0,1:58:59.71,1:59:02.14,*CHS,1417,0,0,0,,这就是说他知道怎么通过毛毛
Dialogue: 0,1:59:02.24,1:59:03.71,*CHS,1418,0,0,0,,邓布利多偏偏不在…
Dialogue: 0,1:59:03.81,1:59:05.50,*CHS,1419,0,0,0,,下午好
Dialogue: 0,1:59:09.11,1:59:11.75,*CHS,1420,0,0,0,,像你们三位这样的格兰芬多年轻人
Dialogue: 0,1:59:11.75,1:59:15.91,*CHS,1421,0,0,0,,怎么甘愿呆在屋里呢.外面天气多好？
Dialogue: 0,1:59:22.03,1:59:24.15,*CHS,1422,0,0,0,,- 我们只是… - 得小心点
Dialogue: 0,1:59:24.76,1:59:27.25,*CHS,1423,0,0,0,,人们会以为…
Dialogue: 0,1:59:31.04,1:59:33.44,*CHS,1424,0,0,0,,你们在干坏事
Dialogue: 0,1:59:43.95,1:59:45.68,*CHS,1425,0,0,0,,现在怎么办？
Dialogue: 0,1:59:46.45,1:59:48.18,*CHS,1426,0,0,0,,去活板门下
Dialogue: 0,1:59:48.42,1:59:49.65,*CHS,1427,0,0,0,,今晚
Dialogue: 0,2:00:04.37,2:00:05.50,*CHS,1428,0,0,0,,吹宝…吹宝
Dialogue: 0,2:00:05.64,2:00:06.70,*CHS,1429,0,0,0,,吹宝…吹宝
Dialogue: 0,2:00:06.81,2:00:08.24,*CHS,1430,0,0,0,,走.你不该来这儿
Dialogue: 0,2:00:09.41,2:00:11.04,*CHS,1431,0,0,0,,你们也不该来这儿
Dialogue: 0,2:00:12.54,2:00:14.74,*CHS,1432,0,0,0,,你们又偷溜出来了.对吗？
Dialogue: 0,2:00:14.85,2:00:16.68,*CHS,1433,0,0,0,,纳威.你听着.我们…
Dialogue: 0,2:00:16.78,2:00:19.05,*CHS,1434,0,0,0,,- 我们在… - 不许去
Dialogue: 0,2:00:19.15,2:00:21.42,*CHS,1435,0,0,0,,别给格兰芬多惹麻烦
Dialogue: 0,2:00:21.52,2:00:23.85,*CHS,1436,0,0,0,,我…我跟你们拼了
Dialogue: 0,2:00:23.96,2:00:26.29,*CHS,1437,0,0,0,,纳威.委屈你了.真对不起你
Dialogue: 0,2:00:26.39,2:00:28.36,*CHS,1438,0,0,0,,变成…石头人
Dialogue: 0,2:00:36.20,2:00:38.60,*CHS,1439,0,0,0,,你有时候真有点吓人
Dialogue: 0,2:00:38.70,2:00:40.10,*CHS,1440,0,0,0,,知道吗？
Dialogue: 0,2:00:40.21,2:00:43.30,*CHS,1441,0,0,0,,很高明.但很可怕
Dialogue: 0,2:00:44.64,2:00:45.84,*CHS,1442,0,0,0,,我们走
Dialogue: 0,2:00:46.85,2:00:50.54,*CHS,1443,0,0,0,,- 对不起 - 对不起.这可是为你好
Dialogue: 0,2:00:56.42,2:00:58.39,*CHS,1444,0,0,0,,啊.你踩我脚了
Dialogue: 0,2:00:58.49,2:00:59.72,*CHS,1445,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,2:01:04.30,2:01:06.03,*CHS,1446,0,0,0,,[开门咒] 阿拉霍魔拉
Dialogue: 0,2:01:17.94,2:01:20.88,*CHS,1447,0,0,0,,等一下.它在…
Dialogue: 0,2:01:22.15,2:01:23.71,*CHS,1448,0,0,0,,打呼噜
Dialogue: 0,2:01:25.99,2:01:27.79,*CHS,1449,0,0,0,,斯内普已经来过了
Dialogue: 0,2:01:28.32,2:01:30.28,*CHS,1450,0,0,0,,他对竖琴念了魔咒
Dialogue: 0,2:01:32.96,2:01:37.06,*CHS,1451,0,0,0,,噢.这口臭可真熏人
Dialogue: 0,2:01:39.60,2:01:40.86,*CHS,1452,0,0,0,,把它的爪子挪开
Dialogue: 0,2:01:40.97,2:01:41.83,*CHS,1453,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,2:01:41.93,2:01:42.99,*CHS,1454,0,0,0,,来吧！
Dialogue: 0,2:01:45.17,2:01:46.80,*CHS,1455,0,0,0,,好呐.一起推
Dialogue: 0,2:02:12.53,2:02:13.86,*CHS,1456,0,0,0,,我头一个进去
Dialogue: 0,2:02:13.97,2:02:16.09,*CHS,1457,0,0,0,,等我给信号.你们再下来
Dialogue: 0,2:02:16.40,2:02:20.53,*CHS,1458,0,0,0,,如果出了什么意外你们就只管自己逃出去
Dialogue: 0,2:02:22.14,2:02:26.30,*CHS,1459,0,0,0,,是不是有点…太安静了？
Dialogue: 0,2:02:26.45,2:02:28.28,*CHS,1460,0,0,0,,竖琴
Dialogue: 0,2:02:29.11,2:02:30.78,*CHS,1461,0,0,0,,它不演奏了
Dialogue: 0,2:02:42.86,2:02:43.73,*CHS,1462,0,0,0,,跳下去！
Dialogue: 0,2:02:43.96,2:02:45.33,*CHS,1463,0,0,0,,跳！
Dialogue: 0,2:02:56.84,2:02:59.83,*CHS,1464,0,0,0,,幸好有这些植物在这儿
Dialogue: 0,2:03:15.19,2:03:16.79,*CHS,1465,0,0,0,,别乱动.都别动
Dialogue: 0,2:03:16.90,2:03:18.26,*CHS,1466,0,0,0,,这是魔鬼网
Dialogue: 0,2:03:18.36,2:03:19.66,*CHS,1467,0,0,0,,你们必须放松
Dialogue: 0,2:03:19.77,2:03:22.17,*CHS,1468,0,0,0,,不放松你们就会死得更快
Dialogue: 0,2:03:22.27,2:03:23.60,*CHS,1469,0,0,0,,死得更快？
Dialogue: 0,2:03:23.70,2:03:26.17,*CHS,1470,0,0,0,,噢.那我可真要放松啦
Dialogue: 0,2:03:29.48,2:03:31.14,*CHS,1471,0,0,0,,赫敏！
Dialogue: 0,2:03:31.31,2:03:32.74,*CHS,1472,0,0,0,,现在我们怎么办？
Dialogue: 0,2:03:32.85,2:03:34.57,*CHS,1473,0,0,0,,你要放松
Dialogue: 0,2:03:35.35,2:03:37.08,*CHS,1474,0,0,0,,赫敏.你在哪儿？
Dialogue: 0,2:03:37.18,2:03:38.77,*CHS,1475,0,0,0,,照我说的做
Dialogue: 0,2:03:38.88,2:03:40.25,*CHS,1476,0,0,0,,相信我
Dialogue: 0,2:03:43.56,2:03:44.72,*CHS,1477,0,0,0,,啊…哈利！
Dialogue: 0,2:03:45.26,2:03:46.59,*CHS,1478,0,0,0,,噢！
Dialogue: 0,2:03:47.03,2:03:47.82,*CHS,1479,0,0,0,,你没事吧？
Dialogue: 0,2:03:47.93,2:03:50.15,*CHS,1480,0,0,0,,没事.我挺好
Dialogue: 0,2:03:50.50,2:03:52.09,*CHS,1481,0,0,0,,他一点都没放松？
Dialogue: 0,2:03:52.20,2:03:53.63,*CHS,1482,0,0,0,,他没听你的
Dialogue: 0,2:03:53.73,2:03:55.67,*CHS,1483,0,0,0,,- 我们得想办法 - 怎么办？
Dialogue: 0,2:03:55.77,2:03:58.79,*CHS,1484,0,0,0,,我记得在草药学里读过
Dialogue: 0,2:04:00.44,2:04:01.91,*CHS,1485,0,0,0,,救命.救我…
Dialogue: 0,2:04:02.01,2:04:04.17,*CHS,1486,0,0,0,,说来真有趣
Dialogue: 0,2:04:04.28,2:04:05.77,*CHS,1487,0,0,0,,一见太阳往回收
Dialogue: 0,2:04:05.88,2:04:08.57,*CHS,1488,0,0,0,,没错.恶魔网最讨厌阳光
Dialogue: 0,2:04:08.95,2:04:10.68,*CHS,1489,0,0,0,,[荧光闪烁咒] 路摸思
Dialogue: 0,2:04:19.12,2:04:20.06,*CHS,1490,0,0,0,,罗恩.没事吧？
Dialogue: 0,2:04:20.16,2:04:21.35,*CHS,1491,0,0,0,,没事
Dialogue: 0,2:04:24.30,2:04:26.36,*CHS,1492,0,0,0,,噢.幸好没有慌张
Dialogue: 0,2:04:27.50,2:04:30.63,*CHS,1493,0,0,0,,幸好赫敏认真读过草药学
Dialogue: 0,2:04:32.77,2:04:34.24,*CHS,1494,0,0,0,,什么声音？
Dialogue: 0,2:04:34.34,2:04:35.77,*CHS,1495,0,0,0,,不知道
Dialogue: 0,2:04:36.68,2:04:37.87,*CHS,1496,0,0,0,,像翅膀煽动
Dialogue: 0,2:04:51.39,2:04:52.45,*CHS,1497,0,0,0,,奇怪
Dialogue: 0,2:04:52.56,2:04:54.82,*CHS,1498,0,0,0,,我没见过这样的鸟
Dialogue: 0,2:04:55.03,2:04:58.69,*CHS,1499,0,0,0,,这些不是鸟.是钥匙
Dialogue: 0,2:04:58.80,2:05:01.20,*CHS,1500,0,0,0,,肯定有一把能打开那扇门
Dialogue: 0,2:05:05.67,2:05:07.83,*CHS,1501,0,0,0,,这到底怎么回事？
Dialogue: 0,2:05:07.94,2:05:09.67,*CHS,1502,0,0,0,,我不知道
Dialogue: 0,2:05:16.45,2:05:17.85,*CHS,1503,0,0,0,,奇怪
Dialogue: 0,2:05:18.72,2:05:20.55,*CHS,1504,0,0,0,,[开门咒] 阿拉霍魔拉
Dialogue: 0,2:05:23.86,2:05:26.29,*CHS,1505,0,0,0,,噢.我是想试试
Dialogue: 0,2:05:26.49,2:05:27.92,*CHS,1506,0,0,0,,噢.我们怎么办？
Dialogue: 0,2:05:28.03,2:05:29.82,*CHS,1507,0,0,0,,这儿一定有上千把钥匙
Dialogue: 0,2:05:29.93,2:05:32.16,*CHS,1508,0,0,0,,找一把老式的大钥匙
Dialogue: 0,2:05:32.26,2:05:33.66,*CHS,1509,0,0,0,,只怕锈得像把手了
Dialogue: 0,2:05:33.77,2:05:37.43,*CHS,1510,0,0,0,,那儿.我看见啦 是往上的那个
Dialogue: 0,2:05:40.91,2:05:42.70,*CHS,1511,0,0,0,,怎么啦.哈利？
Dialogue: 0,2:05:44.38,2:05:45.90,*CHS,1512,0,0,0,,这也太简单了
Dialogue: 0,2:05:46.01,2:05:47.67,*CHS,1513,0,0,0,,噢.快上.哈利
Dialogue: 0,2:05:47.78,2:05:49.91,*CHS,1514,0,0,0,,如果斯内普骑着扫帚能抓到
Dialogue: 0,2:05:50.01,2:05:50.85,*CHS,1515,0,0,0,,那你也能
Dialogue: 0,2:05:50.95,2:05:53.65,*CHS,1516,0,0,0,,你是百年最棒的找球手
Dialogue: 0,2:06:11.34,2:06:13.36,*CHS,1517,0,0,0,,这下可不简单了
Dialogue: 0,2:06:35.59,2:06:36.96,*CHS,1518,0,0,0,,接住钥匙
Dialogue: 0,2:06:41.87,2:06:42.99,*CHS,1519,0,0,0,,快点！
Dialogue: 0,2:07:16.23,2:07:18.13,*CHS,1520,0,0,0,,我不喜欢这儿
Dialogue: 0,2:07:19.34,2:07:21.20,*CHS,1521,0,0,0,,一点也不喜欢
Dialogue: 0,2:07:21.31,2:07:22.71,*CHS,1522,0,0,0,,这是哪儿？
Dialogue: 0,2:07:23.01,2:07:24.60,*CHS,1523,0,0,0,,是墓地吗？
Dialogue: 0,2:07:24.71,2:07:26.74,*CHS,1524,0,0,0,,怎么是墓地呢
Dialogue: 0,2:07:34.85,2:07:36.82,*CHS,1525,0,0,0,,这是张棋盘
Dialogue: 0,2:07:49.74,2:07:51.26,*CHS,1526,0,0,0,,门在那儿
Dialogue: 0,2:08:03.92,2:08:05.47,*CHS,1527,0,0,0,,我们怎么过去？
Dialogue: 0,2:08:05.58,2:08:06.95,*CHS,1528,0,0,0,,这不明摆着？
Dialogue: 0,2:08:07.05,2:08:09.11,*CHS,1529,0,0,0,,得下棋才能走到门那儿
Dialogue: 0,2:08:10.36,2:08:11.38,*CHS,1530,0,0,0,,好吧
Dialogue: 0,2:08:11.49,2:08:14.36,*CHS,1531,0,0,0,,哈利.你站在象那个空格
Dialogue: 0,2:08:14.46,2:08:18.09,*CHS,1532,0,0,0,,赫敏.你就去做后一车
Dialogue: 0,2:08:18.83,2:08:20.66,*CHS,1533,0,0,0,,至于我嘛…
Dialogue: 0,2:08:20.77,2:08:22.39,*CHS,1534,0,0,0,,上马做骑士
Dialogue: 0,2:08:29.98,2:08:31.64,*CHS,1535,0,0,0,,现在该干嘛？
Dialogue: 0,2:08:32.61,2:08:35.60,*CHS,1536,0,0,0,,好吧.现在白方先走
Dialogue: 0,2:08:35.81,2:08:37.84,*CHS,1537,0,0,0,,然后…
Dialogue: 0,2:08:39.38,2:08:41.22,*CHS,1538,0,0,0,,开战
Dialogue: 0,2:08:51.23,2:08:52.72,*CHS,1539,0,0,0,,罗恩
Dialogue: 0,2:08:52.83,2:08:55.96,*CHS,1540,0,0,0,,我们这样下棋该不会是在下…
Dialogue: 0,2:08:56.07,2:08:59.59,*CHS,1541,0,0,0,,真正的魔法师棋吧？
Dialogue: 0,2:09:00.44,2:09:03.10,*CHS,1542,0,0,0,,黑棋走D5
Dialogue: 0,2:09:18.09,2:09:19.75,*CHS,1543,0,0,0,,没错.赫敏
Dialogue: 0,2:09:19.86,2:09:22.42,*CHS,1544,0,0,0,,我想你说得对极了
Dialogue: 0,2:09:22.53,2:09:24.79,*CHS,1545,0,0,0,,正是在下魔法师棋
Dialogue: 0,2:09:30.67,2:09:33.33,*CHS,1546,0,0,0,,车走到E4
Dialogue: 0,2:09:36.91,2:09:39.04,*CHS,1547,0,0,0,,卒走C3
Dialogue: 0,2:10:24.09,2:10:25.59,*CHS,1548,0,0,0,,你们等一下
Dialogue: 0,2:10:25.59,2:10:28.18,*CHS,1549,0,0,0,,看来你懂了.哈利
Dialogue: 0,2:10:28.29,2:10:30.73,*CHS,1550,0,0,0,,我只要一走下一步
Dialogue: 0,2:10:30.83,2:10:33.39,*CHS,1551,0,0,0,,后就会吃了我
Dialogue: 0,2:10:33.50,2:10:35.80,*CHS,1552,0,0,0,,这样你就能去将死王
Dialogue: 0,2:10:35.90,2:10:37.77,*CHS,1553,0,0,0,,不！罗恩！不！
Dialogue: 0,2:10:37.87,2:10:39.27,*CHS,1554,0,0,0,,怎么回事？
Dialogue: 0,2:10:39.37,2:10:40.93,*CHS,1555,0,0,0,,他打算牺牲他自己
Dialogue: 0,2:10:41.04,2:10:44.01,*CHS,1556,0,0,0,,不.这不行.一定有别的办法
Dialogue: 0,2:10:44.11,2:10:47.60,*CHS,1557,0,0,0,,你们还想不想阻止斯内普偷魔法石啦？
Dialogue: 0,2:10:48.18,2:10:52.18,*CHS,1558,0,0,0,,哈利.我很清楚该继续前进的是你
Dialogue: 0,2:10:52.25,2:10:55.45,*CHS,1559,0,0,0,,不是我.也不是赫敏.是你
Dialogue: 0,2:11:05.43,2:11:08.23,*CHS,1560,0,0,0,,马走到H3
Dialogue: 0,2:11:29.22,2:11:30.98,*CHS,1561,0,0,0,,将军
Dialogue: 0,2:12:00.29,2:12:01.78,*CHS,1562,0,0,0,,罗恩！
Dialogue: 0,2:12:02.32,2:12:04.29,*CHS,1563,0,0,0,,不！别动
Dialogue: 0,2:12:04.39,2:12:07.19,*CHS,1564,0,0,0,,别忘了棋还没下完
Dialogue: 0,2:12:23.27,2:12:24.80,*CHS,1565,0,0,0,,你被将死了
Dialogue: 0,2:12:44.50,2:12:45.72,*CHS,1566,0,0,0,,你照顾罗恩
Dialogue: 0,2:12:45.83,2:12:47.06,*CHS,1567,0,0,0,,然后去找猫头鹰
Dialogue: 0,2:12:47.17,2:12:49.03,*CHS,1568,0,0,0,,给邓布利多送个信
Dialogue: 0,2:12:49.20,2:12:51.03,*CHS,1569,0,0,0,,罗恩说得对
Dialogue: 0,2:12:51.20,2:12:52.50,*CHS,1570,0,0,0,,我得继续
Dialogue: 0,2:12:53.54,2:12:55.47,*CHS,1571,0,0,0,,你能行.哈利
Dialogue: 0,2:12:55.87,2:12:57.54,*CHS,1572,0,0,0,,你是优秀的
Dialogue: 0,2:12:57.64,2:12:59.17,*CHS,1573,0,0,0,,魔法师
Dialogue: 0,2:12:59.84,2:13:01.37,*CHS,1574,0,0,0,,你比我强
Dialogue: 0,2:13:03.11,2:13:05.98,*CHS,1575,0,0,0,,我靠书本和小聪明
Dialogue: 0,2:13:06.08,2:13:08.81,*CHS,1576,0,0,0,,有比这更重要的是
Dialogue: 0,2:13:09.09,2:13:12.25,*CHS,1577,0,0,0,,友谊和勇气
Dialogue: 0,2:13:12.36,2:13:14.85,*CHS,1578,0,0,0,,哈利.你多加小心
Dialogue: 0,2:13:52.70,2:13:54.13,*CHS,1579,0,0,0,,是你？
Dialogue: 0,2:13:55.67,2:13:57.76,*CHS,1580,0,0,0,,不.这不可能
Dialogue: 0,2:13:57.87,2:13:59.30,*CHS,1581,0,0,0,,斯内普…他才…他才是…
Dialogue: 0,2:13:59.40,2:14:01.70,*CHS,1582,0,0,0,,他确实看着像坏人
Dialogue: 0,2:14:02.71,2:14:04.80,*CHS,1583,0,0,0,,有他在.谁还会怀疑…
Dialogue: 0,2:14:04.91,2:14:09.40,*CHS,1584,0,0,0,,可…可…可…可怜的 奇…奇…奇…奇洛教授？
Dialogue: 0,2:14:09.51,2:14:13.75,*CHS,1585,0,0,0,,可…可那天魁地奇比赛的时候
Dialogue: 0,2:14:13.85,2:14:15.18,*CHS,1586,0,0,0,,斯内普想要害死我
Dialogue: 0,2:14:15.29,2:14:16.88,*CHS,1587,0,0,0,,啊…不.孩子
Dialogue: 0,2:14:16.99,2:14:18.89,*CHS,1588,0,0,0,,是我想害死你
Dialogue: 0,2:14:18.99,2:14:23.72,*CHS,1589,0,0,0,,相信我吧要不是斯内普的斗篷着了火挡住我的视线
Dialogue: 0,2:14:23.86,2:14:25.69,*CHS,1590,0,0,0,,我早就要了你的小命
Dialogue: 0,2:14:25.80,2:14:29.10,*CHS,1591,0,0,0,,就算斯内普再怎么念反咒也救不了你
Dialogue: 0,2:14:29.20,2:14:31.36,*CHS,1592,0,0,0,,他念咒语是想要救我？
Dialogue: 0,2:14:31.47,2:14:33.84,*CHS,1593,0,0,0,,我一开始就知道你是个威胁
Dialogue: 0,2:14:33.94,2:14:36.41,*CHS,1594,0,0,0,,尤其万圣节之后
Dialogue: 0,2:14:36.71,2:14:39.01,*CHS,1595,0,0,0,,是你放巨怪进来的？
Dialogue: 0,2:14:39.11,2:14:41.20,*CHS,1596,0,0,0,,没错.波特.你真行
Dialogue: 0,2:14:41.51,2:14:44.91,*CHS,1597,0,0,0,,只可惜斯内普没有上当
Dialogue: 0,2:14:45.02,2:14:46.95,*CHS,1598,0,0,0,,别的人在地下室内瞎忙活
Dialogue: 0,2:14:47.05,2:14:49.45,*CHS,1599,0,0,0,,他却直奔三楼阻拦我
Dialogue: 0,2:14:50.82,2:14:54.88,*CHS,1600,0,0,0,,当然啰.他再也不信我了
Dialogue: 0,2:14:55.33,2:14:57.73,*CHS,1601,0,0,0,,他不让我一个人呆着
Dialogue: 0,2:14:57.90,2:15:00.16,*CHS,1602,0,0,0,,可他并不明白
Dialogue: 0,2:15:00.77,2:15:04.06,*CHS,1603,0,0,0,,我不是一个人
Dialogue: 0,2:15:05.04,2:15:06.30,*CHS,1604,0,0,0,,呃…
Dialogue: 0,2:15:06.40,2:15:08.90,*CHS,1605,0,0,0,,这面镜子干什么用的？
Dialogue: 0,2:15:10.68,2:15:13.30,*CHS,1606,0,0,0,,我看见我的欲望
Dialogue: 0,2:15:13.41,2:15:16.40,*CHS,1607,0,0,0,,我看见我拿着魔法石
Dialogue: 0,2:15:16.51,2:15:18.21,*CHS,1608,0,0,0,,可我怎么得到？
Dialogue: 0,2:15:18.32,2:15:20.41,*CHS,1609,0,0,0,,利用这孩子
Dialogue: 0,2:15:20.99,2:15:23.18,*CHS,1610,0,0,0,,你过来.波特！
Dialogue: 0,2:15:23.29,2:15:24.72,*CHS,1611,0,0,0,,快！
Dialogue: 0,2:15:36.97,2:15:38.49,*CHS,1612,0,0,0,,告诉我…
Dialogue: 0,2:15:38.60,2:15:40.47,*CHS,1613,0,0,0,,你看见什么了？
Dialogue: 0,2:16:06.10,2:16:08.03,*CHS,1614,0,0,0,,快说.看见什么啦？
Dialogue: 0,2:16:08.17,2:16:11.62,*CHS,1615,0,0,0,,我跟邓布利多在握手
Dialogue: 0,2:16:11.74,2:16:14.14,*CHS,1616,0,0,0,,我赢得了学院杯
Dialogue: 0,2:16:14.24,2:16:16.14,*CHS,1617,0,0,0,,他撒谎
Dialogue: 0,2:16:16.24,2:16:17.97,*CHS,1618,0,0,0,,给我说实话
Dialogue: 0,2:16:18.08,2:16:20.07,*CHS,1619,0,0,0,,看见什么了？
Dialogue: 0,2:16:20.18,2:16:22.65,*CHS,1620,0,0,0,,我来跟他说
Dialogue: 0,2:16:22.75,2:16:24.54,*CHS,1621,0,0,0,,主人.你的体力还不够
Dialogue: 0,2:16:24.65,2:16:29.05,*CHS,1622,0,0,0,,我对付这件事体力足够啦
Dialogue: 0,2:16:46.94,2:16:49.93,*CHS,1623,0,0,0,,哈利·波特…
Dialogue: 0,2:16:50.04,2:16:52.57,*CHS,1624,0,0,0,,我们又见面了
Dialogue: 0,2:16:52.68,2:16:54.14,*CHS,1625,0,0,0,,佛…佛地魔
Dialogue: 0,2:16:54.25,2:16:55.77,*CHS,1626,0,0,0,,正是
Dialogue: 0,2:16:55.88,2:16:58.47,*CHS,1627,0,0,0,,瞧我成什么啦？
Dialogue: 0,2:16:58.58,2:17:02.08,*CHS,1628,0,0,0,,瞧我为了活命必须做什么？
Dialogue: 0,2:17:02.29,2:17:04.72,*CHS,1629,0,0,0,,寄生在别人身上
Dialogue: 0,2:17:04.82,2:17:06.98,*CHS,1630,0,0,0,,这条寄生虫
Dialogue: 0,2:17:07.09,2:17:10.79,*CHS,1631,0,0,0,,独角兽的血能延续我生命
Dialogue: 0,2:17:10.90,2:17:14.26,*CHS,1632,0,0,0,,可没法让我有自己的躯体
Dialogue: 0,2:17:14.40,2:17:17.83,*CHS,1633,0,0,0,,有一件东西能解决问题
Dialogue: 0,2:17:17.84,2:17:20.26,*CHS,1634,0,0,0,,这件东西现在近在咫尺
Dialogue: 0,2:17:20.27,2:17:23.50,*CHS,1635,0,0,0,,就在你的口袋里
Dialogue: 0,2:17:24.01,2:17:25.70,*CHS,1636,0,0,0,,抓住他！
Dialogue: 0,2:17:30.85,2:17:32.28,*CHS,1637,0,0,0,,别犯傻了
Dialogue: 0,2:17:32.65,2:17:41.28,*CHS,1638,0,0,0,,干嘛要忍受痛苦的惨死呢？你可以投靠我.留条命
Dialogue: 0,2:17:41.39,2:17:42.69,*CHS,1639,0,0,0,,休想！
Dialogue: 0,2:17:44.23,2:17:46.22,*CHS,1640,0,0,0,,有勇气
Dialogue: 0,2:17:46.53,2:17:49.63,*CHS,1641,0,0,0,,就像你的父母
Dialogue: 0,2:17:49.80,2:17:51.27,*CHS,1642,0,0,0,,告诉我
Dialogue: 0,2:17:51.67,2:17:53.10,*CHS,1643,0,0,0,,哈利…
Dialogue: 0,2:17:53.40,2:17:57.27,*CHS,1644,0,0,0,,你还想再见到你的妈妈和爸爸吗？
Dialogue: 0,2:17:57.41,2:17:58.92,*CHS,1645,0,0,0,,你我合作…
Dialogue: 0,2:17:58.98,2:18:02.74,*CHS,1646,0,0,0,,能让他们起死回生
Dialogue: 0,2:18:02.88,2:18:07.61,*CHS,1647,0,0,0,,我所要只是一点回报
Dialogue: 0,2:18:14.16,2:18:17.15,*CHS,1648,0,0,0,,仅此而已.哈利
Dialogue: 0,2:18:17.20,2:18:22.20,*CHS,1649,0,0,0,,这世上并没有什么善、恶
Dialogue: 0,2:18:22.43,2:18:25.10,*CHS,1650,0,0,0,,只有夺得权利的
Dialogue: 0,2:18:25.10,2:18:30.14,*CHS,1651,0,0,0,,和那些无力谋取权力的人
Dialogue: 0,2:18:30.48,2:18:35.03,*CHS,1652,0,0,0,,你我合作…可以干出一番惊天动地的事来
Dialogue: 0,2:18:35.91,2:18:39.41,*CHS,1653,0,0,0,,快把魔法石给我
Dialogue: 0,2:18:40.79,2:18:42.12,*CHS,1654,0,0,0,,你这骗子
Dialogue: 0,2:18:42.22,2:18:43.78,*CHS,1655,0,0,0,,杀了他
Dialogue: 0,2:19:07.78,2:19:09.41,*CHS,1656,0,0,0,,这是什么魔法？
Dialogue: 0,2:19:09.51,2:19:12.45,*CHS,1657,0,0,0,,笨蛋！快去拿石头
Dialogue: 0,2:20:47.45,2:20:48.81,*CHS,1658,0,0,0,,（早日康复）
Dialogue: 0,2:20:58.32,2:21:00.22,*CHS,1659,0,0,0,,下午好.哈利
Dialogue: 0,2:21:00.99,2:21:05.39,*CHS,1660,0,0,0,,哈.纪念品.是你的崇拜者送的？
Dialogue: 0,2:21:06.10,2:21:07.56,*CHS,1661,0,0,0,,崇拜者？
Dialogue: 0,2:21:07.70,2:21:11.69,*CHS,1662,0,0,0,,你和奇洛教授在地下教室的事 虽然是个保密
Dialogue: 0,2:21:11.80,2:21:13.74,*CHS,1663,0,0,0,,却不径而走
Dialogue: 0,2:21:13.84,2:21:18.54,*CHS,1664,0,0,0,,所以整个学校自然也就全都知道了
Dialogue: 0,2:21:20.88,2:21:23.97,*CHS,1665,0,0,0,,啊.看来你那位朋友罗恩…
Dialogue: 0,2:21:23.98,2:21:27.85,*CHS,1666,0,0,0,,已经帮你省了麻烦.打开了巧克力蛙
Dialogue: 0,2:21:27.95,2:21:29.94,*CHS,1667,0,0,0,,罗恩来过了？他没事吧？
Dialogue: 0,2:21:30.05,2:21:31.04,*CHS,1668,0,0,0,,赫敏怎么样？
Dialogue: 0,2:21:31.16,2:21:32.95,*CHS,1669,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,2:21:33.16,2:21:35.56,*CHS,1670,0,0,0,,他们俩个都挺好
Dialogue: 0,2:21:36.29,2:21:37.78,*CHS,1671,0,0,0,,魔法石怎么样了？
Dialogue: 0,2:21:37.90,2:21:39.69,*CHS,1672,0,0,0,,别紧张.亲爱的
Dialogue: 0,2:21:39.80,2:21:42.20,*CHS,1673,0,0,0,,那石头被毁了
Dialogue: 0,2:21:43.03,2:21:45.94,*CHS,1674,0,0,0,,我和的朋友尼可和我商量了一下
Dialogue: 0,2:21:46.04,2:21:51.07,*CHS,1675,0,0,0,,都认为只有这么做最妥当
Dialogue: 0,2:21:51.81,2:21:55.35,*CHS,1676,0,0,0,,可这样的话尼可就会死啦？
Dialogue: 0,2:21:56.42,2:22:00.18,*CHS,1677,0,0,0,,他有足够的灵药.一直能活到
Dialogue: 0,2:22:00.19,2:22:02.55,*CHS,1678,0,0,0,,料理完他自己的事
Dialogue: 0,2:22:02.72,2:22:03.88,*CHS,1679,0,0,0,,你说得没错
Dialogue: 0,2:22:04.09,2:22:06.02,*CHS,1680,0,0,0,,他的确会死
Dialogue: 0,2:22:06.72,2:22:08.92,*CHS,1681,0,0,0,,我怎么会得到魔法石的？
Dialogue: 0,2:22:09.03,2:22:11.85,*CHS,1682,0,0,0,,先前.我还在照镜子不一会儿…
Dialogue: 0,2:22:12.10,2:22:15.09,*CHS,1683,0,0,0,,要知道？只有那种…
Dialogue: 0,2:22:15.20,2:22:18.43,*CHS,1684,0,0,0,,一心只想找到石头
Dialogue: 0,2:22:18.54,2:22:21.30,*CHS,1685,0,0,0,,而又不利用它的人
Dialogue: 0,2:22:21.31,2:22:24.83,*CHS,1686,0,0,0,,才能最终得到它
Dialogue: 0,2:22:25.91,2:22:29.90,*CHS,1687,0,0,0,,这件事整个过程都在我的计划之中
Dialogue: 0,2:22:30.01,2:22:31.35,*CHS,1688,0,0,0,,你我很默契
Dialogue: 0,2:22:31.35,2:22:34.61,*CHS,1689,0,0,0,,自始至终都很默契
Dialogue: 0,2:22:36.09,2:22:39.25,*CHS,1690,0,0,0,,那么说现在石头没了…
Dialogue: 0,2:22:39.36,2:22:41.45,*CHS,1691,0,0,0,,佛地魔就不会回来啦？
Dialogue: 0,2:22:41.56,2:22:44.36,*CHS,1692,0,0,0,,呃…恐怕…
Dialogue: 0,2:22:45.26,2:22:47.76,*CHS,1693,0,0,0,,他有许多办法可以回来
Dialogue: 0,2:22:49.24,2:22:51.33,*CHS,1694,0,0,0,,你是不是知道…
Dialogue: 0,2:22:51.64,2:22:56.37,*CHS,1695,0,0,0,,奇洛教授为什么禁不起你碰他？
Dialogue: 0,2:22:57.04,2:22:59.37,*CHS,1696,0,0,0,,那是因为你母亲
Dialogue: 0,2:22:59.48,2:23:02.17,*CHS,1697,0,0,0,,为了你她牺牲了自己
Dialogue: 0,2:23:02.28,2:23:05.61,*CHS,1698,0,0,0,,这样的行为会留下了一个印记
Dialogue: 0,2:23:05.72,2:23:09.62,*CHS,1699,0,0,0,,不…不…这种印记是看不见的
Dialogue: 0,2:23:09.72,2:23:12.75,*CHS,1700,0,0,0,,和你的肌肤融为一体
Dialogue: 0,2:23:12.86,2:23:14.88,*CHS,1701,0,0,0,,是什么？
Dialogue: 0,2:23:15.49,2:23:19.26,*CHS,1702,0,0,0,,爱.哈利.是爱
Dialogue: 0,2:23:26.34,2:23:31.60,*CHS,1703,0,0,0,,啊…多味豆？是比比多味豆哇
Dialogue: 0,2:23:31.98,2:23:33.81,*CHS,1704,0,0,0,,我年轻那会儿…
Dialogue: 0,2:23:33.81,2:23:35.61,*CHS,1705,0,0,0,,吃过一颗呕吐口味的
Dialogue: 0,2:23:35.81,2:23:39.88,*CHS,1706,0,0,0,,真是倒霉透了 从那时候起我就对它没了好感
Dialogue: 0,2:23:39.98,2:23:43.52,*CHS,1707,0,0,0,,这回来颗太妃口味的
Dialogue: 0,2:23:43.52,2:23:45.38,*CHS,1708,0,0,0,,应该没问题
Dialogue: 0,2:23:48.93,2:23:51.92,*CHS,1709,0,0,0,,哦…我的天哪
Dialogue: 0,2:23:52.16,2:23:53.60,*CHS,1710,0,0,0,,像耳屎
Dialogue: 0,2:24:09.58,2:24:10.98,*CHS,1711,0,0,0,,还好吧.罗恩？
Dialogue: 0,2:24:11.08,2:24:13.28,*CHS,1712,0,0,0,,挺好.你呢？
Dialogue: 0,2:24:13.82,2:24:15.18,*CHS,1713,0,0,0,,还行
Dialogue: 0,2:24:15.69,2:24:16.78,*CHS,1714,0,0,0,,赫敏？
Dialogue: 0,2:24:16.89,2:24:18.55,*CHS,1715,0,0,0,,再好没有了
Dialogue: 0,2:24:22.06,2:24:24.93,*CHS,1716,0,0,0,,（斯莱特林学院）
Dialogue: 0,2:24:34.91,2:24:37.60,*CHS,1717,0,0,0,,又一学年结束了
Dialogue: 0,2:24:38.21,2:24:40.23,*CHS,1718,0,0,0,,现在又到时候啦…
Dialogue: 0,2:24:40.34,2:24:42.61,*CHS,1719,0,0,0,,该颁发学院杯了
Dialogue: 0,2:24:42.71,2:24:45.74,*CHS,1720,0,0,0,,各学院的得分如下…
Dialogue: 0,2:24:45.88,2:24:47.37,*CHS,1721,0,0,0,,第四名…
Dialogue: 0,2:24:47.49,2:24:50.85,*CHS,1722,0,0,0,,格兰芬多.总分312分
Dialogue: 0,2:24:53.52,2:24:55.36,*CHS,1723,0,0,0,,第三名…
Dialogue: 0,2:24:55.46,2:24:59.86,*CHS,1724,0,0,0,,赫奇帕奇.总分352分
Dialogue: 0,2:25:04.30,2:25:06.39,*CHS,1725,0,0,0,,位居第二的是…
Dialogue: 0,2:25:06.50,2:25:11.37,*CHS,1726,0,0,0,,拉文克劳.他们所得的分数是426分
Dialogue: 0,2:25:16.15,2:25:18.98,*CHS,1727,0,0,0,,位居榜首的是…
Dialogue: 0,2:25:19.08,2:25:21.81,*CHS,1728,0,0,0,,总分472分的
Dialogue: 0,2:25:21.92,2:25:23.75,*CHS,1729,0,0,0,,斯莱特林学院
Dialogue: 0,2:25:29.96,2:25:31.62,*CHS,1730,0,0,0,,斯莱特林学院
Dialogue: 0,2:25:36.00,2:25:38.49,*CHS,1731,0,0,0,,很好.很好.好样的.斯莱特林
Dialogue: 0,2:25:38.50,2:25:39.53,*CHS,1732,0,0,0,,好样的.斯莱特林
Dialogue: 0,2:25:39.64,2:25:40.40,*CHS,1733,0,0,0,,不过…
Dialogue: 0,2:25:40.50,2:25:44.60,*CHS,1734,0,0,0,,最近发生的事情也必须考虑进去
Dialogue: 0,2:25:44.78,2:25:49.01,*CHS,1735,0,0,0,,我还有一些最后的分数要奖励
Dialogue: 0,2:25:50.48,2:25:53.58,*CHS,1736,0,0,0,,赫敏·格兰杰小姐
Dialogue: 0,2:25:53.68,2:25:56.12,*CHS,1737,0,0,0,,当别人身陷险境
Dialogue: 0,2:25:56.22,2:25:59.52,*CHS,1738,0,0,0,,她沉着巧妙地发挥才智
Dialogue: 0,2:25:59.66,2:26:01.25,*CHS,1739,0,0,0,,奖五十分
Dialogue: 0,2:26:02.89,2:26:04.12,*CHS,1740,0,0,0,,干得好
Dialogue: 0,2:26:11.90,2:26:15.93,*CHS,1741,0,0,0,,第二项颁给罗恩·韦斯莱先生
Dialogue: 0,2:26:16.04,2:26:18.37,*CHS,1742,0,0,0,,他展现了高超的棋艺
Dialogue: 0,2:26:18.48,2:26:22.85,*CHS,1743,0,0,0,,是霍格沃茨多年来最为出色的
Dialogue: 0,2:26:22.95,2:26:24.47,*CHS,1744,0,0,0,,奖五十分
Dialogue: 0,2:26:28.42,2:26:30.85,*CHS,1745,0,0,0,,第三项…
Dialogue: 0,2:26:30.96,2:26:33.92,*CHS,1746,0,0,0,,颁给哈利·波特
Dialogue: 0,2:26:34.02,2:26:38.76,*CHS,1747,0,0,0,,表彰他的胆魄.和他那超凡的勇气
Dialogue: 0,2:26:38.86,2:26:42.30,*CHS,1748,0,0,0,,我奖给格兰芬多学院…
Dialogue: 0,2:26:42.40,2:26:44.16,*CHS,1749,0,0,0,,六十分
Dialogue: 0,2:26:52.14,2:26:54.13,*CHS,1750,0,0,0,,跟斯莱特林平了
Dialogue: 0,2:26:54.25,2:26:55.87,*CHS,1751,0,0,0,,最后还有…
Dialogue: 0,2:26:55.98,2:26:58.04,*CHS,1752,0,0,0,,对敌人坚持原则.奋力抵抗
Dialogue: 0,2:26:58.15,2:27:00.38,*CHS,1753,0,0,0,,需要勇气
Dialogue: 0,2:27:00.48,2:27:03.98,*CHS,1754,0,0,0,,而对朋友坚持原则更需要勇气
Dialogue: 0,2:27:04.42,2:27:07.58,*CHS,1755,0,0,0,,我奖励十分…
Dialogue: 0,2:27:07.69,2:27:10.29,*CHS,1756,0,0,0,,给纳威·隆巴顿
Dialogue: 0,2:27:24.21,2:27:26.90,*CHS,1757,0,0,0,,如果我的计算准确无误的话
Dialogue: 0,2:27:27.01,2:27:31.41,*CHS,1758,0,0,0,,我想.这儿的装饰就需要改变了
Dialogue: 0,2:27:37.39,2:27:41.29,*CHS,1759,0,0,0,,格兰芬多赢得了学院杯
Dialogue: 0,2:27:42.83,2:27:44.12,*CHS,1760,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,2:27:44.23,2:27:45.13,*CHS,1761,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,2:27:56.81,2:27:59.28,*CHS,1762,0,0,0,,我们赢了
Dialogue: 0,2:27:59.38,2:28:01.67,*CHS,1763,0,0,0,,我们拿到了冠军
Dialogue: 0,2:28:10.55,2:28:12.82,*CHS,1764,0,0,0,,我们赢了
Dialogue: 0,2:28:18.93,2:28:21.52,*CHS,1765,0,0,0,,好了.快点.要晚了
Dialogue: 0,2:28:22.03,2:28:24.23,*CHS,1766,0,0,0,,快点.快点.火车要开了
Dialogue: 0,2:28:24.34,2:28:25.53,*CHS,1767,0,0,0,,快点
Dialogue: 0,2:28:32.01,2:28:33.41,*CHS,1768,0,0,0,,上车吧
Dialogue: 0,2:28:33.51,2:28:34.48,*CHS,1769,0,0,0,,呃…你等等
Dialogue: 0,2:28:41.72,2:28:44.62,*CHS,1770,0,0,0,,还以为你不说再见就走了呢？
Dialogue: 0,2:28:48.83,2:28:50.45,*CHS,1771,0,0,0,,给你的
Dialogue: 0,2:29:07.24,2:29:08.58,*CHS,1772,0,0,0,,谢谢.海格
Dialogue: 0,2:29:15.19,2:29:18.09,*CHS,1773,0,0,0,,走吧.快上车.去吧.去吧
Dialogue: 0,2:29:18.19,2:29:19.85,*CHS,1774,0,0,0,,呃…听着.哈利…
Dialogue: 0,2:29:20.06,2:29:21.45,*CHS,1775,0,0,0,,如果你那个笨蛋表兄
Dialogue: 0,2:29:21.46,2:29:23.82,*CHS,1776,0,0,0,,达力再敢欺负你
Dialogue: 0,2:29:24.73,2:29:27.53,*CHS,1777,0,0,0,,你完全可以吓唬他…
Dialogue: 0,2:29:27.63,2:29:30.62,*CHS,1778,0,0,0,,这回除了尾巴.还会长两只猪耳朵
Dialogue: 0,2:29:30.73,2:29:33.36,*CHS,1779,0,0,0,,可…可是海格.出了霍格沃茨
Dialogue: 0,2:29:33.47,2:29:35.96,*CHS,1780,0,0,0,,就不许施魔法了.这你知道
Dialogue: 0,2:29:36.07,2:29:37.60,*CHS,1781,0,0,0,,知道
Dialogue: 0,2:29:37.74,2:29:40.57,*CHS,1782,0,0,0,,可你表兄不知道哇…嗯
Dialogue: 0,2:29:41.98,2:29:43.35,*CHS,1783,0,0,0,,回去吧
Dialogue: 0,2:29:46.49,2:29:49.25,*CHS,1784,0,0,0,,回家的感觉很怪吧？
Dialogue: 0,2:29:49.69,2:29:53.32,*CHS,1785,0,0,0,,不是回家.不算是
Dialogue: 0,2:30:41.67,2:30:44.90,*CHS,1786,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,2:30:45.88,2:30:48.94,*CHS,1787,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,2:30:50.11,2:30:53.24,*CHS,1788,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,2:31:43.43,2:31:45.77,*CHS,1789,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,2:31:46.80,2:31:49.03,*CHS,1790,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,2:31:50.07,2:31:52.44,*CHS,1791,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,2:31:53.44,2:31:56.07,*CHS,1792,0,0,0,,
